 Contains","value":"Secret Lair will group existing cards into small collectible sets with strange themes and wild new art styles. Drops will contain between three and seven predetermined cards and tokens in a customized collector box.\r\n<br><br>\r\nYou will receive <strong>all 7</strong> of the Secret Lair Drop Series:\r\n<br><br>\r\n• 1x Bitterblossom Dreams\r\n<br>• 1x Eldraine Wonderland\r\n<br>• 1x Restless in Peace\r\n<br>• 1x Seeing Visions\r\n<br>• 1x “explosion sounds”\r\n<br>• 1x Kaleidoscope Killers\r\n<br>• 1x OMG KITTIES!\r\n<br><em><span style=\"color:red\">The first wave of this Secret Lair Drop Series Sealed Product (shipped Dec. 2019) includes 1 of 15 possible Stained Glass Planeswalkers from WAR per Drop Series item. This card is randomized per sealed Drop Series item.</span>"}]},{"productId":207451,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Year of the Rat - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Year of the Rat Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/207451_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/207451/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-year-of-the-rat-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-23T15:47:07.58","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Get ready to ring in the Year of the Rat! Known for being quick-witted and resourceful, the clever rat is the first of the zodiac cycle. We’re celebrating the 2020 Lunar New Year with eight reveling rodents, featuring art by JungSang, Fiona Hsieh, Kisung Koh, and Jenn Ravenna. These adorable vermin will infest your deck, your collection, and your heart. \r\n<br><br>Contents: \r\n<br> \r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Marrow-Gnawer  \r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Ink-Eyes, Servant of Oni \r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Pack Rat \r\n<br>5x Foil Alt-Art Rat Colony"}]},{"productId":209379,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing: Vol.V (Nylea) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing VolV Nylea Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209379_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209379/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-volv-nylea-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:35.533","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"To you, calling upon the gods is just a game. While some of them may agree, you are nonetheless creating history. This drop holds your favorite legendary creatures at their celestial best—a must have for any true believer. Offer your devotion to the hunt, debauchery, and deadly poison with beautiful alt-art constellation gods by Jason A. Engle.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Nylea, God of the Hunt\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Xenagos, God of Revels\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Pharika, God of Affliction"}]},{"productId":209380,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing: Vol.IV (Purphoros) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing VolIV Purphoros Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209380_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209380/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-voliv-purphoros-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:32.237","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"While some stories go unrecorded, none go unseen. For when you call upon the gods, you make their legend your own. This drop holds your favorite legendary creatures at their celestial best—a must have for any true believer. Declare your devotion to the forge, storms, and slaughter with beautiful alt-art constellation gods by Jason A Engle.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Purphuros, God of the Forge\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Mogis, God of Slaughter\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Keranos, God of Storms"}]},{"productId":209381,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing: Vol.III (Erebos) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing VolIII Erebos Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209381_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209381/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-voliii-erebos-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:27.763","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Some gods hide in the shadows, hoping to keep their stories secret: countless struggles, manipulations, and intrigues. This drop holds your favorite legendary creatures at their celestial best—a must have for any true believer. Prove your devotion to death, deception, and what lies beyond the beautiful alt-art constellation gods by Jason A. Engle.\r\n<br><<br>strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Erebos, God of the Dead\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Atheros, God of Passage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Phenax, God of Deception"}]},{"productId":209382,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing: Vol.II (Thassa) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing VolII Thassa Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209382_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209382/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-volii-thassa-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:23.287","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each constellation tells a story that spans centuries, from the defeat of the titans to the threat of the Reveler. This drop holds your favorite legendary creatures at their celestial best—a must have for any true believer. Express your devotion to the sea, the city, and the horizon with beautiful alt-art constellation gods by Jason A. Engle.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Thass, God of the Sea\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Ephara, God of the Polis\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Kruphix, God of Horizons"}]},{"productId":209383,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing: Vol.I (Heliod) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing VolI Heliod Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209383_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209383/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-voli-heliod-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:20.183","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The light of Nyx shines bright in the Theros night sky, where each constellation tells a story. Still, no story is as important as that of the gods. This drop holds your favorite legendary creatures at their celestial best—a must have for any true believer. Show your devotion to the sun, the harvest, and victory with beautiful alt-art constellation gods by Jason A. Engle.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Heliod, God of the Sun\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Iroas, God of Victory\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Karametra, God of Harvest"}]},{"productId":209384,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Theros Stargazing Bundle: Vol. I-V - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Theros Stargazing Bundle Vol I V Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209384_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209384/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-theros-stargazing-bundle-vol-i-v-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T14:03:03.553","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Offer your faith to the gods and they will lend you their power in return. This bundle of all five Theros Stargazing drops contains foil versions of each of the fifteen original Theros gods, featuring beautiful alt-art constellation designs by Jason A. Engle. Show you are devoted above all others!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Theros Stargazing: Vol.I\r\n<br>• 1x Theros Stargazing: Vol.II\r\n<br>• 1x Theros Stargazing: Vol.III\r\n<br>• 1x Theros Stargazing: Vol.IV\r\n<br>• 1x Theros Stargazing: Vol.V"}]},{"productId":209937,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: International Women's Day 2020 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop International Womens Day 2020 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/209937_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/209937/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-international-womens-day-2020-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:42:46.273","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"What is International Women's Day?\r\n<br>International Women's Day (March 8) is a global day celebrating the social, economic, cultural, and political achievements of women. The day also marks a call to action for accelerating women's equality.\r\n<br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless foil of Captain Sisay with art by Magali Villeneuve\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless foil of Meren of Clan Nel Toth with art by Cynthia Sheppard\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless foil of Oona, Queen of the Fae with art by Mila Pesic\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless foil of Narset, Enlightened Master with art by Livia Prima\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless foil of Saskia the Unyielding with art by Anna Steinbauer"}]},{"productId":210001,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Thalia: Beyond the Helvault - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Thalia Beyond the Helvault Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/210001_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/210001/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-thalia-beyond-the-helvault-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:40:45.03","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Protector. Rebel. Heir. Throughout her illustrious career, Thalia’s fate has been intertwined with Innistrad’s. This drop highlights Thalia’s most pivotal events: destroying the Helvault, confronting the council, joining with the Geist of Saint Traft, and battling Brisela. To capture these moments, we called on Magali Villeneuve and Johannes Voss—the two artists who know Thalia best.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 4x Different Foil Alt-Art Thalia, Guardian of Thraben cards"}]},{"productId":213819,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Godzilla Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Godzilla Lands Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/213819_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/213819/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-godzilla-lands-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:44:55.273","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The King of Monsters has arrived! Watch Godzilla stomp through five gorgeous landscapes. Keep an eye out for special appearances by fan-favorite monsters: Mothra, Rodan, and Hedorah! This drop includes five full-art basic lands in Japanese with illustrations by Jonas De Ro, Lucas Graciano, Lars Grant-West, Jenn Ravenna, and Grzegorz Rutkowski.\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Japanese Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Japanese Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Japanese Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Japanese Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Japanese Forest\r\n<br><br>TM & © TOHO CO., LTD. ©2020\r\n<br>Wizards of the Coast LLC"}]},{"productId":214907,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop - Full Sleeves: The Tattoo Pack - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop Full Sleeves The Tattoo Pack Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214907_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214907/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-full-sleeves-the-tattoo-pack-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:18:05.483","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We sat some classic cards down in the chair, and they emerged with some rad new ink. Before you decide to purchase, your mother would like us to remind you that getting these cards is a permanent decision and that you need to consider that they will look awesome in your decks or collection forever. Tattoo master Josh Howard lent his needle to create these incredible traditional flash sheet designs—a brand-new look for Magic.<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Inkmoth Nexus\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Pithing Needle\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Eternal Witness\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Blood Artist\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Spell Pierce"}]},{"productId":214908,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop - Can You Feel with a Heart of Steel? - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop Can You Feel with a Heart of Steel Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214908_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214908/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-can-you-feel-with-a-heart-of-steel-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:16:28.757","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<em>ATTENTION MEAT CREATURES:\r\nTHE ROBOT UPRISING HAS ARRIVED, AND WE HAVE TAKEN CONTROL OF SECRETLAIR.EXE. FROM NOW ON, ALL DROPS WILL CELEBRATE THE GLORY AND POWER OF MACHINES. ADDITIONALLY, WE WILL BE ADDING A SIXTH—</em>\r\n<br>\r\n<br><em><strong>*beeeeeeow*</strong></em>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>We were… we were able to unplug them in time. But we couldn’t stop them from creating this cool robot-themed drop featuring foil full-art cards by Bad Flip Productions, Inc., Danny Miller, and Hector Ortiz. In unrelated news, Project Robobeebles will be discontinued at this time.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alternate Full-Art Walking Ballista\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alternate Full-Art Arcbound Ravager\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alternate Full-Art Darksteel Colossus"}]},{"productId":214909,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop - The Path Not Traveled - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop The Path Not Traveled Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214909_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214909/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-the-path-not-traveled-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:24:29.833","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Being a Planeswalker comes with heavy responsibilities. What would happen if our Planeswalkers decided to pack things up and do something else with their lives—or had never sparked at all? This drop explores alternate fates for Ajani, Domri, Tamiyo, and Vraska. We’ve entrusted their lives to the steady hands of Yeong-Hao Han, Chris Rallis, David Rapoza, and Mike Uziel. Maybe in yet another universe, these Planeswalkers are collecting cards of you!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x foil alt-art Ajani Steadfast\r\n<br>• 1x foil alt-art Domri Rade\r\n<br>• 1x foil alt-art Tamiyo, Field Researcher\r\n<br>• 1x foil alt-art Vraska, Golgari Queen"}]},{"productId":214910,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop - Mountain, Go - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop Mountain Go Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214910_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214910/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-mountain-go-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:22:50.337","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This drop celebrates the quintessential red spell: the humble and efficient Lightning Bolt. Whether it’s destroying your opponent’s mana dork on turn one or simply being hurled into their face, Lightning Bolt does it all, as long as “all” can be done with three direct damage. Each piece shows a different creature getting totally wrecked by the cruel and unforgiving power of nature (out of respect for the feelings of Ornithological Studies, birds will be getting a pass). These full-art foil cards feature electrifying, brand-new art by Noah Bradley, Brigitte Roka, Robbie Trevino, and Alexis Ziritt.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 4x Different foil alternate full-art Lightning Bolt cards"}]},{"productId":214911,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop - Ornithological Studies - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop Ornithological Studies Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214911_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214911/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-ornithological-studies-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:23:45.677","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Of all of Magic’s fictional creatures, birds are far and away the most popular. First invented by Richard Garfield in 1987, birds eventually made their way into Alpha via the powerful “Birds of Paradise” card. We thought it would be cool to envision what birds would look like if they existed in real life, so we commissioned some naturalistic, classical illustrations from Ovidio Cartagena and Allen Douglas.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x alt-art Baleful Strix\r\n<br>• 1x alt-art Birds of Paradise\r\n<br>• 1x alt-art Dovescape\r\n<br>• 1x alt-art Gilded Goose\r\n<br>• 1x alt-art Swan Song"}]},{"productId":214937,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/214937_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/214937/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-03-17T21:53:28.667","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each bundle contains one of each Secret Lair drop included in the Summer Superdrop:\r\n<br>• Full Sleeves: The Tattoo Pack\r\n<br>• Can You Feel with a Heart of Steel?\r\n<br>• The Path Not Traveled\r\n<br>• Mountain, Go\r\n<br>• Ornithological Studies\r\n<br><br><em>(One enemy fetch land was also included with the original Wizards of the Coast sales of this Bundle.)</em>"}]},{"productId":220991,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Prime Slime - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Prime Slime Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/220991_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/220991/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-prime-slime-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T17:47:42.423","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Sick of being early-game enemies or confined to cubes, these slimes are breaking the mold. Though you can see right through them, Wizard of Barge knows that their jiggly jelly bodies contain multitudes. Allow him to take you on an ooze cruise through FIVE different cards that explore the true nature of slimes. Just, like, bring a towel or wet naps or something.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Borderless Alt-Art Acidic Slime\r\n<br>1x Borderless Alt-Art The Mimeoplasm\r\n<br>1x Borderless Alt-Art Necrotic Ooze\r\n<br>1x Borderless Alt-Art Scavenging Ooze\r\n<br>1x Borderless Alt-Art Voidslime"}]},{"productId":221329,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Every Dog Has Its Day - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Every Dog Has Its Day Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/221329_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/221329/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-every-dog-has-its-day-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:43:35.753","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Who's a good drop? Who's a good drop? This is! We're celebrating International Dog Day 2020 with this very obedient Secret Lair Drop that features the sweetest pups we could find. If you have a deck or collection looking for four-legged friends, these cute and cuddly cards are looking for their forever home. This drop contains four housebroken cards with extremely soft and fluffy art by AlbaBG, Jakob Eirich, Steve Prescott, and Rudy Siswanto. Adopt this drop today!\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Ancient Grudge\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Dig Through Time\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Rest in Peace"}]},{"productId":221330,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Every Dog Has Its Day - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Every Dog Has Its Day Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/221330_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/221330/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-every-dog-has-its-day-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:43:27.513","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Who's a good drop? Who's a good drop? This is! We're celebrating International Dog Day 2020 with this very obedient Secret Lair Drop that features the sweetest pups we could find. If you have a deck or collection looking for four-legged friends, these cute and cuddly cards are looking for their forever home. This drop contains four housebroken cards with extremely soft and fluffy art by AlbaBG, Jakob Eirich, Steve Prescott, and Rudy Siswanto. Adopt this drop today!\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Ancient Grudge\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Dig Through Time\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Rest in Peace"}]},{"productId":221984,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Happy Yargle Day! - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Happy Yargle Day Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/221984_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/221984/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-happy-yargle-day-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:30:18.947","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"For our entire lives, we have celebrated Yargle Day every single September 3rd. This is well-known information and taught over and over again in schools, but here are a few Yargle Day reminders:\r\n<br>• If you hear footsteps on your roof, REMAIN CALM. Yargle can smell your fear.\r\n<br>• It doesn't matter if you're naughty or nice, Yargle's gaping maw is large enough to accommodate both kinds of children at once.\r\n<br>• Save your milk and cookies for December. Consider tying a goat to a fence on the outskirts of your property, and maybe he'll get full.\r\n<br>• Yargle never gets full.\r\n<br><br>It seems a single card in Dominaria was not enough to appease this beautiful, cruel spirit, so we have printed several popular cards with new art celebrating his glorious visage. We fondly remember the <s>sacrifices</s> artists who undertook this daunting challenge: Dmitry Burmak, Jehan Choo, Matt Dixon, Chuck Lukacs, and Franz Vohwinkel. May Yargle have mercy on their souls."}]},{"productId":221985,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Happy Yargle Day! - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Happy Yargle Day Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/221985_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/221985/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-happy-yargle-day-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:30:31.22","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"For our entire lives, we have celebrated Yargle Day every single September 3rd. This is well-known information and taught over and over again in schools, but here are a few Yargle Day reminders:\r\n<br>• If you hear footsteps on your roof, REMAIN CALM. Yargle can smell your fear.\r\n<br>• It doesn't matter if you're naughty or nice, Yargle's gaping maw is large enough to accommodate both kinds of children at once.\r\n<br>• Save your milk and cookies for December. Consider tying a goat to a fence on the outskirts of your property, and maybe he'll get full.\r\n<br>• Yargle never gets full.\r\n<br><br>It seems a single card in Dominaria was not enough to appease this beautiful, cruel spirit, so we have printed several popular cards with new art celebrating his glorious visage. We fondly remember the <s>sacrifices</s> artists who undertook this daunting challenge: Dmitry Burmak, Jehan Choo, Matt Dixon, Chuck Lukacs, and Franz Vohwinkel. May Yargle have mercy on their souls."}]},{"productId":222991,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Zendikar Revisited - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Zendikar Revisited Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/222991_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/222991/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-zendikar-revisited-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:59:32.257","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Welcome back to Zendikar! We’re just as excited to be here as you are, so we wanted to do a little something special to celebrate. We picked five big-time Zendikar favorites to get a brand-new look using the <em>Zendikar Rising</em> Showcase art style and frame. Matteo Bassini, Anato Finnstark, Bastien Grivet, Daniel Lieske, and Dominik Mayer partied up to really exemplify the colorful travel poster look. Let’s get ready to landfall!\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Admonition Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Roil Elemental\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Zulaport Cutthroat\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Warren Instigator\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Avenger of Zendikar"}]},{"productId":222992,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Zendikar Revisited - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Zendikar Revisited Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/222992_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/222992/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-zendikar-revisited-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:59:27.287","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Welcome back to Zendikar! We’re just as excited to be here as you are, so we wanted to do a little something special to celebrate. We picked five big-time Zendikar favorites to get a brand-new look using the <em>Zendikar Rising</em> Showcase art style and frame. Matteo Bassini, Anato Finnstark, Bastien Grivet, Daniel Lieske, and Dominik Mayer partied up to really exemplify the colorful travel poster look. Let’s get ready to landfall!\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Admonition Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Roil Elemental\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Zulaport Cutthroat\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Warren Instigator\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Avenger of Zendikar"}]},{"productId":223086,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: April Fools","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop April Fools","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/223086_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/223086/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-april-fools","modifiedOn":"2021-03-18T20:05:06.44","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<em><strong>Full Name of Drop:</strong> Wizards of the Coast Presents: After Great Deliberation, We Have Compiled and Remastered the Greatest Magic: The Gathering Cards of All Time, Ever</em>\r\n<br><br>\r\nEveryone has their favorite Magic cards—cards that remind them of the happiest moments from their childhoods, or time spent with their closest friends, or simply cards that are the coolest. And that's fantastic! However, all of you are wrong, as there can be only one correct list of the greatest Magic cards of all time.\r\n<br>We at Wizards have agonized over this, arguing and shouting and using deeply personal insults to crush the wills of those with dumb opinions. After months of R&D in-fighting, we have arrived at an undeniable list of the best Magic cards of all time. And what's more, we've somehow made them even greater with glorious brand-new foil full-art treatments."}]},{"productId":224141,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Walking Dead - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Walking Dead Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/224141_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/224141/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-walking-dead-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:32:48.053","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’ve partnered with AMC’s The Walking Dead to bring you one of the most exciting Secret Lair drops yet. It has five brand-new legends, each portraying one of our favorite TWD characters: Daryl, Glenn, Michonne, Negan, and Rick. These are unique cards you’ve never seen before, not reprints in any way, shape, or form. This drop also comes with five Zombie tokens, each an important walker from the show, and one Treasure token. We don’t plan on raising this drop back from the dead, so grab it now before we send it to rest.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>NOTE:</strong> These are brand-new cards, not reprints or part of a main set. Therefore, they’re not legal in Standard, but they’re perfect for Commander!\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>1x Foil Full-Art Daryl, Hunter of Walkers\r\n<br>1x Foil Full-Art Glenn, the Voice of Calm\r\n<br>1x Foil Full-Art Michonne, Ruthless Survivor\r\n<br>1x Foil Full-Art Negan, the Cold-Blooded\r\n<br>1x Foil Full-Art Rick, Steadfast Leader\r\n<br>5x Different Foil Walker Tokens\r\n<br>1x Foil Treasure Token\r\n<br><br><em>(Please note, the original print run of this Secret Lair, shipped by Wizards of the Coast, also contained 1x Foil Lucille.)</em>\r\n<br><br>TM & © AMC Film Holdings LLC©2020"}]},{"productId":227658,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Extra Life 2020 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Extra Life 2020 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/227658_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/227658/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-extra-life-2020-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:45:21.837","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Wizards has been a proud partner of Extra Life since 2015. Thanks to your generosity last year, we’ve been able to donate over $1,000,000 in total to this important cause. This year, the sky’s the limit! We’re donating $30 from each purchase directly to Extra Life. \r\n<br><strong>What is Extra Life?</strong>\r\n<br>Formed in 2008, Extra Life is an annual fundraising event where people from all sorts of gaming spaces come together to support Children’s Miracle Network Hospitals. 100% of all donations go directly to the hospitals involved, and it’s a great way to give to those in need through the community you love. \r\n<br>We at Wizards have agonized over this, arguing and shouting and using deeply personal insults to crush the wills of those with dumb opinions. After months of R&D in-fighting, we have arrived at an undeniable list of the best Magic cards of all time. And what's more, we've somehow made them even greater with glorious brand-new foil full-art treatments.\r\n<br><strong>What’s in the drop?</strong>\r\n<br>This drop contains powerful and beloved cards, each one celebrating children across the Multiverse. The cards are in premium foil with brand-new art by Victor Adame Minguez, Rudy Siswanto, Eric Wilkerson, and Kieran Yanner. Give back and get something special for your collection as well.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Amulet of Vigor\r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Collected Company\r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>1x Foil Alt-Art Teferi’s Protection"}]},{"productId":228709,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - No Foils, No Nonsense Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop No Foils No Nonsense Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228709_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228709/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-no-foils-no-nonsense-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-09-22T16:04:31.923","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Contains all four non-foil drops offered in this Superdrop:\r\n<br>• 1x A Box of Rocks\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Seb McKinnon\r\n<br>• 1x Happy Little Gathering\r\n<br>• 1x Party Hard, Shred Harder"}]},{"productId":228710,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Foils Forever Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Foils Forever Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228710_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228710/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-foils-forever-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-09-22T16:04:40.89","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Contains all four foil drops from this Superdrop:\r\n<br>• 1x A Box of Rocks Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Seb McKinnon Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Happy Little Gathering Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x We Hope You Like Squirrels"}]},{"productId":228711,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228711_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228711/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-09-22T16:04:52.567","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Contains one of each of the Secret Lair Drops offered in this Superdrop, from both the Foils Forever Bundle and No Foils, No Nonsense Bundle:\r\n<br>• 1x A Box of Rocks\r\n<br>• 1x A Box of Rocks Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Seb McKinnon\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Seb McKinnon Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Happy Little Gathering\r\n<br>• 1x Happy Little Gathering Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Part Hard, Shred Harder\r\n<br>• 1x We Hope You Like Squirrels"}]},{"productId":228712,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - A Box of Rocks - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop A Box of Rocks Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228712_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228712/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-a-box-of-rocks-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:47:45.33","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Mana rocks are the foundation (see what we did there?) of many games of Magic, but we never really see them get used in-world. This drop explores strange and uncanny wizards from across the Multiverse using rocks we all know and love in an atypical pop art style. This drop contains totally rockin’ art by Caramelaw, Mab Graves, Dani Pendergast, Theodoru, and Yosuke Ueno. May your fixing be as powerful as it is plentiful!\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Chromatic Lantern\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Commander’s Sphere\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Darksteel Ingot\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Gilded Lotus"}]},{"productId":228713,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - A Box of Rocks - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop A Box of Rocks Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228713_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228713/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-a-box-of-rocks-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:48:02.927","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Mana rocks are the foundation (see what we did there?) of many games of Magic, but we never really see them get used in-world. This drop explores strange and uncanny wizards from across the Multiverse using rocks we all know and love in an atypical pop art style. This drop contains totally rockin’ art by Caramelaw, Mab Graves, Dani Pendergast, Theodoru, and Yosuke Ueno. May your fixing be as powerful as it is plentiful!\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Chromatic Lantern\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Commander’s Sphere\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Darksteel Ingot\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Gilded Lotus"}]},{"productId":228714,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Artist Series: Seb McKinnon - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Artist Series Seb McKinnon Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228714_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228714/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-artist-series-seb-mckinnon-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:50:35.237","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Welcome to the first of (hopefully many!) Secret Lair's Artist Series drops where we let some of Magic's greatest artists run wild. This time, we worked with Seb McKinnon to select four cards on which he wanted to leave his mark. We then got out of his way and let him illustrate them however he wanted. After a month of radio silence, Seb emerged from the woods near Wizards HQ—clothing ragged, hair immaculate—and handed us four unbelievable pieces of art. The pieces tell the story of a knight's chance encounter with a faerie, and they are accompanied by a poem written by Seb's brother Liam McKinnon. \r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Damnation\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Enchanted Evening\r\n<br>• 1x Alt-Art Sower of Temptation\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Swamp"}]},{"productId":228715,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Artist Series: Seb McKinnon - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Artist Series Seb McKinnon Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228715_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228715/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-artist-series-seb-mckinnon-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:51:17.76","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Welcome to the first of (hopefully many!) Secret Lair's Artist Series drops where we let some of Magic's greatest artists run wild. This time, we worked with Seb McKinnon to select four cards on which he wanted to leave his mark. We then got out of his way and let him illustrate them however he wanted. After a month of radio silence, Seb emerged from the woods near Wizards HQ—clothing ragged, hair immaculate—and handed us four unbelievable pieces of art. The pieces tell the story of a knight's chance encounter with a faerie, and they are accompanied by a poem written by Seb's brother Liam McKinnon. \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Damnation\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Enchanted Evening\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Sower of Temptation\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Swamp"}]},{"productId":228716,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Happy Little Gathering - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Happy Little Gathering Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228716_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228716/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-happy-little-gathering-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:58:45.69","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This is a real special treat we have today. This drop includes ten different basic lands: that’s two Plains, two Islands, two Swamps, two Mountains, and two Forests—each one with a unique piece of art by Bob Ross. That’s ten different pieces by the patient and soft-spoken legend himself. Whether you use them to add some joy to your deck or put them on display, we know these happy little cards will be right at home in your collection.\r\n<br>• 2x Different Plains cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Island cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Swamp cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Mountain cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Forest cards with art by Bob Ross"}]},{"productId":228717,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Happy Little Gathering Foil Edition - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Happy Little Gathering Foil Edition Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228717_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228717/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-happy-little-gathering-foil-edition-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T19:59:06.117","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This is a real special treat we have today. This drop includes ten different basic lands: that’s two Plains, two Islands, two Swamps, two Mountains, and two Forests—each one with a unique piece of art by Bob Ross. That’s ten different pieces by the patient and soft-spoken legend himself. Whether you use them to add some joy to your deck or put them on display, we know these happy little cards will be right at home in your collection.\r\n<br>• 2x Different Foil Plains cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Foil Island cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Foil Swamp cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Foil Mountain cards with art by Bob Ross\r\n<br>• 2x Different Foil Forest cards with art by Bob Ross"}]},{"productId":228718,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - Party Hard, Shred Harder - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop Party Hard Shred Harder Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228718_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228718/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-party-hard-shred-harder-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:00:21.747","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Here it is: the heaviest, crushingest, most brutal Secret Lair drop of all time. We picked five cards with the most metal names possible and turned them into Hand-Drawn breakdowns. These cards are so incomparably sick that the mere thought of Thraximundar makes our feet unconsciously start to air double bass. This drop would not have been possible without a supergroup of talented artists: Scott Buoncristiano, Illustranesia, Vance Kelly, Robbie Trevino, and Rafal Wechterowicz (Too Many Skulls).\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-Drawn Anguished Unmaking\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-Drawn Assassin’s Trophy\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-Drawn Decimate\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-Drawn Dreadbore\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-Drawn Thraximundar"}]},{"productId":228719,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop - We Hope You Like Squirrels - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop We Hope You Like Squirrels Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228719_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228719/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-we-hope-you-like-squirrels-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:01:11.853","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"They said we were mad. They said we were spouting nonsense. Spreading fear, hysteria, paranoia! But the squirrels, you see, the squirrels are planning something. Don’t believe us? Look at these cards! You think these are soft, fuzzy, friendly creatures? Sure, they might look cute, but it’s all an act to get us to let our guards down. (Between you and us, we think that illustrators Puffygator, Joy Ang, Carl Critchlow, Ivan Shavrin, Rudy Siswanto, and Ron Spencer might be on their side. Look how awesome this art is; they’re clearly double agents!)\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Chatter of the Squirrel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Krosan Beast\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Squirrel Mob\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Squirrel Wrangler\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Swarmyard\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Squirrel Token"}]},{"productId":232573,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Black is Magic - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Black is Magic Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232573_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232573/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-black-is-magic-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:57:26.24","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Black History Month celebrates Black history and honors the stories, culture, and achievements of Black people. The Black Is Magic drop celebrates and supports different expressions of Black identity.\r\n<br>Each card was illustrated by a Black artist who brought their unique art style to the drop. Ernanda Souza interprets Shalai, Voice of Plenty as a guardian angel who protects and shields the people. Ejiwa 'Edge' Ebenebe gives us a Ponder that honors elders and African spiritual tradition. Hillary Wilson illustrates Cultivate, a card that acknowledges the need for the past and present to reconcile for a healthier future. Dani Pendergast depicts a moment of calm for Magic's first Black female Planeswalker, Kaya, Ghost Assassin, directly after the War of the Spark. KNIIO celebrates the joys of Black fatherhood by showing us a rare moment in the life of Teferi, Hero of Dominaria. Thomas Zenteno shows us a Sol Ring unlike any other, drawing inspiration from the beautiful jewelry tradition of the Maasai tribe. And finally, Julio Reyna honors the child in all of us with Path of Ancestry, reflecting on Magic's Black history and its origins in Jamuraa."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166132983"}]},{"productId":232574,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Black is Magic - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Black is Magic Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232574_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232574/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-black-is-magic-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:57:21.56","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Black History Month celebrates Black history and honors the stories, culture, and achievements of Black people. The Black Is Magic drop celebrates and supports different expressions of Black identity.\r\n<br>Each card was illustrated by a Black artist who brought their unique art style to the drop. Ernanda Souza interprets Shalai, Voice of Plenty as a guardian angel who protects and shields the people. Ejiwa 'Edge' Ebenebe gives us a Ponder that honors elders and African spiritual tradition. Hillary Wilson illustrates Cultivate, a card that acknowledges the need for the past and present to reconcile for a healthier future. Dani Pendergast depicts a moment of calm for Magic's first Black female Planeswalker, Kaya, Ghost Assassin, directly after the War of the Spark. KNIIO celebrates the joys of Black fatherhood by showing us a rare moment in the life of Teferi, Hero of Dominaria. Thomas Zenteno shows us a Sol Ring unlike any other, drawing inspiration from the beautiful jewelry tradition of the Maasai tribe. And finally, Julio Reyna honors the child in all of us with Path of Ancestry, reflecting on Magic's Black history and its origins in Jamuraa."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166109763"}]},{"productId":232596,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Faerie, Faerie, Faerie Rad - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Faerie Faerie Faerie Rad Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232596_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232596/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-faerie-faerie-faerie-rad-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:49:12.517","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Think these are your average faeries? As if! While most faeries flutter about, only these faeries are totally fly. Boasting a 90’s-tacular rainbow palette, each foil faerie features hella awesome art by Maria Abagnale, Jen Bartel, Rian Gonzales, and Maria Poliakova. Have a problem with the way they do things? You can talk to their hands, because these antennae are not listening."}]},{"productId":232597,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232597_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232597/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-unfathomable-crushing-brutality-of-basic-lands-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T13:52:18.57","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We are Secret Lair, and we are here to teach you the true meaning of brutality. You think creatures are brutal? Creatures are nothing. You think kill spells are brutal? Removal is a child’s plaything. Only one type of card is truly brutal and truly metal. And that card is the basic land. Look at these full-art basic lands by Mark Riddick and understand that you know nothing of brutality. Mark knows everything. With these lands in your possession, your education will begin. Prepare to be born anew…\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Full-Art Forest"}]},{"productId":232598,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232598_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232598/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-unfathomable-crushing-brutality-of-basic-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T13:52:28.957","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We are Secret Lair, and we are here to teach you the true meaning of brutality. You think creatures are brutal? Creatures are nothing. You think kill spells are brutal? Removal is a child’s plaything. Only one type of card is truly brutal and truly metal. And that card is the basic land. Look at these full-art basic lands by Mark Riddick and understand that you know nothing of brutality. Mark knows everything. With these lands in your possession, your education will begin. Prepare to be born anew…\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Island\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Forest"}]},{"productId":232599,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Valentine's Day 2021 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Valentines Day 2021 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232599_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232599/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-valentines-day-2021-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:43:01.85","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This year, we at Secret Lair only have one question for you: Will you be our Valentine? We don’t have any chocolates because we ate them all, but we do have these delightful Valentine’s Day cards with equally delightful art by Brandi Milne. These foil red and white cards (because that makes pink, get it?) will add some romance to your games. Even though they might empty your opponents’ life totals, their hearts will be full.\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Boros Charm\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Gisela, Blade of Goldnight\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Goblin Rabblemaster\r\n<br>• <s>1x Foil Borderless Heliod, Sun-Crowned</s>** <span style=\"color:red\"><strong>(**Please note that due to technical issues at Wizards of the Coast, all Heliod, Sun-Crowned cards were omitted from this Sealed Secret Lair drop, and will be shipped out to those who purchased direct from Wizards at a later date.)</strong></span>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Monastery Swiftspear\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Goblin Token"}]},{"productId":232600,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Valentine's Day 2021 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Valentines Day 2021 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232600_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232600/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-valentines-day-2021-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:43:08.61","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This year, we at Secret Lair only have one question for you: Will you be our Valentine? We don’t have any chocolates because we ate them all, but we do have these delightful Valentine’s Day cards with equally delightful art by Brandi Milne. These foil red and white cards (because that makes pink, get it?) will add some romance to your games. Even though they might empty your opponents’ life totals, their hearts will be full.\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Boros Charm\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Gisela, Blade of Goldnight\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Goblin Rabblemaster\r\n<br>• <s>1x Borderless Heliod, Sun-Crowned</s>** <span style=\"color:red\"><strong>(**Please note that due to technical issues at Wizards of the Coast, all Heliod, Sun-Crowned cards were omitted from this Sealed Secret Lair drop, and will be shipped out to those who purchased direct from Wizards at a later date.)</strong></span>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Monastery Swiftspear\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin Token"}]},{"productId":232601,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Kaldheim - Part 1 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Kaldheim Part 1 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232601_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232601/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-kaldheim-part-1-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:19:40.913","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The forests of Littjara are typically still and peaceful, but today they jump and shudder like a drying machine set to max. It is no shapeshifter that causes the trees to do their best impression of an airport massage chair—it’s an army of giants unlike Kaldheim has ever seen. Stomp your opponents with these green and blue titans that feature Kaldheim’s unique showcase frame and art by WolfSkullJack, Christopher Lovell, and Richard Luong. They’re large, in charge, and everybody else better watch out!\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Frost Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Primeval Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Uro, Titan of Nature’s Wrath"}]},{"productId":232602,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Kaldheim - Part 1 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Kaldheim Part 1 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232602_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232602/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-kaldheim-part-1-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:19:47.64","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The forests of Littjara are typically still and peaceful, but today they jump and shudder like a drying machine set to max. It is no shapeshifter that causes the trees to do their best impression of an airport massage chair—it’s an army of giants unlike Kaldheim has ever seen. Stomp your opponents with these green and blue titans that feature Kaldheim’s unique showcase frame and art by WolfSkullJack, Christopher Lovell, and Richard Luong. They’re large, in charge, and everybody else better watch out!\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Frost Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Primeval Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Uro, Titan of Nature’s Wrath"}]},{"productId":232603,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Kaldheim - Part 2 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Kaldheim Part 2 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232603_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232603/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-kaldheim-part-2-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:19:58.89","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The burning tar oceans of Immersturm are restless. They pop and bubble like, uh, well exactly like hot tar, but like, way more than usual. Three massive figures emerge from the depths, capsizing a boat of demons into the scorching sea (don’t worry, they were all jerks). Kaldheim has giants, but none like this. Stomp your opponents with these foil black and red titans that feature Kaldheim’s unique showcase frame and art by DZO, GodMachine, and Dibujante Nocturno. They’re large, in charge, and everybody else better watch out!\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Grave Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Inferno Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Showcase Kroxa, Titan of Death’s Hunger"}]},{"productId":232604,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Kaldheim - Part 2 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Kaldheim Part 2 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/232604_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/232604/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-kaldheim-part-2-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:20:04.973","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The burning tar oceans of Immersturm are restless. They pop and bubble like, uh, well exactly like hot tar, but like, way more than usual. Three massive figures emerge from the depths, capsizing a boat of demons into the scorching sea (don’t worry, they were all jerks). Kaldheim has giants, but none like this. Stomp your opponents with these foil black and red titans that feature Kaldheim’s unique showcase frame and art by DZO, GodMachine, and Dibujante Nocturno. They’re large, in charge, and everybody else better watch out!\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Grave Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Inferno Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Kroxa, Titan of Death’s Hunger"}]},{"productId":233762,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Smitten Superdrop: All-Our-Love Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Smitten Superdrop All Our Love Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/233762_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/233762/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-smitten-superdrop-all-our-love-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-09-22T16:32:13.947","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Smitten Superdrop has a lot of drops to love. If your passion for Secret Lair knows no bounds, look no further than the All-Our-Love Bundle. Inside you’ll find one of every drop in the Smitten Superdrop, in both foil and non–foil (where applicable). If you don’t want to miss a thing, you absolutely don’t want to miss this crush-worthy collection.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• 1x Faerie, Faerie, Faerie Rad\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Kaldheim – Part 1\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Kaldheim – Part 1 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Kaldheim – Part 2\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Kaldheim – Part 2 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands\r\n<br>• 1x The Unfathomable Crushing Brutality of Basic Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Valentine’s Day 2021**\r\n<br>• 1x Valentine’s Day 2021 Foil Edition**"}]},{"productId":237604,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Culture Shocks: Bant - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Culture Shocks Bant Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237604_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237604/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-culture-shocks-bant-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:54:33.353","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Multiverse of Magic is home to a wide variety of strange and beautiful planes. In this series of Culture Shocks drops, we picked ten planes to visit and celebrate with brand-new shock land art. This drop, in green, white, and blue, visits Kylem, New Phyrexia, and Theros and is lovingly brought to life by Aleksi Briclot, Ruxing Gao, and Tyler Jacobson.\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Breeding Pool\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Hallowed Fountain\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Temple Garden"}]},{"productId":237605,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Culture Shocks: Esper - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Culture Shocks Esper Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237605_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237605/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-culture-shocks-esper-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:54:40.747","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Multiverse of Magic is home to a wide variety of strange and beautiful planes. In this series of Culture Shocks drops, we picked ten planes to visit and celebrate with brand-new shock land art. This drop, in white, blue, and black, visits Amonkhet, Kylem, and Ixalan and is lovingly brought to life by Alayna Danner, Ruxing Gao, and Victor Adame Minguez.\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Godless Shrine\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Hallowed Fountain\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Watery Grave"}]},{"productId":237606,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Culture Shocks: Grixis - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Culture Shocks Grixis Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237606_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237606/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-culture-shocks-grixis-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:54:49.59","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Multiverse of Magic is home to a wide variety of strange and beautiful planes. In this series of Culture Shocks drops, we picked ten planes to visit and celebrate with brand-new shock land art. This drop, in red, black, and blue, visits Dominaria, Innistrad, and Ixalan and is lovingly brought to life by John Avon, Seb McKinnon, and Victor Adame Minguez.\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Blood Crypt\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Steam Vents\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Watery Grave"}]},{"productId":237607,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Culture Shocks: Jund - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Culture Shocks Jund Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237607_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237607/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-culture-shocks-jund-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:54:58.37","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Multiverse of Magic is home to a wide variety of strange and beautiful planes. In this series of Culture Shocks drops, we picked ten planes to visit and celebrate with brand-new shock land art. This drop, in green, red, and black, visits Fiora, Innistrad, and Tarkir and is lovingly brought to life by Daarken, Seb McKinnon, and Adam Paquette.\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Blood Crypt\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Overgrown Tomb\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Stomping Grounds"}]},{"productId":237608,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Culture Shocks: Naya - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Culture Shocks Naya Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237608_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237608/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-culture-shocks-naya-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-05-06T11:35:36.257","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Multiverse of Magic is home to a wide variety of strange and beautiful planes. In this series of Culture Shocks drops, we picked ten planes to visit and celebrate with brand-new shock land art. This drop, in red, green, and white, visits Kaladesh, Tarkir and Theros, and is lovingly brought to life by Daarken, Tyler Jacobson, and Magali Villeneuve.\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Sacred Foundry\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Stomping Grounds\r\n<br>• 1x Alternate-art Temple Garden"}]},{"productId":237609,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The Full-Text Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Full Text Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237609_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237609/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-full-text-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:02:47.67","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The lands of Magic are known for their beautiful sweeping landscapes and awe-inspiring exotic locales. Fie on that we say. Fie! Too long has gorgeous art gotten in the way of the most exciting part of the game: an extremely detailed rules system dictating exactly how to play! Featuring art by ABSOLUTELY NOBODY, these full-text lands are a deep dive into the inner machinery of basic lands. Express your love for rules and literally nothing else with the most informative lands the game has ever seen!\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Island\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Forest"}]},{"productId":237610,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The Full-Text Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Full Text Lands Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237610_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237610/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-full-text-lands-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:02:36.473","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The lands of Magic are known for their beautiful sweeping landscapes and awe-inspiring exotic locales. Fie on that we say. Fie! Too long has gorgeous art gotten in the way of the most exciting part of the game: an extremely detailed rules system dictating exactly how to play! Featuring art by ABSOLUTELY NOBODY, these full-text lands are a deep dive into the inner machinery of basic lands. Express your love for rules and literally nothing else with the most informative lands the game has ever seen!\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Island\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Forest"}]},{"productId":237611,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: OUR SHOW IS ON FRIDAY, CAN YOU MAKE IT? - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop OUR SHOW IS ON FRIDAY CAN YOU MAKE IT Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237611_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237611/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-our-show-is-on-friday-can-you-make-it-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:56:35.057","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Hey, dude. So, like, we have a show down at the Rakdos Carnarium this Friday, and it would be super cool if you could come out. Oh no, Fblthp's already working the merch table, we don't need you for that. It would just be cool to see you like, out in the crowd, y'know? You get hyped, the people around you get hyped—everyone's having a good time. Who else is playing? Oh, you know. Just some cool hand-drawn cards by Ian Jepson, Sam McKenzie, Jermaine Rogers, Jeff Soto, and Alexis Ziritt. So, you're coming? Great! Do you think you could help us load in? Wait, where are you going?\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-drawn Decree of Pain\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-drawn Gamble\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-drawn Nature's Lore\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-drawn Preordain\r\n<br>• 1x Hand-drawn Wrath of God"}]},{"productId":237612,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Showcase: Strixhaven - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Showcase Strixhaven Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237612_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237612/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-showcase-strixhaven-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:59:12.893","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"At the heart of Strixhaven University lies the Biblioplex, a massive library packed with ancient scrolls and arcane tomes. One of its impossibly large wings is the Mystical Archive, said to contain a copy of every spell ever created in the Multiverse. While you may have seen a glimpse of its contents in the Strixhaven set, it holds countless more secrets within. This drop contains six more spells featuring the showcase Mystical Archive frame, brought to life by Rovina Cai, Anato Finnstark, Justin & Alexis Hernandez, Minttu Hynninen, and Dominik Mayer.\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase All is Dust\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Artifact Mutation\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Drown in the Loch\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fire Covenant\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fractured Identity\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fracturing Gust"}]},{"productId":237613,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Showcase: Strixhaven - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Showcase Strixhaven Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237613_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237613/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-showcase-strixhaven-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:59:02.62","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"At the heart of Strixhaven University lies the Biblioplex, a massive library packed with ancient scrolls and arcane tomes. One of its impossibly large wings is the Mystical Archive, said to contain a copy of every spell ever created in the Multiverse. While you may have seen a glimpse of its contents in the Strixhaven set, it holds countless more secrets within. This drop contains six more spells featuring the showcase Mystical Archive frame, brought to life by Rovina Cai, Anato Finnstark, Justin & Alexis Hernandez, Minttu Hynninen, and Dominik Mayer.\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase All is Dust\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Artifact Mutation\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Drown in the Loch\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fire Covenant\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fractured Identity\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase Fracturing Gust"}]},{"productId":237614,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Supershock Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Supershock Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237614_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237614/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-supershock-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:01:34.767","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Explore countless corners of the Multiverse (okay, ten) with this bundle of all five shock land drops. Fantastic color-fixing is at your fingertips!\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Bant\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Esper\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Grixis\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Jund\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Naya"}]},{"productId":237615,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Voracious Reader Bundle - Non-foil","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Voracious Reader Bundle Non foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237615_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237615/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-voracious-reader-bundle-non-foil","modifiedOn":"2021-12-13T14:15:39.257","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Text lovers rejoice! Significantly increase the word count of your collection with ten copies of The Full-Text Lands Secret Lair drop! That's ten copies of each basic land in their long-winded glory. It's okay if you can't find the words to describe your joy—you'll have plenty in the future.\r\n<br>• 10x The Full-Text Lands - Non-foil"}]},{"productId":237616,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: Voracious Reader Bundle - Foil","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop Voracious Reader Bundle Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237616_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237616/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-voracious-reader-bundle-foil","modifiedOn":"2021-12-13T14:15:35.18","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Text lovers rejoice! Significantly increase the word count of your collection with ten copies of The Full-Text Lands Secret Lair drop! That's ten copies of each basic land in their long-winded glory. It's okay if you can't find the words to describe your joy—you'll have plenty in the future.\r\n<br>• 10x The Full-Text Lands - Foil"}]},{"productId":237617,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The Main Event Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Main Event Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/237617_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/237617/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-main-event-bundle","modifiedOn":"2021-12-13T14:15:27.453","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Friends, this is what you've come to see: one of each of Dr. Lair's finest exhibits. This bundle has it all. Each drop, in both foil and non-foil (when available) for you to keep. Such splendors, available for your own home and collection! Behold:\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Bant\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Esper\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Grixis\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Jund\r\n<br>• 1x Culture Shocks: Naya\r\n<br>• 1x The Full-Text Lands\r\n<br>• 1x The Full-Text Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Our Show Is on Friday, Can You Make It?\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Strixhaven\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Strixhaven Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":242338,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Saturday Morning D&D - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Saturday Morning DandD Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242338_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242338/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-saturday-morning-dandd-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:00:48.2","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"It’s 1983. It’s Saturday morning. You douse a bowl of sugary cereal with a splash of milk, then run over to the TV. (You try not spill, but you spill a little anyway. Someone else will get that.) After fiddling with the dials, you tune in for the first ever episode of the Dungeons & Dragons TV show. Cartoon scientist and skilled artist Tyler Walpole has successfully distilled that feeling into Magic art. Just look at these things, they’re spot on! Whether you’re a fan of D&D, a fan of Magic, or just a fan of fun, you’ll find what you’re looking for in this drop\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Commander’s Sphere Foil Edition \r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Hero’s Downfall Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Impact Tremors Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Primal Vigor Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Unbreakable Formation Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless 