Wasteland"}]},{"productId":242342,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Fiona Staples - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Fiona Staples Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242342_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242342/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-fiona-staples-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:00:14.277","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"You would not believe what Fiona Staples said when we asked her if she wanted to illustrate a Secret Lair Drop. She said, “Yes.” Well, since you’re looking at this product page you probably believe it pretty easily, but we still think we’re dreaming. The Fiona Staples, award-winning comic book artist known for her emotive art and compelling characters, has entered the Magic arena! (Not that one.) She directed her unbelievable reserves of talent towards five sweet cards—cards that can be yours, right now.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Dryad of the Ilysian Grove Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Metallic Mimic Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Sakura-Tribe Elder Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Soul-Scar Mage Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Spell Queller Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":242343,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Jen Bartel - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Jen Bartel Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242343_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242343/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-jen-bartel-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:01:14.733","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Jen Bartel is here, and she means business. She honed her skills on the mean streets of multiple major comic companies, and now she’s come for Magic. When she karate-kicked the doors to Wizards HQ wide open, she immediately charged the artist pit. But it wasn’t ‘til she performed at least six different judo throws on several perplexed staff members that she told us what she wanted: her own Secret Lair Drop. We immediately acquiesced—partially out of fear, but mostly out of a deep respect for her ridiculous talent. She immediately put her award-winning skills to work. Several weeks later, a flaming arrow crashed through the window of our boss’s office, immolating a carefully manicured fern. \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Archaeomancer Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Bloom Tender Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Mesa Enchantress Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Meteor Golem Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":242344,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Jen Bartel - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Jen Bartel Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242344_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242344/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-jen-bartel-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:01:19.577","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Jen Bartel is here, and she means business. She honed her skills on the mean streets of multiple major comic companies, and now she’s come for Magic. When she karate-kicked the doors to Wizards HQ wide open, she immediately charged the artist pit. But it wasn’t ‘til she performed at least six different judo throws on several perplexed staff members that she told us what she wanted: her own Secret Lair Drop. We immediately acquiesced—partially out of fear, but mostly out of a deep respect for her ridiculous talent. She immediately put her award-winning skills to work. Several weeks later, a flaming arrow crashed through the window of our boss’s office, immolating a carefully manicured fern. \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Archaeomancer\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Bloom Tender\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Mesa Enchantress\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Meteor Golem"}]},{"productId":242345,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Phyrexian Praetors: Compleat Edition - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Phyrexian Praetors Compleat Edition Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242345_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242345/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-phyrexian-praetors-compleat-edition-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:48:29.01","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Glory to Phyrexia! Celebrate the Praetors’ inevitable victory over the rest of the Multiverse with these five terrifyingly awesome reprints. This is each of the original Praetor cards, lovingly restored to the original Phyrexian they were written in when we found them in a pool of a viscous black fluid that had begun to seep out of the haunted R&D mini fridge. For good measure, we’ve placed them in the new legendary Praetor frame that debuted with Kaldheim. It’s never too early to suck up to your future monstrous overlords.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x PhyrexianElesh Norn, Grand Cenobite Foil Edition \r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Jin-Gitaxias, Core Augur Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Sheoldred, Whispering One Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Urabrask the Hidden 