isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’re celebrating Mother’s Day with a tribute to Magic’s favorite mom: Mother of Runes. We brought in four different artists to give their own take on motherhood. You can feel the affection and protection in both Ejiwa “Edge” Ebenebe’s and Livia Prima’s gorgeous pieces. Real-life mother and child Rebecca Guay and Eliette Mitchell both created poignant pieces from different sides of the relationship. (And yes, you read that correctly. Rebecca Guay is back, too!)\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 4x different Borderless Mother of Runes (Foil)"}]},{"productId":242348,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Mother's Day 2021 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Mothers Day 2021 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242348_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242348/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-mothers-day-2021-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:33:12.537","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’re celebrating Mother’s Day with a tribute to Magic’s favorite mom: Mother of Runes. We brought in four different artists to give their own take on motherhood. You can feel the affection and protection in both Ejiwa “Edge” Ebenebe’s and Livia Prima’s gorgeous pieces. Real-life mother and child Rebecca Guay and Eliette Mitchell both created poignant pieces from different sides of the relationship. (And yes, you read that correctly. Rebecca Guay is back, too!)\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 4x different Borderless Mother of Runes"}]},{"productId":242349,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dan Frazier is Back: The Allied Signets - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dan Frazier is Back The Alli