ngeance. \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Boros Signet Foil Etched \r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Golgari Signet Foil Etched\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Izzet Signet Foil Etched\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Orzhov Signet Foil Etched\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Simic Signet Foil Etched"}]},{"productId":242352,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dan Frazier is Back: The Enemy Signets - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dan Frazier is Back The Enemy Signets Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242352_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242352/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dan-frazier-is-back-the-enemy-signets-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:53:32.233","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"You can’t spell “classic Magic art” without “Dan Frazier.” Ok, you caught us. You can. But metaphorically, you absolutely cannot. The man is a bastion of old school art, having illustrated the original moxen and countless more.?So, when we decided we wanted to celebrate Modern Horizons 2 with some Old Frame cards, we knew exactly who to call. Dan went above and beyond, illustrating the enemy signets as if the guilds were conceived almost 30 years ago. Some parts will look familiar. Others will not. Only one thing is for sure: Dan Frazier is back with a vengeance.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Boros Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Golgari Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Izzet Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Orzhov Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Old Frame Simic Signet"}]},{"productId":242353,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Fiona Staples - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Fiona Staples Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242353_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,