S</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Mark Poole \r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Mark Poole Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Allied Signets\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Allied Signets Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Enemy Signets\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Enemy Signets Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Mother’s Day 2021\r\n<br>• 1x Mother’s Day 2021 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Praetors: Compleat Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Praetors: Compleat Edition Foil Edition \r\n<br>• 1x Saturday Morning D&D\r\n<br>• 1x Saturday Morning D&D Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Fiona Staples\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Fiona Staples Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Jen Bartel\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Jen Bartel Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":242355,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: All-Natural - Foil","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop All Natural Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242355_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242355/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-all-natural-foil","modifiedOn":"2021-12-13T14:09:15.567","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Take a big sip of all the foil drops in the All-Natural, Totally Refreshing Superdrop. All the drops come in foil, so you won’t miss a thing. Beat the heat with these shiny drops!\r\n<br><br><strong>CONTENTS</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Mark Poole Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Allied Signets Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Enemy Signets Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Mother’s Day 2021 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Praetors: Compleat Edition Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Saturday Morning D&D Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Fiona Staples Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Jen Bartel Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":242356,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Totally Refreshing - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Totally Refreshing Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242356_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/242356/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-totally-refreshing-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:35:24.54","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Take a big sip of all the non-foil drops in the All-Natural, Totally Refreshing Superdrop. All the drops come in non-foil, so you won’t miss a thing. Beat the heat with these delicious drops!\r\n<br><br><strong>CONTENTS</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Mark Poole \r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Allied Signets \r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back: The Enemy Signets\r\n<br>• 1x Mother’s Day 2021 \r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Praetors: Compleat Edition \r\n<br>• 1x Saturday Morning D&D \r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Fiona Staples\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Jen Bartel"}]},{"productId":244977,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Valentine's Day 2021 - Replacement Heliod Pack - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Valentines Day 2021 Replacement Heliod Pack Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/244977_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/244977/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-valentines-day-2021-replacement-heliod-pack-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:43:45.173","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Due to a technical issue, Heliod, Sun-Crowned was omitted from the product Secret Lair: Valentine’s Day 2021. \r\n<br>This replacement pack from Wizards of the Coast contains:\r\n<br>• 1 (one) Heliod, Sun-Crowned \r\n<br>• 5 (five) Goblin tokens (from Secret Lair: Valentine’s Day 2021)"}]},{"productId":244978,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Valentine's Day 2021 - Replacement Heliod Pack - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Valentines Day 2021 Replacement Heliod Pack Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/244978_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/244978/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-valentines-day-2021-replacement-heliod-pack-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:43:28.95","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Due to a technical issue, Heliod, Sun-Crowned was omitted from the product Secret Lair: Valentine’s Day 2021. \r\n<br>This replacement pack from Wizards of the Coast contains:\r\n<br>• 1 (one) foil Heliod, Sun-Crowned \r\n<br>• 5 (five) foil Goblin tokens (from Secret Lair: Valentine’s Day 2021)"}]},{"productId":247330,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The World's Bundliest Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Worlds Bundliest Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247330_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247330/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-worlds-bundliest-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:53:51.977","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’re all familiar with the classic parable of the Bundler’s Dilemma. A woman is walking through the woods when she accidentally drops her Secret Lair Superdrop bundle in a nearby lake. A spirit emerges holding two bundles, one Foil and the other Non-foil. The spirit asks the woman which bundle she dropped, and then she gets a gold axe or something? It’s been a while since I’ve heard this one actually but the whole point is that you, unlike the poor sucker in this story, don’t have to choose. With The World’s Bundliest Bundle, you get both bundles available! \r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>CONTENTS:</em></strong>\r\n<br>• 1x The World’s Foil-est Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x The World’s Non-foil-est Bundle\r\n<br><em>*Unless otherwise stated, all printed \"Secret Lair\" drops are English language."}]},{"productId":247334,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The World's Foil-est Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Worlds Foil est Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247334_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247334/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-worlds-foil-est-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:54:34.863","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Much like the humble magpie, you prefer the shiny things in life. Although, honestly, have you ever met a humble magpie? Those things are always flying through the air, stealing our good china, and screaming their horrible bird noises all through the sky as if they were mad at every airplane. And we just let them get away with this because they’re not smart enough to file taxes? We think enough is enough. It’s time for a change. We’re renaming magpies punkbirds and will be taking no questions at this time. Take one of every foil drop on offer instead. \r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>CONTENTS:</em></strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Johannes Voss Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Thomas Baxa Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Kamigawa Ink Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Math is for Blockers Foil Edition\r\n<br><em>*Unless otherwise stated, all printed \"Secret Lair\" drops are English language."}]},{"productId":247335,"name":"Secret Lair Superdrop: The World's Non-foil-est Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Superdrop The Worlds Non foil est Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247335_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247335/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-superdrop-the-worlds-non-foil-est-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:55:11.143","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"At Secret Lair, we have more than just an excellent bundle that includes all five non-foil drops that are part of the Out of Time Superdrop. We’re also the world’s largest depository of secrets, which is really obvious if you look at our name. We know all kinds of stuff, like which deodorant Bigfoot uses or what brand of conditioner Bigfoot uses. Ok, so most of our secrets are about Bigfoot’s hygiene regimen, but some of those secrets are so haunting they will send you to an early grave. Do you want to know how long Bigfoot spends brushing his teeth each morning? Are you ready to Face the Consequences? The answer is two minutes, exactly as recommended by the Supreme Council of Dentists… WHO ARE ALL BIGFOOTS. TWIST!  \r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>CONTENTS:</em></strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Johannes Voss\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Thomas Baxa\r\n<br>• 1x Kamigawa Ink\r\n<br>• 1x Math is for Blockers\r\n<br>• 1x Teferi’s Time Trouble\r\n<br><em>*Unless otherwise stated, all printed \"Secret Lair\" drops are English language.</em>"}]},{"productId":247336,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Kamigawa Ink - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Kamigawa Ink Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247336_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247336/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kamigawa-ink-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:54:00.057","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Kamigawa is an ancient plane packed with centuries of history. Experience its rich stories through the unparalleled brushwork of the artist JungShan! Traditional Japanese brushwork meets classic Magic story—it’s the perfect way to class up your deck or collection. Reki’s ink has nothing on this pack! \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong></strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Heartless Hidetsugu Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Kami of the Crescent Moon Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Michiko Konda, Truth Seeker Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Reki, the History of Kamigawa Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Toshiro Umezawa Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":247338,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Kamigawa Ink - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Kamigawa Ink Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247338_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247338/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kamigawa-ink-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:52:55.357","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Kamigawa is an ancient plane packed with centuries of history. Experience its rich stories through the unparalleled brushwork of the artist JungShan! Traditional Japanese brushwork meets classic Magic story—it’s the perfect way to class up your deck or collection. Reki’s ink has nothing on this pack! \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong></strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Heartless Hidetsugu \r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Kami of the Crescent Moon \r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Michiko Konda, Truth Seeker \r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Reki, the History of Kamigawa\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Toshiro Umezawa"}]},{"productId":247340,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Teferi's Time Trouble - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Teferis Time Trouble Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247340_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247340/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-teferis-time-trouble-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:28:01.987","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Teferi here. I may have made a little mistake. Honestly, it could happen to anyone. You know when you’re testing out a new kind of time magic,and you accidentally create an unstable time warp? Relatable, I’m sure. Now I’m stuck in the past with Dack and Karn, and we’re in retro frames! Also, our rules text is… different—like it was written almost 30 years ago. At least we’re illustrated by classic Magic artists Adam Rex, Greg Staples, and Mark Zug—something went right. I can’t imagine we’ll be here for long, so act fast if you want to preserve this moment in time! \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Dack Fayden\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Karn, the Great Creator\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Teferi, Time Raveler"}]},{"productId":247341,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Johannes Voss - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Johannes Voss Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247341_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247341/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-johannes-voss-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:24:02.8","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Here’s the thing about Johannes Voss: he is really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really talented. And he’s a double threat, too—these cards come together to tell a story and feature a poem written by the man himself. Honestly, it’s kind of messed up that he’s hogging all this talent for himself, but we’ll let it slide because he’s so dang nice. These gorgeous cards will add a pop of color to any deck or collection. Do it for Johannes; he’d do the same for you! \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Sanctum Prelate Foil Edition\r\n<br>•1x Carpet of Flowers Foil Edition\r\n<br>•1x Sphere of Safety Foil Edition\r\n<br>•1x Karmic Guide Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":247343,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Johannes Voss - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Johannes Voss Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247343_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247343/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-johannes-voss-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:22:58.413","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Here’s the thing about Johannes Voss: he is really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really talented. And he’s a double threat, too—these cards come together to tell a story and feature a poem written by the man himself. Honestly, it’s kind of messed up that he’s hogging all this talent for himself, but we’ll let it slide because he’s so dang nice. These gorgeous cards will add a pop of color to any deck or collection. Do it for Johannes; he’d do the same for you! \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Sanctum Prelate \r\n<br>•1x Carpet of Flowers \r\n<br>•1x Sphere of Safety \r\n<br>•1x Karmic Guide"}]},{"productId":247344,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Thomas Baxa - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Thomas Baxa Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247344_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247344/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-thomas-baxa-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:47:45.533","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’re not upset that Thomas Baxa reached directly into our subconscious and pulled these expertly-rendered monsters directly from our nightmares, but we are a little upset that he didn’t ask first. Like, you’re having a perfectly scary dream and then BAM, Baxa is just chillin’, taking notes. Like, “Hey, don’t mind me while you’re getting slaughtered by an alien bug. I’m just gonna draw it later!” We don’t know how he got this power, but we do know that he’s used it to become one of the best artists in the game. Add these waking terrors to your deck or collection today! \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Ob Nixilis Reignited Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Sliver Hivelord Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Sire of Insanity Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Spellskite Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":247345,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Thomas Baxa - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Thomas Baxa Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247345_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247345/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-thomas-baxa-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:46:55.507","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We’re not upset that Thomas Baxa reached directly into our subconscious and pulled these expertly-rendered monsters directly from our nightmares, but we are a little upset that he didn’t ask first. Like, you’re having a perfectly scary dream and then BAM, Baxa is just chillin’, taking notes. Like, “Hey, don’t mind me while you’re getting slaughtered by an alien bug. I’m just gonna draw it later!” We don’t know how he got this power, but we do know that he’s used it to become one of the best artists in the game. Add these waking terrors to your deck or collection today! \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Ob Nixilis Reignited\r\n<br>• 1x Sliver Hivelord\r\n<br>• 1x Sire of Insanity\r\n<br>• 1x Spellskite"}]},{"productId":247347,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Math Is For Blockers - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Math Is For Blockers Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247347_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247347/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-math-is-for-blockers-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:19:47.8","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We know you’re probably expecting a product description full of math puns, but honestly we used them all up writing the flavor text for these cards. There are simply none left. But who cares about this text, look at the awesome art by Alexandre Chaudret instead! Alexandre starts with simple geometric shapes, then blows them out into fantastic and fantastical illustrations of spectacular creatures. Shape up your deck or collection with these mathemagical cards. Take a look at the power and toughness of these creatures, and you might notice a delicious-sounding pattern… \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Brazen Borrower Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Vindictive Lich Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Meandering Towershell Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Ohran Frostfang Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Thragtusk Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":247348,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Math Is For Blockers - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Math Is For Blockers Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247348_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247348/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-math-is-for-blockers-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:19:20.84","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We know you’re probably expecting a product description full of math puns, but honestly we used them all up writing the flavor text for these cards. There are simply none left. But who cares about this text, look at the awesome art by Alexandre Chaudret instead! Alexandre starts with simple geometric shapes, then blows them out into fantastic and fantastical illustrations of spectacular creatures. Shape up your deck or collection with these mathemagical cards. Take a look at the power and toughness of these creatures, and you might notice a delicious-sounding pattern… \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Brazen Borrower \r\n<br>• 1x Vindictive Lich\r\n<br>• 1x Meandering Towershell \r\n<br>• 1x Ohran Frostfang \r\n<br>• 1x Thragtusk"}]},{"productId":247857,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Purrfection - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Purrfection Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247857_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247857/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-purrfection-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T17:48:20.53","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"A special release for Hasbro’s PulseCon 2021, the Purrfection Secret Lair contains four cards — Chain Lightning, Generous Gift, Heirloom Blade, and Kodama’s Reach. Each card features new, cat-themed artwork, illustrated by Ayako Ishiguro, a Japanese artist best known for her “monster cat” designs and popular picture book, Bakeneko Zorozoro.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Chain Lightning\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Generous Gift\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Heirloom Blade\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Kodama's Reach"}]},{"productId":251736,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Miss A Drop - It's Gone Superdrop: Boo-Tacular Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Miss A Drop Its Gone Superdrop Boo Tacular Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251736_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251736/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-miss-a-drop-its-gone-superdrop-boo-tacular-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-11T20:23:39.117","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Our first spine-chilling bundle is for people who love bundles… TO DEATH! This bundle contains every single drop, both foil and non-foil. Do you know who else loves bundles? Be careful, the answer might be so terrifying as to shock you to your very core. Bundled up in gauze and swarming with scare-abs, it’s the accursed mummy! What, too scary? Did you call for you own? (Mummy and mommy are homophones if you read them in an EXTREMELY SCARY VOICE.)\r\n<br>Stranger Things ™/ © Netflix. Used with permission.\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stranger Things\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stranger Things? Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Mirrodinsanity\r\n<br>• 1x Mirrodinsanity Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Anatomy 101\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Anatomy 101 Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Movie Marathon\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Movie Marathon Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Midnight Hunt\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Midnight Hunt Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Thrilling Tales of the Undead\r\n<br>• 1x Thrilling Tales of the Undead Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":251740,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Non-Foil Nightmare Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Non Foil Nightmare Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251740_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251740/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-non-foil-nightmare-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-11T20:42:44.957","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"So, you desire every non-foil drop? Then, perhaps you’d be interested in this NON-FOIL NIGHTMARE. A man lost his hand in a mysterious accident. To take his mind off things, he entered a Friday Night Magic event. His first-round opponent? HIS VERY OWN SEVERED HAND! It was a good match, and they still keep in touch to this day. TERRIFYING!\r\n<br>Stranger Things ™/ © Netflix. Used with permission.\r\n<br>• 1x Mirrodinsanity\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Anatomy 101\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Movie Marathon\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stranger Things\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Midnight Hunt\r\n<br>• 1x Thrilling Tales of the Undead"}]},{"productId":251741,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Ferocious Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Ferocious Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251741_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251741/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-ferocious-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-11T20:06:29.257","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"You like the shiny things in life, eh? Perhaps avarice is your sin? A bundle of all the foil drops, both traditional and foil etched? Well, here’s a spooky story of a man who also liked things who sparkled in the light: he died! Of old age! After living a long, fulfilling life! Scared yet? You should be.\r\n<br>Stranger Things ™/ © Netflix. Used with permission.\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stranger Things Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Mirrodinsanity Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Anatomy 101 Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Movie Marathon Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Read the Fine Print Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Midnight Hunt Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Thrilling Tales of the Undead Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":251744,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stranger Things - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stranger Things Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251744_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251744/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stranger-things-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:50:26.723","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The mysteries of Hawkins and the Upside Down have come to Magic: The Gathering! This Drop features eight brand-new cards and a unique Clue token. Call upon some of your favorite characters from the show and apply their unique talents in unforgettable games. Whether you view them as Commanders or collectables, this drop is perfect for the bigges