• 1x Hand-Drawn Rise of the Dark Realms Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":251774,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Monster Anatomy 101 - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Monster Anatomy 101 Foil Etched Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251774_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251774/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-monster-anatomy-101-foil-etched-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:45:12.563","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Ever wonder what some of Magic’s weirdest creatures look like on the inside? Us neither, but Timba Smits showed us the truth: they look pretty sweet! Consider these cards your intro lesson on the inner workings of some ravenous beasties. The alternative is to let a giant dino eat you, and that presents more logistical errors than we can address in a simple product description. Whether you surgically implant these cards inside your deck or proudly display them to educate passersby, you can rest soundly knowing you’ve shared knowledge with the world. And that, friend, is a beautiful thing.\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Fleet Swallower Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Goblin Trashmaster Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Ilharg, the Raze-Boar Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Protean Hulk Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Gishath, Sun’s Avatar Foil Etched Edition"}]},{"productId":251778,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Mirrodinsanity - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Mirrodinsanity Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251778_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251778/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-mirrodinsanity-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:22:01.44","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"So we were like, “Hey DXTR, we really like that card you did for us before. Wanna do a cycle of artifact lands?” And DXTR was like, “Yup.” And like, we were expecting some super cool hand-painted, pixel-art inspired pieces but instead he went ALL OUT and we got these WILD pieces just dripping with detail and lore. Krark’s on one of ‘em! AND his thumb! There’s so much going on and every inch of it just oozes cool! (Actual cards do not ooze or drip.)\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Ancient Den\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Seat of the Synod\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Vault of Whispers\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Great Furnace\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Tree of Tales"}]},{"productId":251780,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Mirrodinsanity - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Mirrodinsanity Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251780_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251780/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-mirrodinsanity-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:22:38.467","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"So we were like, “Hey DXTR, we really like that card you did for us before. Wanna do a cycle of artifact lands?” And DXTR was like, “Yup.” And like, we were expecting some super cool hand-painted, pixel-art inspired pieces but instead he went ALL OUT and we got these WILD pieces just dripping with detail and lore. Krark’s on one of ‘em! AND his thumb! There’s so much going on and every inch of it just oozes cool! (Actual cards do not ooze or drip.)\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Ancient Den Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Seat of the Synod Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Vault of Whispers Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Great Furnace Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Tree of Tales Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":251881,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Monster Anatomy 101 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Monster Anatomy 101 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251881_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251881/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-monster-anatomy-101-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:45:04.97","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Ever wonder what some of Magic’s weirdest creatures look like on the inside? Us neither, but Timba Smits showed us the truth: they look pretty sweet! Consider these cards your intro lesson on the inner workings of some ravenous beasties. The alternative is to let a giant dino eat you, and that presents more logistical errors than we can address in a simple product description. Whether you surgically implant these cards inside your deck or proudly display them to educate passersby, you can rest soundly knowing you’ve shared knowledge with the world. And that, friend, is a beautiful thing.\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Fleet Swallower\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Goblin Trashmaster\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Ilharg, the Raze-Boar\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Protean Hulk\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Gishath, Sun’s Avatar"}]},{"productId":252515,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Purrfection - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Purrfection Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/252515_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/252515/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-purrfection-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T17:48:58.807","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"A special release for Hasbro’s PulseCon 2021, the Purrfection Secret Lair contains four cards — Chain Lightning, Generous Gift, Heirloom Blade, and Kodama’s Reach. Each card features new, cat-themed artwork, illustrated by Ayako Ishiguro, a Japanese artist best known for her “monster cat” designs and popular picture book, Bakeneko Zorozoro.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS:\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Chain Lightning\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Generous Gift\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Heirloom Blade\r\n<br>1x Alt-Art Kodama's Reach"}]},{"productId":253835,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair Drop: Extra Life 2021 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair Drop Extra Life 2021 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/253835_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/253835/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-drop-extra-life-2021-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:09:21.803","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We wrangled a group of extremely talented children and asked them to draw us their take on iconic Magic creatures, like Mulldrifter and Craterhoof Behemoth. We took those young Picassos’ masterpieces and handed them over to all-star artists Lars Grant-West, Chris Rahn, and Magali Villeneuve to bring those drawings further to life. You get two copies of each card in the drop—one with the kid’s art, and the other with the professional artist’s interpretation. We’re not gonna lie, it’s super cute. The flavor text comes from conversations with the kids, too! So, do some good and get multiple copies of some awesome cards. Support Extra Life today!  \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mulldrifter by Aliya, age 5 ½\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mulldrifter by Magali Villeneuve, age 41\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Craterhoof Behemoth by Kira, age 5 ½\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Craterhoof Behemoth by Lars Grant-West, age 52\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Metalwork Colossus by Hyan Tran, age 6\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Metalwork Colossus by Chris Rahn, age 36"}]},{"productId":253836,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair Drop: Extra Life 2021- Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair Drop Extra Life 2021 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/253836_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/253836/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-drop-extra-life-2021-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:09:03.373","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"We wrangled a group of extremely talented children and asked them to draw us their take on iconic Magic creatures, like Mulldrifter and Craterhoof Behemoth. We took those young Picassos’ masterpieces and handed them over to all-star artists Lars Grant-West, Chris Rahn, and Magali Villeneuve to bring those drawings further to life. You get two copies of each card in the drop—one with the kid’s art, and the other with the professional artist’s interpretation. We’re not gonna lie, it’s super cute. The flavor text comes from conversations with the kids, too! So, do some good and get multiple copies of some awesome cards. Support Extra Life today!  \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Mulldrifter by Aliya, age 5 ½\r\n<br>• 1x Mulldrifter by Magali Villeneuve, age 41\r\n<br>• 1x Craterhoof Behemoth by Kira, age 5 ½\r\n<br>• 1x Craterhoof Behemoth by Lars Grant-West, age 52\r\n<br>• 1x Metalwork Colossus by Hyan Tran, age 6\r\n<br>• 1x Metalwork Colossus by Chris Rahn, age 36"}]},{"productId":256445,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair X MSCHF - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair X MSCHF Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/256445_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/256445/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-mschf-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:45:44.997","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"At Secret Lair, we harbor a deep affinity for anyone making drops, so we reached out to MSCHF to ask them if they wanted to collaborate. We asked them to make five cards, and they sent us five wild rectangles, each inspired by an infamous MSCHF drop like Guns 2 Swords, MSCHF Box, and Satan Shoes. Unrestrained frames, unique art, and fancy treatments (that Blood Moon is blindingly blingy) make this a once-in-a-lifetime Secret Lair drop that will spark conversations for years to come."}]},{"productId":258400,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Arcane - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Arcane Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258400_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258400/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-arcane-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:13:00.313","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Secret Lair is excited to announce a two-part collaboration with Arcane, the new television series based on League of Legends.\r\n<br>This first drop puts scenes from the TV show directly on iconic Magic cards. It features classic spells like Rhystic Study and Path to Exile reskinned with fan-favorite characters like Vi, Jinx, and Jayce (no, not that one). These cards are a must-have for any League of Legends or Magic fan in your life. Pick them up while you can!"}]},{"productId":258401,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Arcane - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Arcane Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258401_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258401/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-arcane-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:12:35.007","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Secret Lair is excited to announce a two-part collaboration with Arcane, the new television series based on League of Legends.\r\n<br>This first drop puts scenes from the TV show directly on iconic Magic cards. It features classic spells like Rhystic Study and Path to Exile reskinned with fan-favorite characters like Vi, Jinx, and Jayce (no, not that one). These cards are a must-have for any League of Legends or Magic fan in your life. Pick them up while you can!"}]},{"productId":258403,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Arcane: Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Arcane Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258403_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258403/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-arcane-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:13:11.747","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Secret Lair is excited to announce a two-part collaboration with Arcane, the new television series based on League of Legends.\r\n<br>This second drop includes one of each basic land, each portraying an iconic 