e":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Ah ah ah! Welcome to my castle, traveler. Please, make yourself at home, won’t you? We were just about to sit down for dinner—please, join us. We’ve got warm walnut walleye and a wasabi, watermelon, and watercress salad. Wonderful! We’re so happy to have you. For dinner. But first, perhaps you’d like to admire some art? I had some wonderful portraits done recently by definitely-not-vampire artists Tomas Duchek, Nicholas Gregory, and Nils Hamm. I ordered them on the world wide web, and now so can you!\r\n<br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Exquisite Blood as “Hunger of the Ancient One”\r\n<br>• 1x Night’s Whisper as “Nightfeeder’s Visitation”\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Tower as “Dracula’s Tomb”"}]},{"productId":258419,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Welcome to Castle Dracula - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Welcome to Castle Dracula Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258419_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258419/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-welcome-to-castle-dracula-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:46:46.79","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Ah ah ah! Welcome to my castle, traveler. Please, make yourself at home, won’t you? We were just about to sit down for dinner—please, join us. We’ve got warm walnut walleye and a wasabi, watermelon, and watercress salad. Wonderful! We’re so happy to have you. For dinner. But first, perhaps you’d like to admire some art? I had some wonderful portraits done recently by definitely-not-vampire artists Tomas Duchek, Nicholas Gregory, and Nils Hamm. I ordered them on the world wide web, and now so can you!\r\n<br>• CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Exquisite Blood as “Hunger of the Ancient One”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Night’s Whisper as “Nightfeeder’s Visitation”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Phyrexian Tower as “Dracula’s Tomb”"}]},{"productId":258454,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Dracula Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Dracula Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258454_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258454/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-dracula-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:44:08.023","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Vampire-ize your deck or collection with this incredible set of Dracula-themed Basic lands. Each card features hauntingly beautiful art by Jonas De Ro, Donato Giancola, Yeong-Hao Han, Andreas Rocha, and Grzegorz Rutkowski—each with their own take on fiction’s most notorious vampire.\r\n<br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Island\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Full-Art Island"}]},{"productId":258456,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Dracula Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Dracula Lands Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258456_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258456/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-dracula-lands-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:44:21.237","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Vampire-ize your deck or collection with this incredible set of Dracula-themed Basic lands. Each card features hauntingly beautiful art by Jonas De Ro, Donato Giancola, Yeong-Hao Han, Andreas Rocha, and Grzegorz Rutkowski—each with their own take on fiction’s most notorious vampire.\r\n<br>CONTENTS