ous Menagerie - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Crocodile Jacksons Monstrous Menagerie Foil Etched Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258484_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258484/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-crocodile-jacksons-monstrous-menagerie-foil-etched-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:29:24.28","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Come one, come all to the most amazing show this side of Muraganda. Legendary Cowboy Crocodile Jackson has illustrated all sorts of wacky and wild critters for you to take a look at. Marvel! At the golden grin of the Ravenous Chupacabra! Feel! The gentle embrace of the Winding Constrictor! Run! As fast as you can from the rampaging Pathbreaker Ibex! Get these critters and more for your own menagerie by picking up this drop today!"}]},{"productId":258487,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Far Out, Man - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Far Out Man Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258487_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258487/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-far-out-man-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:49:38.647","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Do you ever just like, look at your spells? We mean like, really look at them. Like, take a real long stare at these blue beauties by Mateus Manhanini. There’s so much to take in! These cards are the perfect centerpiece to any collection, and a jaw-dropping addition to any deck. Your opponents will be so spellbound they might even forgive you for countering their spell.\r\n<br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Aether Gust\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Counterspell\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Fabricate\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Fact or Fiction\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Mystical Tutor"}]},{"productId":258488,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Far Out, Man - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Far Out Man Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258488_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258488/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-far-out-man-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:50:38.553","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Do you ever just like, look at your spells? We mean like, really look at them. Like, take a real long stare at these blue beauties by Mateus Manhanini. There’s so much to take in! These cards are the perfect centerpiece to any collection, and a jaw-dropping addition to any deck. Your opponents will be so spellbound they might even forgive you for countering their spell."}]},{"productId":258489,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: PixelSnowLands.jpg - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop PixelSnowLandsjpg Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258489_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258489/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixelsnowlandsjpg-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:53:57.767","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"It’s snowing! It’s snowing, everyone! Don’t you love to just go outside and let the first snowflake fall on your tongue—WHY IS THIS SNOW SO POINTY? IT’S MADE OF PIXELS! IT’S SO SHARP! WE REGRET EVERYTHING!\r\n<br>Upon further review, we believe it’s best to admire this beautiful pixelated snowscape by artist Jubilee from afar—like on a Magic card. These are some of the coolest Snow Basics we’ve ever printed, and they’re exactly what you’re looking for to elevate any deck or collection. Just skip the snowballs. Trust us."}]},{"productId":258490,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: PixelSnowLands.jpg - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop PixelSnowLandsjpg Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258490_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258490/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixelsnowlandsjpg-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-10-18T14:25:42.087","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"It’s snowing! It’s snowing, everyone! Don’t you love to just go outside and let the first snowflake fall on your tongue—WHY IS THIS SNOW SO POINTY? IT’S MADE OF PIXELS! IT’S SO SHARP! WE REGRET EVERYTHING!\r\n<br>Upon further review, we believe it’s best to admire this beautiful pixelated snowscape by artist Jubilee from afar—like on a Magic card. These are some of the coolest Snow Basics we’ve ever printed, and they’re exactly what you’re looking for to elevate any deck or collection. Just skip the snowballs. Trust us."}]},{"productId":258491,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: PixelSnowLands.jpg - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop PixelSnowLandsjpg Foil Etched Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258491_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258491/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixelsnowlandsjpg-foil-etched-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:55:22.587","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"It’s snowing! It’s snowing, everyone! Don’t you love to just go outside and let the first snowflake fall on your tongue—WHY IS THIS SNOW SO POINTY? IT’S MADE OF PIXELS! IT’S SO SHARP! WE REGRET EVERYTHING!\r\n<br>Upon further review, we believe it’s best to admire this beautiful pixelated snowscape by artist Jubilee from afar—like on a Magic card. These are some of the coolest Snow Basics we’ve ever printed, and they’re exactly what you’re looking for to elevate any deck or collection. Just skip the snowballs. Trust us."}]},{"productId":258492,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Heads I Win, Tails You Lose","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Heads I Win Tails You Lose","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258492_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258492/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-heads-i-win-tails-you-lose","modifiedOn":"2022-12-13T15:06:48.473","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"WHAT IN THE HECK IS GOING ON, HERE??\r\n<br>We’re super stoked to introduce Secret Lair’s very first Commander Deck. That’s right, for a limited time you can grab a unique, 100-card deck filled with tons of foils, 10 pieces of killer new art (across five cards, we will explain), and a bunch of other goodies like a unique flippin’ coin and life wheel."}]},{"productId":258493,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Second Secretversary Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Second Secretversary Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258493_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258493/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-second-secretversary-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:07:45.833","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Enjoy all the non-foil niceties wrapped up nicely in a single bundle. It’s kind of like when you go to a party and you’re not sure who’s gonna be there—you know the host through a friend of a friend and you’ve hit it off great, but you’re not really sure which of their friends are also your friends, and what if their friends are weirdos who like things like lava luging and competitive corn shucking—but it turns out that their friends are all people you like or really cool people who like awesome things like regular luging and competitive corn eating. It’s really nice, is what it is!"}]},{"productId":258494,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Second Secretversary Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Second Secretversary Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258494_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258494/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-second-secretversary-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T18:08:00.81","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Enjoy all the non-foil niceties wrapped up nicely in a single bundle. It’s kind of like when you go to a party and you’re not sure who’s gonna be there—you know the host through a friend of a friend and you’ve hit it off great, but you’re not really sure which of their friends are also your friends, and what if their friends are weirdos who like things like lava luging and competitive corn shucking—but it turns out that their friends are all people you like or really cool people who like awesome things like regular luging and competitive corn eating. It’s really nice, is what it is!"}]},{"productId":258495,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258495_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258495/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-17T18:57:00.477","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"For the Secret Lair fanatic who wants it all. This bundle contains every single drop in both foil and non-foil. It’s basically the equivalent of leaving the party with seventeen goody bags.\r\n<br>Please note this bundle does NOT include the Heads I Win, Tails You Lose Commander deck."}]},{"productId":258496,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Bundled Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Bundled Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258496_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258496/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-bundled-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-17T18:57:29.107","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"For the Secret Lair fanatic who wants it all, and then also wants one more thing. This bundle contains every single drop in both foil and non-foil, and ALSO contains a copy of the Heads I Win, Tails You Lose Commander deck! It’s pretty much the equivalent of leaving the party with seventeen goody bags AND a huge cake that wasn’t going to be cut for at least an hour."}]},{"productId":259309,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Capricorn) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Capricorn Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259309_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259309/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-capricorn-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T15:06:40.77","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Capricorn. Each drop contains five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo."}]},{"productId":259310,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Capricorn) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Capricorn Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259310_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259310/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-capricorn-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T15:06:55","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Capricorn. Each drop contains five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo."}]},{"productId":259311,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Capricorn) Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Capricorn Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259311_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259311/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-capricorn-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T15:07:15.393","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Capricorn. Each drop contains five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo."}]},{"productId":259312,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Capricorn) Bundle - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Capricorn Bundle Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259312_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259312/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-capricorn-bundle-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T15:07:40.35","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Capricorn. Each drop contains five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo."}]},{"productId":267765,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: February Superdrop - Full-of-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop February Superdrop Full of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/267765_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/267765/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-february-superdrop-full-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2022-12-12T16:43:21.75","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Foil fanciers, rejoice! This bundle contains all eight foil drops from the February Superdrop! All of 'em! That's two fours, or four twos if you're gonna be like that. You know what else totally rules and is tangentially related to the number eight? Octopuses. That's right. Those eight-armed brain monsters from the ocean and also the occasional nightmare. And yeah, you heard us right. Octopuses is a more correct plural than octopi, look it up. And don't you dare bring any of that octopodes nonsense into our lair, we're not about that life.\r\n<br><br>\r\nCONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Street Fighter Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Introducing: Kaito Shizuki Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Kamigawa: The Manga: The Cards Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Li'l Walkers Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Pictures of the Floating World Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Shades Not Included Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Neon Dynasty\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Yuko Shimizu Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":267766,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: February Superdrop - Non-stop, Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop February Superdrop Non stop Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/267766_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/267766/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-february-superdrop-non-stop-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2022-12-12T16:42:36.163","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Seven drops are promised to the purchaser of this bundle. Seven drops they shall receive: each non-foil in temperance, yet beautiful and mystifying in appearance. The seven non-foil drops of this bundle have a history that spans days, maybe even weeks. It's said, in some cultures, that the first drop is symbolic of good fortune. The second brings good health, while the third is great for posture. The fourth drop represents getting a strike in bowling, and the fifth represents converting a spare off a split, which is honestly more impressive. The meanings of the sixth and seventh drops are shrouded in mystery, but some say they are portents of binging a new television show and successfully making a single, perfect pancake.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Street Fighter\r\n<br>• 1x Introducing: Kaito Shizuki\r\n<br>• 1x Kamigawa: The Manga: The Cards\r\n<br>• 1x Li'l Walkers\r\n<br>• 1x Pictures of the Floating World\r\n<br>• 1x Shades Not Included\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Yuko Shimizu"}]},{"productId":267767,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: February Superdrop - The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop February Superdrop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/267767_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/267767/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-february-superdrop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2022-12-12T16:41:53.573","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The Bundle Bundle contains one of every single available drop, both in foil and non-foil (where applicable). That's fifteen Secret Lair drops, all in a single bundle. Some of the more tender-hearted among you might be thinking, \"That's inhumane! How can they bundle fifteen drops in a single box? They won't be able to breathe!\" While we understand where you're coming from, and while we stand in admiration of your kindness, we must remind you that Secret Lair drops are inanimate objects and have no need for such trivialities as air or sustenance. If you do receive a Secret Lair drop that appears to be breathing or demands to be fed, we recommend that you set it down and run away as fast as you possibly can. But that only happened once, so you probably don't have to worry about it!\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Non-stop, Non-foil Bundle <em>(1x Secret Lair x Street Fighter, 1x Introducing: Kaito Shizuki, 1x Kamigawa: The Manga: The Cards, 1x Li'l Walkers, 1x Pictures of the Floating World, 1x Shades Not Included, 1x Special Guest: Yuko Shimizu)</em>\r\n<br>• 1x Full-of-foils Bundle <em>(1x Secret Lair x Street Fighter Foil Edition, 1x Introducing: Kaito Shizuki Foil Edition, 1x Kamigawa: The Manga: The Cards Foil Edition, 1x Li'l Walkers Foil Edition, 1x Pictures of the Floating World Foil Edition, 1x Shades Not Included Foil Edition, 1x Showcase: Neon Dynasty, 1x Special Guest: Yuko Shimizu Foil Edition)</em>"}]},{"productId":267768,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: February Superdrop - Introducing: Kaito Shizuki - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop February Superdrop Introducing Kaito Shizuki Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/267768_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/267768/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-february-superdrop-introducing-kaito-shizuki-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T14:06:09.517","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Get to know Magic's newest Planeswalker, the high-tech ninja Kaito Shizuki. Artist Rorubei helps introduce Kaito in style. These five cards show off his acrobatic ninja skills, his magic, and even a snippet of his story. Add the tale of Kaito to your deck or collection, today!\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Brain Freeze\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Bribery\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Snap\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Unmask\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Shadow of Doubt"}]},{"productId":267769,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: February Superdrop - Introducing: Kaito Shizuki - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop February Superdrop Introducing Kaito Shizuki Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/267769_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/267769/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-february-superdrop-introducing-kaito-shizuki-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T14:06:22.75","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Get to know Magic's newest Planeswalker, the high-tech ninja Kaito Shizuki. Artist Rorubei helps introduce Kaito in style. These five cards show 