r collection, Shadaloo doesn't stand a chance.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Foil E. Honda, Sumo Champion  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ryu, World Warrior  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ken, Burning Brawler  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Blanka, Ferocious Friend  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Chun-Li, Countless Kicks  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dhalsim, Pliable Pacifist  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Guile, Sonic Soldier  \r\n<br>• 1x Foil Zangief, the Red Cyclone"}]},{"productId":273593,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Streets of New Capenna - Gilded Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Streets of New Capenna Gilded Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273593_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273593/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-streets-of-new-capenna-gilded-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:52:14.713","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The days move fast in the not-so-pristine metropolis of New Capenna. Here, crime always pays, and business is booming. We’re not sure how they got here, but somehow three of Magic’s most popular legends have found themselves embroiled in what can only be described as a “what if” scenario. What would Atraxa, Breya, and Yidris be like on the mean streets of New C? Julie Dillon, Krharts, and Tom Roberts have an idea, and now you can too. These cards feature the beautiful Gilded Foil treatment from the Streets of New Capenna set, and that’s the kind of hardware that catches attention. Please note this drop is available only in foil.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Gilded Foil Showcase Atraxa, Praetors’ Voice\r\n<br>• 1x Gilded Foil Showcase Breya, Etherium Shaper\r\n<br>• 1x Gilded Foil Showcase Yidris, Maelstrom Wielder"}]},{"productId":273594,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Matt Jukes - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Matt Jukes Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273594_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273594/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-matt-jukes-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:08:47.463","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We’ve been to these allied check lands before, but we don’t recall them ever looking quite like this. Contemporary artist Matt Jukes is known for his abstract landscapes that capture misremembered terrains from obscured memories. Add these lands to your deck or collection and take it to places it’s never been—but that feel oh so familiar.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Glacial Fortress\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Drowned Catacomb\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Dragonskull Summit\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Rootbound Crag\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Sunpetal Grove"}]},{"productId":273595,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Matt Jukes - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Matt Jukes Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273595_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273595/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-matt-jukes-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:08:29.817","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We’ve been to these allied check lands before, but we don’t recall them ever looking quite like this. Contemporary artist Matt Jukes is known for his abstract landscapes that capture misremembered terrains from obscured memories. Add these lands to your deck or collection and take it to places it’s never been—but that feel oh so familiar.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Glacial Fortress\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Drowned Catacomb\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Dragonskull Summit\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Rootbound Crag\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Sunpetal Grove"}]},{"productId":273596,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Magali Villeneuve Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273596_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273596/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-magali-villeneuve-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:37:17.97","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>If you’ve looked at a fantasy property in the past decade (and more), you’ve likely seen Magali’s art. From jaw-droppingly-beautiful people to intricate landscapes with unfathomable detail, it’s clear why Magali is a genre favorite. Responsible for well over 100 pieces of Magic art, this Artist Series was joyously inevitable. Magali also collaborated with us on the flavor text, and each text reflects her artistic process when working on that piece. These cards are a magnificent centerpiece for any deck or collection. Get yours today!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mother of Runes\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Death’s Shadow\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Elvish Mystic\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":273597,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Magali Villeneuve Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273597_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273597/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-magali-villeneuve-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:37:06.61","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>If you’ve looked at a fantasy property in the past decade (and more), you’ve likely seen Magali’s art. From jaw-droppingly-beautiful people to intricate landscapes with unfathomable detail, it’s clear why Magali is a genre favorite. Responsible for well over 100 pieces of Magic art, this Artist Series was joyously inevitable. Magali also collaborated with us on the flavor text, and each text reflects her artistic process when working on that piece. These cards are a magnificent centerpiece for any deck or collection. Get yours today!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Mother of Runes\r\n<br>• 1x Death’s Shadow\r\n<br>• 1x Elvish Mystic\r\n<br>• 1x Forest"}]},{"productId":273598,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Sidharth Chaturvedi Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273598_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273598/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-sidharth-chaturvedi-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:46:30.413","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Sidharth Chaturvedi has a story to tell. Every one of his cards could spark a novel—the light, the expression, the posing—each a story in its own right. When we asked Sidharth if he would honor us with an Artist Series, he asked if his four cards could tell a story. They tell of a journey filled with grief, struggle, and success. Sidharth even helped us craft the flavor text to make sure his story was properly told. There may be several interpretations of Sidharth’s story, but all can agree on one thing: these cards feature gorgeous art that make each retelling a joy.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nomad Outpost\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Concordant Crossroads\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ghost Quarter"}]},{"productId":273599,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Sidharth Chaturvedi Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273599_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273599/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-sidharth-chaturvedi-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:46:18.02","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Sidharth Chaturvedi has a story to tell. Every one of his cards could spark a novel—the light, the expression, the posing—each a story in its own right. When we asked Sidharth if he would honor us with an Artist Series, he asked if his four cards could tell a story. They tell of a journey filled with grief, struggle, and success. Sidharth even helped us craft the flavor text to make sure his story was properly told. There may be several interpretations of Sidharth’s story, but all can agree on one thing: these cards feature gorgeous art that make each retelling a joy.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Nomad Outpost\r\n<br>• 1x Island\r\n<br>• 1x Concordant Crossroads\r\n<br>• 1x Ghost Quarter"}]},{"productId":273600,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Wayne Reynolds Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273600_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273600/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-wayne-reynolds-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:55:56.97","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Wayne Reynolds started painting for Magic in the original Kamigawa block, and his art has been synonymous with the game ever since. There’s a tension in what he makes, in both incredible action pieces and still moments of reflection. Wayne’s art always seems ready to hurl itself off the cards and go springing around the room. For his Artist Series, Wayne asked for dwarves, and dwarves he did deliver. He even collaborated with us on the flavor text! Stout, dependable, and sharp as a knife, these dwarves are ready to be center stage in your deck or collection\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Sram, Senior Edificer \r\n<br>• 1x Balthor the Defiled\r\n<br>• 1x Torbran, Thane of Red Fell\r\n<br>• 1x Depala, Pilot Exemplar"}]},{"productId":273601,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Finally Left Handed Magic Cards Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273601_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273601/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-finally-left-handed-magic-cards-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T14:37:51.867","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>When Magic was first created in the early ’90s, the original plan was to have two kinds of frames—one for righties, and one for lefties. Unfortunately, due to budget constraints, only the right-handed frames were produced and the game was billed as an ambidextrous product. We believe this wrong has gone unrighted (unlefted?) for too long. No more will our players be forced to play with sub-optimal, right-handed cards. This is Magic as it was always intended, featuring five of the game’s coolest lefties, lovingly rendered by Volkan Baga, Jesper Ejsing, Andrew Mar, Chris Seaman, Matt Stewart.\r\n\r\n<br>April Fools! That story is made up, but these cards are totally real. Grab this drop for your deck or collection and score an excellent talking piece until we update the game and make these frames the real ones forever. That last point was also an April Fools’ joke. Probably.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Left-Handed Sisay, Weatherlight Captain?\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Left-Handed Empress Galina\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Left-Handed Geralf’s Messenger\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Left-Handed Rograkh, Son of Rohgahh\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Left-Handed Garruk, Caller of Beasts"}]},{"productId":273602,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Finally Left Handed Magic Cards Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273602_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273602/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-finally-left-handed-magic-cards-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T14:37:37.433","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>When Magic was first created in the early ’90s, the original plan was to have two kinds of frames—one for righties, and one for lefties. Unfortunately, due to budget constraints, only the right-handed frames were produced and the game was billed as an ambidextrous product. We believe this wrong has gone unrighted (unlefted?) for too long. No more will our players be forced to play with sub-optimal, right-handed cards. This is Magic as it was always intended, featuring five of the game’s coolest lefties, lovingly rendered by Volkan Baga, Jesper Ejsing, Andrew Mar, Chris Seaman, Matt Stewart.\r\n<br>April Fools! That story is made up, but these cards are totally real. Grab this drop for your deck or collection and score an excellent talking piece until we update the game and make these frames the real ones forever. That last point was also an April Fools’ joke. Probably.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Left-Handed Sisay, Weatherlight Captain\r\n<br>• 1x Left-Handed Empress Galina\r\n<br>• 1x Left-Handed Geralf’s Messenger\r\n<br>• 1x Left-Handed Rograkh, Son of Rohgahh\r\n<br>• 1x Left-Handed Garruk, Caller of Beasts"}]},{"productId":273603,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Just Some Totally Normal Guys - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Just Some Totally Normal Guys Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273603_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273603/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-just-some-totally-normal-guys-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:51:03.853","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s them! Just some regular folks we ran into. Roman Klonek made ’em. Some everyday people in a wacky, whimsical world who are doing their best. If you put them in your deck or collection, they’ll do their best for you there, too. It’s like they always say: every friend group has the Void Winnower, the Goblin Settler, the Collector Ouphe, and the Vengevine. Which one are you? Tag yourself and let us know on Twitter with #MTGSLD!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Void Winnower\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Goblin Settler\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Collector Ouphe\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Vengevine"}]},{"productId":273604,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Just Some Totally Normal Guys - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Just Some Totally Normal Guys Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273604_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273604/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-just-some-totally-normal-guys-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:48:01.493","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s them! Just some regular folks we ran into. Roman Klonek made ’em. Some everyday people in a wacky, whimsical world who are doing their best. If you put them in your deck or collection, they’ll do their best for you there, too. It’s like they always say: every friend group has the Void Winnower, the Goblin Settler, the Collector Ouphe, and the Vengevine. Which one are you? Tag yourself and let us know on Twitter with #MTGSLD!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Void Winnower\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Goblin Settler\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Collector Ouphe\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Vengevine"}]},{"productId":273605,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: April Superdrop - The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop April Superdrop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273605_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273605/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-april-superdrop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:53:59.697","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Using their powerful forepaws, some bears are able to smack salmon straight out of the river. This is not entirely dissimilar to the way in which our artists knocked these Secret Lair drops out of the park. While we doubt that any of our wonderful artists possess strength and dexterity similar to that of a bear, let alone the hankering to send freshwater fish hurtling out of the tumbling rapids onto the waiting shore where they’ll be torn apart by ravenous jaws and fangs, this metaphor is apt considering our artists’ level of expertise and skill. They’re rad, is what we’re saying. We’re also saying that the Bundle Bundle contains one of each drop in the April Superdrop, in both foil and nonfoil where available.\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards\r\n<br>• 1x Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Just Some Totally Normal Guys\r\n<br>• 1x Just Some Totally Normal Guys Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Streets of New Capenna Gilded Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Matt Jukes\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Matt Jukes Traditional Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":273606,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: April Superdrop - Full-of-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop April Superdrop Full of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273606_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273606/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-april-superdrop-full-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:23:38.42","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Full-of-Foils bundle contains one of each foil drop available in the April Superdrop. If you hold them up to the light, you’ll see that they glisten beautifully—much like the scales of a salmon as it careers through the air after getting absolutely catapulted out of a river by the powerful forepaws of a hungry bear. Nature is beautiful, mysterious, and just a little bit scary. This all-foil bundle is all three of those things, but also something you can own if you buy it before the sale ends. You can’t own nature, man. It’s not for sale. This bundle? For sale. Know the difference. Buy the bundle.\r\n<br><br>\r\nCONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Just Some Totally Normal Guys Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Streets of New Capenna Gilded Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Matt Jukes Traditional Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":273607,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: April Superdrop - Non-stop, Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop April Superdrop Non stop Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273607_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273607/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-april-superdrop-non-stop-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:23:15.553","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Do you want some really cool Secret Lair cards, but find the concept of shiny things offensive and angering? Look no further! The Non-Stop, Non-Foil Bundle contains one of each drop in non-foil (where available). We get it. Foils aren’t for everyone and matte is IN this season. We encourage you to pick the bundle that is right for you. If you like non-foils, pick this one. If you like foils, pick the other one. If you like using your powerful forepaws to pelt salmon straight out of the river for sustenance, pick neither—you’re a bear, and bears don’t play Magic. We have the market research to prove it.?\r\n<br><br>\r\nCONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Magali Villeneuve?\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sidharth Chaturvedi?\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds?\r\n<br>• 1x Finally! Left-Handed Magic Cards?\r\n<br>• 1x Just Some Totally Normal Guys?\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Matt Jukes"}]},{"productId":273810,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Wayne Reynolds - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Wayne Reynolds Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273810_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273810/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-wayne-reynolds-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:56:09.947","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Wayne Reynolds started painting for Magic in the original Kamigawa block, and his art has been synonymous with the game ever since. There’s a tension in what he makes, in both incredible action pieces and still moments of reflection. Wayne’s art always seems ready to hurl itself off the cards and go springing around the room. For his Artist Series, Wayne asked for dwarves, and dwarves he did deliver. He even collaborated with us on the flavor text! Stout, dependable, and sharp as a knife, these dwarves are ready to be center stage in your deck or collection\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sram, Senior Edificer\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Balthor the Defiled\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Torbran, Thane of Red Fell\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Depala, Pilot Exemplar"}]},{"productId":275788,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Here Be Dragons - Foil","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Here Be Dragons Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275788_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275788/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-here-be-dragons-foil","modifiedOn":"2022-10-05T19:03:28.437","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• This unique Secret Lair drop contains:\r\n<br>• Seven (7) limited-edition traditional foil cards featuring classic D&D dragon-themed art, gradually revealed in a fold-out papercraft display\r\n<br>• Metal dragon life counter on a 2.5” diameter base that counts up to 45, nestled in a sleek, foam-fitted tin case\r\n<br>• Deck box with a black dragon-scale exterior and a secret surprise that must be discovered by the owner\r\n<br>• Set of 100 Inferno of the Star Mounts (red dragon)-themed card sleeves"}]},{"productId":275798,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Volkan Baga - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Volkan Baga Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275798_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275798/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-volkan-baga-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:54:20.54","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>To ask Volkan to stop creating iconic Magic artwork would be like asking a fish to stop swimming—it’s just the way he is. With this drop, Volkan will have produced more than 200 pieces of Magic art. What an achievement! These are also the first-ever English-language cards to feature flavor text entirely in Volkan’s native German. Another momentous occasion! Celebrate this two-for-one by adding Volkan’s drop to your deck or collection today.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Elspeth, Knight-Errant\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Patron Wizard\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Berserk\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Verduran Enchantress"}]},{"productId":275799,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Volkan Baga - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Volkan Baga Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275799_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275799/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artis