nsidered complete without this artist series—grab yours today!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Akroma, Angel of Wrath\r\n<br>• 1x Mikaeus, the Unhallowed\r\n<br>• 1x Glissa Sunseeker\r\n<br>• 1x Olivia, Mobilized for War"}]},{"productId":275804,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Tokyo Lands - Etched Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Tokyo Lands Etched Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275804_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275804/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-tokyo-lands-etched-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:59:37.413","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Take a trip to Tokyo with these stunning, real-world inspired lands. Your highly experienced tour guides will be artists Rosemary Valero-O’Connell, Andy Williams, Mr. Misang, Yuumei, and Nicole Gustafsson & Marija Tiurina. They’ll be taking you to five stunning Tokyo destinations that accentuate any deck or collection. Just remember to lift your jaw off the floor—good tourists don’t leave anything behind.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Full-art Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Full-art Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Full-art Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Full-art Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Full-art Forest"}]},{"productId":275805,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Tokyo Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Tokyo Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275805_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275805/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-tokyo-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:59:27.983","imageCount":2,"pres