is an Australian artist who blends abstract and surreal art styles with anime influences from his upbringing to create mesmerizing scenes. Take it from us—we’re thoroughly mesmerized. These cards are a jaw-dropping addition to any deck or collection. Grab yours today!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Mystic Remora\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Retreat to Coralhelm\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Burgeoning\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Utopia Sprawl"}]},{"productId":275822,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: June Superdrop - The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop June Superdrop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275822_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275822/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-june-superdrop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:25:21.26","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Y’all know the drill. This bundle is for bundle lovers ONLY. It’s two bundles bundled into one bundle! That’s what’s up. Much like how King Arthur was the only one able to yoink Excalibur out of the rock in which it was embedded, only you, the Bundle Lover Who Was Foretold, are worthy to place this double bundle in your digital shopping cart. If you turn to page 768 of the Ancient Scrolls (you do have your copy of the Ancient Scrolls handy, right?), you can see the part where your destiny was, uh, predestined. Or maybe that’s a chocolate smudge on our copy? Hard to say! Only one way to find out: it’s Bundle Bundle time, bud!\r\n<br><br>CONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Chris Rahn\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Livia Prima\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Volkan Baga\r\n<br>• 1x Rule the Room\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: kelogsloops\r\n<br>• 1x The Tokyo Lands\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Chris Rahn Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Livia Prima Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Volkan Baga Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Rule the Room Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: kelogsloops Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Tokyo Lands Foil Etched Edition"}]},{"productId":275823,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: June Superdrop - Full-of-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop June Superdrop Full of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275823_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275823/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-june-superdrop-full-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:36:24.283","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This bundle contains all six foil drops available in the June 2022 Superdrop! The coming of the six June foil drops was also mentioned in the Ancient Scrolls but varies depending on the translation. The Lazlino edition actually translates the passage as six “noon boil mops,” which perplexed scholars for generations until more recent translations began to perplex scholars in a different way, because why the heck would the Ancient Scrolls be about niche Magic: The Gathering internet sales? The Ancient Scrolls are truly our society’s greatest mystery. This bundle is much more straightforward—six foil drops for your increasingly awesome collection.\r\n<br><br>\r\nCONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Chris Rahn Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Livia Prima Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Volkan Baga Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Rule the Room Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: kelogsloops Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Tokyo Lands Foil Etched Edition"}]},{"productId":275824,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: June Superdrop - Non-stop, Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop June Superdrop Non stop Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/275824_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/275824/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-june-superdrop-non-stop-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T19:37:06.557","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Foils? Bah. No, thank you. This bundle has all six June 2022 drops in matte-tacular non-foil. This makes a lot of sense to you. Not everything in life needs to be foil. Cats are non-foil and they’re pretty good. The Ancient Scrolls aren’t foil, and their prophecies have dictated the ins and outs of everyday society for centuries. But, like, to be fair, if the prehistoric dinosaur monks who wrote the Ancient Scrolls had access to modern-day foiling technology, they’d probably foil the heck out of everything. But not you! This bundle is a no-fly zone for foil—six non-foil friends for your collection.\r\n<br><br>\r\nCONTENTS\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Chris Rahn\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Livia Prima\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Volkan Baga\r\n<br>• 1x Rule the Room\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: kelogsloops\r\n<br>• 1x The Tokyo Lands"}]},{"productId":278748,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Cancer) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Cancer Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/278748_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/278748/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-cancer-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T15:00: