r>• 1x Retro Frame Talisman of Hierarchy\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Talisman of Creativity\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Talisman of Resilience\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Talisman of Conviction\r\n<br>• 1x Retro Frame Talisman of Curiosity"}]},{"productId":283269,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Enemy Talismans - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dan Frazier Is Back Again The Enemy Talismans Foil Etched Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283269_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283269/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dan-frazier-is-back-again-the-enemy-talismans-foil-etched-edition","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:31:05.96","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The legend himself! Classic Magic illustrator Dan Frazier defined “old school cool” with his work on the original Moxen and beyond. He even returned recently to grace Secret Lair with enemy-color signet cards. This time, Dan’s turned back the clock on five enemy-color talismans and we couldn’t be more thrilled with the results—especially seeing them retro-fitted with Retro frames!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Talisman of Hierarchy\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Talisman of Creativity\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Talisman of Resilience\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Talisman of Conviction\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Talisman of Curiosity"}]},{"productId":283272,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Imaginary Friends - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Imaginary Friends Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283272_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283272/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-imaginary-friends-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:35:46.073","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Who doesn’t love an imaginary friend? A little cute, a little creepy, and always available to hang out. Vibrantly rendered into real life by artist Jeannie Lynn Paske, these playful pals are here to prove they’re more dream than nightmare. Use Toothy and Pir as Partner Commanders, and throw down an adorable Gitrog Monster or Matter Reshaper and let your imagination run wild all over your opponents!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Matter Reshaper\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Toothy, Imaginary Friend\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Pir, Imaginative Rascal\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless The Gitrog Monster"}]},{"productId":283273,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Imaginary Friends - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Imaginary Friends Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283273_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283273/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-imaginary-friends-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:36:00.2","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Who doesn’t love an imaginary friend? A little cute, a little creepy, and always available to hang out. Vibrantly rendered into real life by artist Jeannie Lynn Paske, these playful pals are here to prove they’re more dream than nightmare. Use Toothy and Pir as Partner Commanders, and throw down an adorable Gitrog Monster or Matter Reshaper and let your imagination run wild all over your opponents!\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Matter Reshaper\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Toothy, Imaginary Friend\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Pir, Imaginative Rascal\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless The Gitrog Monster"}]},{"productId":283275,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Victor Adame Minguez Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283275_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283275/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-victor-adame-minguez-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:48:23.873","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Legendary Magic artist Victor Adame Minguez never fails to bring his high-quality best, and this drop is no exception. We let Victor loose on the theming and art, and uh, are you looking at them yet? Are you seeing this coolness? We love the heavy lean into futuristic vibes and the mix of grittiness and austerity. AND he collaborated with us on the flavor text—that’s range, people! Get on Team Victor and put these rad pieces in your deck or collection ASAP.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Knight Exemplar\r\n<br>• 1x Knight of the White Orchid\r\n<br>• 1x Lord of the Undead\r\n<br>• 1x Compost"}]},{"productId":283276,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Victor Adame Minguez Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283276_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283276/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-victor-adame-minguez-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:48:39.55","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Legendary Magic artist Victor Adame Minguez never fails to bring his high-quality best, and this drop is no exception. We let Victor loose on the theming and art, and uh, are you looking at them yet? Are you seeing this coolness? We love the heavy lean into futuristic vibes and the mix of grittiness and austerity. AND he collaborated with us on the flavor text—that’s range, people! Get on Team Victor and put these rad pieces in your deck or collection ASAP.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Knight Exemplar\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Knight of the White Orchid\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lord of the Undead\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Compost"}]},{"productId":283279,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Nils Hamm - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Nils Hamm Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283279_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283279/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-nils-hamm-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:39:34.687","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Longtime fans will immediately recognize Nils Hamm’s prolific portfolio of Magic art through the years. For Secret Lair, we’ve partnered with Nils to dream up card art inspired by classic stories. Remember books? In print, even? His gorgeous scenes pull from faves like The Odyssey and “The Rime of the Ancient Mariner” to perfectly complement the collection or deck of any literature lover. The colors! The details! The paired flavor text! If you’re on the same page, you’ll want to make like a library and check these out.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Deepglow Skate\r\n<br>• 1x Tireless Tracker\r\n<br>• 1x Contagion Engine\r\n<br>• 1x Sword of Truth and Justice"}]},{"productId":283280,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Nils Hamm - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Nils Hamm Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283280_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283280/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-nils-hamm-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:39:44.48","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Longtime fans will immediately recognize Nils Hamm’s prolific portfolio of Magic art through the years. For Secret Lair, we’ve partnered with Nils to dream up card art inspired by classic stories. Remember books? In print, even? His gorgeous scenes pull from faves like The Odyssey and “The Rime of the Ancient Mariner” to perfectly complement the collection or deck of any literature lover. The colors! The details! The paired flavor text! If you’re on the same page, you’ll want to make like a library and check these out.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Deepglow Skate\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tireless Tracker\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Contagion Engine\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sword of Truth and Justice"}]},{"productId":283281,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop In Memoriam Jaya Ballard Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283281_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283281/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-in-memoriam-jaya-ballard-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:38:21.19","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Yeah, we can’t believe it either. Secret Lair is commemorating the tragic death of Planeswalker, task mage, and flame grandma Jaya Ballard during the story events of Dominaria United. As a celebration of her life, we’ve assembled an all-Jaya drop for your deck or collection that we think she would approve of: with fire, fire everywhere. So here’s a toast to the fallen pyromancer—we'll make it extra scorched.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Jaya Ballard\r\n<br>• 1x Jaya’s Immolating Inferno\r\n<br>• 1x Pyretic Ritual\r\n<br>• 1x Repercussion\r\n<br>• 1x Pyromancer’s Goggles"}]},{"productId":283282,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop In Memoriam Jaya Ballard Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283282_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283282/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-in-memoriam-jaya-ballard-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:38:35.947","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Yeah, we can’t believe it either. Secret Lair is commemorating the tragic death of Planeswalker, task mage, and flame grandma Jaya Ballard during the story events of Dominaria United. As a celebration of her life, we’ve assembled an all-Jaya drop for your deck or collection that we think she would approve of: with fire, fire everywhere. So here’s a toast to the fallen pyromancer—we'll make it extra scorched.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jaya Ballard\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jaya’s Immolating Inferno\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Pyretic Ritual\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Repercussion\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Pyromancer’s Goggles"}]},{"productId":283283,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Dominaria United - Textured Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Dominaria United Textured Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283283_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283283/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-dominaria-united-textured-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:15:05.24","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dominaria United is on the way! To celebrate the return to Magic’s oldest plane, we’ve got a museum-ready collection of stained-glass foil Showcase cards featuring none other than the original five Elder Dragons. That’s right—the legendary Legends and the commanders of Commander, gloriously rendered in the kind of prismatic perfection you’d want as windows for a big old building. Plus there’s that little rascal named like, Nicole Bogus? Nickle Bobo? Eh, he probably wasn’t important.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Textured Foil Showcase Stained Glass Arcades Sabboth\r\n<br>• 1x Textured Foil Showcase Stained Glass Chromium\r\n<br>• 1x Textured Foil Showcase Stained Glass Nicol Bolas\r\n<br>• 1x Textured Foil Showcase Stained Glass Vaevictis Asmadi\r\n<br>• 1x Textured Foil Showcase Stained Glass Palladia-Mors"}]},{"productId":283284,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: August Superdrop - Non-stop, Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop August Superdrop Non stop Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283284_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283284/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-august-superdrop-non-stop-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:43:41.31","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Foils don’t have to be your cup of tea, and that’s okay! Claim this bundle to receive the six non-foil drops in the August 2022 Superdrop and revel in their non-reflective finish. They’re especially handy to have in your collection or deck if you’re the kind of being that’s sensitive to chromatic shimmering, like an alternate-universe superbee. In that case, please disregard any notes on a hypothetical human rebellion against the superbees, because we’re definitely kidding about it, ha ha. Now back to harvesting honey in the Detention Comb of Superhive Alpha 272, nothing to see here.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Nils Hamm\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Allied Talismans\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Enemy Talismans\r\n<br>• 1x Imaginary Friends\r\n<br>• 1x In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard"}]},{"productId":283286,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: August Superdrop - Full-of-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop August Superdrop Full of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283286_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283286/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-august-superdrop-full-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:47:33.887","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Get all seven foil drops from August 2022 in this beautifully glistening bundle! We can’t imagine a prize more precious in any standard or alternate reality, like for example one where our bumbling with the timestream resulted in a power-hungry hive of superbees claiming dominion over Earth. If shiny foil were theoretically outlawed because it blinded the superbees, one could quickly see the value in such cards when either building an underground superbee resistance or just as part of your home Magic collection. So go see what all the buzz is about, but stay vigilant—you don’t want to get sentenced to six months-to-life in the honey mines.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Nils Hamm Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Allied Talismans Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Enemy Talismans Foil Etched  Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Imaginary Friends Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Dominaria United Stained Glass Textured Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":283288,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: August Superdrop - The Bundle Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop August Superdrop The Bundle Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/283288_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/283288/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-august-superdrop-the-bundle-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:49:03.303","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Decades of tireless research in the lab has yielded an astonishing result: a bundle that can be bundled out of other bundles. We can’t believe it either, and yet here we stand with a bundle made solely out of two bundles. But maybe you’re saying to yourself, “this isn’t special, you’ve already done this for other Superdrops in the past,” and that’s only partially true—we’ve also JUST INVENTED TIME TRAVEL to forever alter the timestream. So if you’ve ever come across a bundled bundle in previous months, that’s IRREFUTABLE PROOF that our grand experiment was a resounding success! We only hope we haven’t stepped on any butterflies or bees or whatever in the process, but that’s impossible to know. Oh well! Back to our regular toil in the human beehive which is normal in our universe, the one where monster bees rule humanity.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Nils Hamm Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Nils Hamm\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Victor Adame Minguez \r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Allied Talismans Foil Etched Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Allied Talismans\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Enemy Talismans Foil Etched  Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier Is Back Again: The Enemy Talismans\r\n<br>• 1x Imaginary Friends Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Imaginary Friends\r\n<br>• 1x In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x In Memoriam: Jaya Ballard \r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Dominaria United Stained Glass Textured Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":285241,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Virgo) Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Virgo Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/285241_200w.jpg",