Lair x Post Malone: Backstage Pass Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Post Malone: The Lands Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Post Malone: Backstage Pass\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Post Malone: The Lands"}]},{"productId":450513,"name":"Secret Lair x Warhammer Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Warhammer Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450513_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450513/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-warhammer-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T14:37:17.62","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This bundle contains one copy of all six Warhammer drops in the October 2022 Superdrop.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer 40,000: Orks Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>* 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer Age of Sigmar Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer Blood Bowl Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer 40,000: Orks  \r\n<br>* 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer Age of Sigmar  \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Warhammer Blood Bowl"}]},{"productId":450514,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Big Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Big Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450514_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450514/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-big-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:53:11.19","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Since humankind evolved sentience, they’ve looked up at the stars and dreamed of something bigger than themselves. What they never realized until now is that each twinkling star in the sky is IN FACT a foil card from Magic: The Gathering®! Reach for those stars and gain all eight foil drops from October 2022, including our special collaborations with Junji Ito and Yoji Shinkawa. Of course, you may be wondering how we got all those foil cards up there, billions of years ago, in the adolescence of the universe. The answer is quite simple, but sadly it’s based on proprietary technology, so the suits won’t let us explain it. But we can say that the Big Dipper was supposed to be a baseball cap.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x If Looks Could Kill Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Junji Ito Foil Etched Edition (English)\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Junji Ito Foil Etched Edition (Japanese)\r\n<br>* 1x Special Guest:Yoji Shinkawa Traditional Foil Edition (English)\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Yoji Shinkawa Traditional Foil Edition (Japanese)\r\n<br>• 1x The Space Beyond the Stars Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Totally Spaced Out Galaxy Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":450515,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Big Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Big Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450515_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450515/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-big-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-20T13:53:56.157","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s actually great news that you’re considering the foil-free bundle for this stellar October 2022 Superdrop. See, we used quite a lot of the foil cards as heat-shielding panels to cover the Wizards of the Coast interstellar shuttle, which may not launch anyway depending on how much rocket fuel is “legal” to buy in the United States. Regardless, this bundle will net you the seven non-foil drops for October, including our exciting team-ups with Junji Ito and Yoji Shinkawa, so this is one launch you don’t want to miss. On an unrelated note, anyone know where we can find some...schmocket schfuel? Blasty gas? Up-go juice? Never mind.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x If Looks Could Kill \r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Junji Ito (English)\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Junji Ito (Japanese)\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Yoji Shinkawa (English)\r\n<br>• 1x Special Guest: Yoji Shinkawa (Japanese)\r\n<br>• 1x The Space Beyond the Stars \r\n<br>• 1x The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse"}]},{"productId":450518,"name":"Secret Lair x Post Malone: Backstage Pass - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Post Malone Backstage Pass Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450518_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450518/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-post-malone-backstage-pass-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:10:02.66","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Notable Magic: The Gathering enthusiast (and award-winning recording artist) Post Malone has entered the building. Posty is helping us celebrate 30 years of Magic, and that includes this Secret Lair—a labor of love for a lifelong fan of the game.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>In Secret Lair X Post Malone: Backstage Pass, he joined us in the tandem driver’s seat to pick the cards (they’re from one of his decks) and provide creative input. And to make this even more personal to Post, each card places him in a starring role. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for both Post and Magic fans alike, so don’t delay—grab this limited-time release before it’s gone for good!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil K’rrik, Son of Yawgmoth as “Post, Son of Rich”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Bolas’s Citadel as “Post’s Citadel”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Leshrac’s Sigil as “Post’s Sigil”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jet Medallion"}]},{"productId":450519,"name":"Secret Lair x Post Malone: Backstage Pass - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Post Malone Backstage Pass Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450519_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450519/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-post-malone-backstage-pass-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:09:47.503","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Notable Magic: The Gathering enthusiast (and award-winning recording artist) Post Malone has entered the building. Posty is helping us celebrate 30 years of Magic, and that includes this Secret Lair—a labor of love for a lifelong fan of the game.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>In Secret Lair X Post Malone: Backstage Pass, he joined us in the tandem driver’s seat to pick the cards (they’re from one of his decks) and provide creative input. And to make this even more personal to Post, each card places him in a starring role. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for both Post and Magic fans alike, so don’t delay—grab this limited-time release before it’s gone for good!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x K’rrik, Son of Yawgmoth as “Post, Son of Rich”\r\n<br>• 1x Bolas’s Citadel as “Post’s Citadel”\r\n<br>• 1x Leshrac’s Sigil as “Post’s Sigil”\r\n<br>• 1x Jet Medallion"}]},{"productId":450521,"name":"Secret Lair x Post Malone: The Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Post Malone T