erie of bio-mechanical monstrosities crafted in Shinkawa’s iconic ink and watercolor look, made even more special with an art-forward Borderless layout. Augment your collection or deck just the way you want—claim your copies in English or Japanese!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Tezzeret the Seeker\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Phyrexian Metamorph\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Skullclamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Solemn Simulacrum"}]},{"productId":450540,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Special Guest: Yoji Shinkawa (English) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Special Guest Yoji Shinkawa English Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450540_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450540/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-special-guest-yoji-shinkawa-english-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:11:10.4","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Legendary video game artist Yoji Shinkawa returns to Magic for an entire Secret Lair drop! Play a menagerie of bio-mechanical monstrosities crafted in Shinkawa’s iconic ink and watercolor look, made even more special with an art-forward Borderless layout. Augment your collection or deck just the way you want—claim your copies in English or Japanese!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Tezzeret the Seeker\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Phyrexian Metamorph\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Skullclamp\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Solemn Simulacrum"}]},{"productId":450617,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Space Beyond the Stars - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Space Beyond the Stars Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450617_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450617/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-space-beyond-the-stars-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:51:05.953","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>As recent telescopes have confirmed, outer space is big, cool, and totally mind-blowing. Thankfully, Magic artist Jérémie Solomon has captured all three of those aspects for this minimalist series of stellar styles. For greater accuracy, we had the illustrator complete these cards directly from the Wizards of the Coast Satellite Office, which is currently orbiting Neptune. Thanks, Jérémie—see you back on Earth in time to celebrate Magic 50!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Imprisoned in the Moon\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Stasis\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Prismatic Omen\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Wheel of Sun and Moon"}]},{"productId":450618,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Space Beyond the Stars - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Space Beyond the Stars Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450618_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450618/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-space-beyond-the-stars-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:51:18.92","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>As recent telescopes have confirmed, outer space is big, cool, and totally mind-blowing. Thankfully, Magic artist Jérémie Solomon has captured all three of those aspects for this minimalist series of stellar styles. For greater accuracy, we had the illustrator complete these cards directly from the Wizards of the Coast Satellite Office, which is currently orbiting Neptune. Thanks, Jérémie—see you back on Earth in time to celebrate Magic 50!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Imprisoned in the Moon\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Stasis\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Prismatic Omen\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Wheel of Sun and Moon"}]},{"productId":450619,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450619_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450619/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-weirdest-pets-in-the-multiverse-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T13:55:39.47","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We’ve seen all manner of creatures across Magic’s 30-year history, but this month we’re paying tribute to the critter companions nestled the deepest in our hearts: tiny little weirdos. Yes, these perfect angel darlings are domesticated and refuse to conform to conventional standards for cuteness! Illustrator Omar Rayyan's portraits pairing owner and pet drip with lush, storybook detail (and probably a healthy amount of monster drool). You’d be barking mad not to adopt each one of these cards into your deck or collection—especially if they followed you home.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Laboratory Maniac\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Stitcher's Supplier\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Beast Whisperer\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Vizier of the Menagerie\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Wood Elves"}]},{"productId":450620,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Weirdest Pets in the Multiverse Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450620_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450620/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-weirdest-pets-in-the-multiverse-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T13:55:22.283","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We’ve seen all manner of creatures across Magic’s 30-year history, but this month we’re paying tribute to the critter companions nestled the deepest in our hearts: tiny little weirdos. Yes, these perfect angel darlings are domesticated and refuse to conform to conventional standards for cuteness! Illustrator Omar Rayyan's portraits pairing owner and pet drip with lush, storybook detail (and probably a healthy amount of monster drool). You’d be barking mad not to adopt each one of these cards into your deck or collection—especially if they followed you home.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Laboratory Maniac\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Stitcher's Supplier\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Beast Whisperer\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Vizier of the Menagerie\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Wood Elves"}]},{"productId":450621,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Totally Spaced Out - Galaxy Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Totally Spaced Out Galaxy Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450621_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450621/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-totally-spaced-out-galaxy-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T15:36:09.207","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Unfinity is here at last! As a companion release for our spaciest Un-set in the Un-iverse, we’ve got some gorgeous lands finished in glittering galactic foil treatments. The sci-fi vibes are strong with this one—visit a lonely planet, dodge laser fire in an interstellar war, or seek new horizons across a dimensional rift! Combined with Unfinity, you’ll have a deck or collection full of the CARDS. OF. TOMORROW.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Galaxy Foil Ash Barrens\r\n<br>• 1x Galaxy Foil Command Beacon\r\n<br>• 1x Galaxy Foil Fabled Passage\r\n<br>• 1x Galaxy Foil Strip Mine"}]},{"productId":451236,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Extra Life 2022 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Extra Life 2022 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451236_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451236/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-extra-life-2022-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:45:57.547","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>WHAT IS EXTRA LIFE?\r\n<br>Formed in 2008, Extra Life is an annual fundraising event where people from all sorts of gaming spaces come together to support Children’s Miracle Network Hospitals. 100% of all donations (from original from-Wizards purchases only) go directly to Seattle Children’s Hospital in support of their Autism Center, and it’s a great way to give to those in need through the community you love.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>WHAT’S IN THE DROP?\r\n<br>We teamed up with some mega-talented kids to illustrate their creative visions of well-known Magic creatures like Birds of Paradise and Sliver Legion. Each of these masterworks was then placed in the capable hands of art superstars Tyler Jacobson, Andrea Radeck, and Steve Prescott for their own layer of creative interpretation! Everyone’s results are stunning, which is why it’s great that you’re getting two copies of each card in the drop—one with the kids’ art and another with the professional piece. One of our favorite parts has to be the flavor text, which arose from our conversations with the children. So why wait? Grab some amazing cards for your deck or collection and support a charitable cause!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Lathliss, Dragon Queen by Mohamed, age 4\r\n<br>• 1x Lathliss, Dragon Queen by Tyler Jacobson, age 39\r\n<br>• 1x Birds of Paradise by Eli, age 8\r\n<br>• 1x Birds of Paradise by Andrea Radeck, age 35\r\n<br>• 1x Sliver Legion by Said, age 6\r\n<br>• 1x Sliver Legion by Steve Prescott, age 48"}]},{"productId":451237,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Extra Life 2022 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Extra Life 2022 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451237_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451237/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-extra-life-2022-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:45:50.197","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>WHAT IS EXTRA LIFE?\r\n<br>Formed in 2008, Extra Life is an annual fundraising event where people from all sorts of gaming spaces come together to support Children’s Miracle Network Hospitals. 100% of all donations (from original from-Wizards purchases only) go directly to Seattle Children’s Hospital in support of their Autism Center, and it’s a great way to give to those in need through the community you love.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>WHAT’S IN THE DROP?\r\n<br>We teamed up with some mega-talented kids to illustrate their creative visions of well-known Magic creatures like Birds of Paradise and Sliver Legion. Each of these masterworks was then placed in the capable hands of art superstars Tyler Jacobson, Andrea Radeck, and Steve Prescott for their own layer of creative interpretation! Everyone’s results are stunning, which is why it’s great that you’re getting two copies of each card in the drop—one with the kids’ art and another with the professional piece. One of our favorite parts has to be the flavor text, which arose from our conversations with the children. So why wait? Grab some amazing cards for your deck or collection and support a charitable cause!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lathliss, Dragon Queen by Mohamed, age 4\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lathliss, Dragon Queen by Tyler Jacobson, age 39\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Birds of Paradise by Eli, age 8\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Birds of Paradise by Andrea Radeck, age 35\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sliver Legion by Said, age 6\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sliver Legion by Steve Prescott, age 48"}]},{"productId":452933,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Scorpio) Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Scorpio Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/452933_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/452933/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-scorpio-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:36:42.94","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Scorpio. Each bundle contains five drops, each containing five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo.\r\n<br>Contains 5 The Astrology Lands: Scorpio"}]},{"productId":452934,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Scorpio) Bundle - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Scorpio Bundle Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/452934_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/452934/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-scorpio-bundle-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:37:45.35","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Scorpio. Each bundle contains five drops, each containing five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo.\r\n<br>Contains 5 The Astrology Lands: Scorpio Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":452936,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Scorpio) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Scorpio Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/452936_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/452936/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-astrology-lands-scorpio-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:36:21.253","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Scorpio. Each bundle contains five drops, each containing five copies of an awesome astrological Swamp by Jeanne D’Angelo.\r\n<br>Contains 5 Full-Art Swamp"}]},{"productId":452937,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Astrology Lands (Scorpio) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Astrology Lands Scorpio Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/pr