Lands: Sagittarius Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":475395,"name":"Secret Lair: Astrology Lands (Sagittarius) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Astrology Lands Sagittarius Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/475395_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/475395/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-astrology-lands-sagittarius-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:26:33.457","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Sagittarius. Each bundle contains five drops, each containing five copies of an awesome astrological Forest by Jeanne D’Angelo.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 5x Full-Art Forest"}]},{"productId":475396,"name":"Secret Lair: Astrology Lands (Sagittarius) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Astrology Lands Sagittarius Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/475396_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/475396/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-astrology-lands-sagittarius-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-22T16:26:48.39","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Celebrate your sign! Be it sun, moon, or rising, let the world know: you’re a Sagittarius. Each bundle contains five drops, each containing five copies of an awesome astrological Forest by Jeanne D’Angelo.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 5x Foil Full-Art Forest"}]},{"productId":480439,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Prophets Predicted Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Prophets Predicted Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480439_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480439/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-prophets-predicted-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-27T18:05:09.13","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Prophets said we would be gifted a great bounty of cards—both foil and non. They believed these cards would bring calm to our ragged minds and peace to our tired hearts. In their visions, they saw cards that would lift our spirits and expand our consciousnesses. After all this time, generations of hope and struggle and strife, this bundle of foil and non-foil cards makes true the prophets’ words and strengthens our faith in their wisdom.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x The Prophets Predicted Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x The Prophets Predicted Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":480444,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Prophets Predicted Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Prophets Predicted Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480444_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480444/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-prophets-predicted-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:49:42.133","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Prophets knew there is only one rightful bundle: the foil bundle. Those misguided deviants who praise the non-foil bundle are heretics and fools. Reread the ancient texts! We were promised cards that shine with the brightness of the sunrise… cards that glisten like morning dew over a glorious meadow… cards that glimmer like the flames reflected in swords we carry. Yes, this foil bundle is the just bundle. And we must protect that truth.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ssssssnakessssss Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: All Will be One Step-and-Compleat Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The ’90s Binder Experience Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Draw Your Hand Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x City Styles Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sam Burley Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Faves Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":480451,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Prophets Predicted Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Prophets Predicted Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480451_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480451/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-prophets-predicted-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:49:20.593","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Prophets spoke plainly that which was commonly known—the non-foil bundle is the one true bundle. For when the sages spoke, they spoke the truth. And truth has no foil or shine. It is simple. It is pure. It is perfect. And the simple truth rings as loud as the unholy horde wailing at our gates—clad in their foiled armor and wielding their foiled armaments. But our non-foil bundle shall keep us safe. Our non-foil bundle shall deliver us from their devilry. Our non-foil bundle shall bless us with victory.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ssssssnakessssss \r\n<br>• 1x The ’90s Binder Experience \r\n<br>• 1x Draw Your Hand \r\n<br>• 1x City Styles \r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Sam Burley \r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Faves"}]},{"productId":480452,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: All Will B