me of the multiverse’s most iconic names in styles anything but “plane.” Perfect for uptown, downtown, and all around town, the outfits worn by these four legends are made to slay. \r\n<br>Fashion is what you collect. Style is what you play. Elegance has never been so attainable.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Sakashima the Impostor\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Massacre Girl\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Azusa, Lost but Seeking\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Teysa Karlov\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Paradise Mantle"}]},{"productId":480469,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: City Styles - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop City Styles Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480469_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480469/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-city-styles-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-10-14T19:47:28.897","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Vogue. Couture. Timeless. What can one say about a drop that speaks for itself?\r\n<br>Using borderless, full-art cards that pull the gaze and push the envelope, artist Tsubonari adorns some of the multiverse’s most iconic names in styles anything but “plane.” Perfect for uptown, downtown, and all around town, the outfits worn by these four legends are made to slay. \r\n<br>Fashion is what you collect. Style is what you play. Elegance has never been so attainable.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Sakashima the Impostor\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Massacre Girl\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Azusa, Lost but Seeking\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Teysa Karlov\r\n<br>• 1x Borderless Paradise Mantle"}]},{"productId":480473,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Sam Burley - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Sam Burley Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480473_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480473/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-sam-burley-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:44:33.29","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Sam Burley has been enchanting the Magic Community ever since his incredible art was first seen in Avacyn Restored eleven years ago. And now, Secret Lair is excited release a drop of cards in the Jund color group selected by Sam himself featuring his new original art.\r\n<br>This is what Sam had to say about including Braid of Fire, “I should also mention this is a card I loooove. It was at the top of my list. My default deck is mono-red, and I’m just obsessed with how weird and baffling and kind of awesome the card is. I started playing around Ice Age, so I remember both cumulative upkeep and mana burn well. And the fact that this aged in such a good way with the rule change makes it even weirder and makes me love it more. Exactly the type of old card that gives me the feel-goods in Commander.”\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x – Foil Braid of Fire\r\n<br>• 1x – Foil Koth of the Hammer\r\n<br>• 1x – Foil Master of the Wild Hunt\r\n<br>• 1x – Foil Karrthus, Tyrant of Jund"}]},{"productId":480474,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Sam Burley - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Sam Burley Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/480474_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/480474/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-sam-burley-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:44:05.527","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Sam Burley has been enchanting the Magic Community ever since his incredible art was first seen in Avacyn Restored eleven years ago. And now, Secret Lair is excited release a drop of cards in the Jund color group selected by Sam himself featuring his new original art.\r\n<br>This is what Sam had to say about including Braid of Fire, “I should also mention this is a card I loooove. It was at the top of my list. My default deck is mono-red, and I’m just obsessed with how weird and baffling and kind of awesome the card is. I started playing around Ice Age, so I remember both cumulative upkeep and mana burn well. And the fact that this aged in such a good way with the rule change makes it even weirder and makes me love it more. Exactly the type of old card that gives me the feel-goods in Commander.”\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x – Braid of Fire\r\n<br>• 1x – Koth of the Hammer\r\n<br>• 1x – Master of the Wild Hunt\r\n<br>• 1x – Karrthus, Tyrant of Jund"}]},{"productId":484582,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: More Borderless Planeswalkers (WPN Exclusive) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop More Borderless Planeswalkers WPN Exclusive Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/484582_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/484582/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-more-borderless-planeswalkers-wpn-exclusive-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-02-25T20:44:33.863","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This product contains four Planeswalkers in the Borderless Manga special treatment.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ugin, the Ineffable\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sorin, Imperious Bloodlord\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sarkhan, Dragonsoul\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166237022"}]},{"productId":487513,"name":"Secret Lair: Festival in a Box Minneapolis 2023 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Festival in a Box Minneapolis 2023 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487513_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487513/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-festival-in-a-box-minneapolis-2023-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:15:02.593","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Can’t attend MagicCon: Minneapolis 2023 in person? Bring the party to your front door with Festival in a Box! When you crack open each bundle, you’ll find full Draft Booster boxes of Phyrexia: All Will Be One and The Brothers’ War, plus convention-only goodies like the exclusive Legendary Flyers (Not That Kind) Foil Edition Secret Lair drop, a foil promo Arcane Signet, and an entire box of Mystery Booster Convention Edition! So go ahead and throw a festival at home—the Magic will still be there.\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Legendary Flyers (Not That Kind) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexia: All Will Be One Draft Booster Box\r\n<br>• 1x The Brothers’ War Draft Booster Box  \r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Arcane Signet"}]},{"productId":487514,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Legendary Flyers (Not That Kind) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Legendary Flyers Not That Kind Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487514_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https:/