","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493793/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-its-raining-foils-and-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-27T18:46:33.217","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Folks, we have reports coming in that it’s raining Foils and Non-Foils out there. If you look at our map, you’ll see that these drops originated out of the Pacific Northwest and are expected to move across the planes. We’re seeing Showcase drops, Artist Series drops, and a few drops with non-traditional art all mixed together. It’s hard to say at this point exactly how this storm will affect your collections at home, but it’s likely that those decks will be absolutely flooded with some high-quality cards.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Those Foils Are Really Coming Down Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Those Non-Foils Just Won’t Let Up Bundle"}]},{"productId":493794,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Those Foils Are Really Coming Down Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Those Foils Are Really Coming Down Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493794_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493794/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-those-foils-are-really-coming-down-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-27T18:47:21.463","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Folks, it looks like those foils are really coming down out there. Light is flashing across the sky as foils flutter down from the heavens into our excited hands. Please watch out for the three stunning Halo Foil drops as well, these rare treatments are truly electric. Experts advise not to stare directly at these shimmering collectibles while operating heavy machinery as it can be dangerous. The good news is it’s all highs and no lows, but it’s HOT! HOT! HOT!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 1\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 2\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 3\r\n<br>• 1x Cool Ocean Breeze Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Nature Is Adorable Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Rebecca Guay Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Randy Vargas Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Alayna Danner Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":493795,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Those Non-Foils Just Won't Let Up Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Those Non Foils Just Wont Let Up Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493795_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493795/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-those-non-foils-just-wont-let-up-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-27T18:48:03.99","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Folks, those non-foils just won’t let up out there. Experts are saying this card system is unlike anything we’ve ever seen before—a once-in-a-generation superdrop. Luckily, conditions will be perfect to stay at home with friends, playing your favorite card game. If you do need to go out, all I can say is this: you’re not going to want to leave home without a pack of sleeves.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Cool Ocean Breeze\r\n<br>• 1x Nature Is Adorable\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Rebecca Guay\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Randy Vargas\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Alayna Danner"}]},{"productId":493796,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: March of the Machine Bundle - Halo Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop March of the Machine Bundle Halo Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493796_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493796/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-march-of-the-machine-bundle-halo-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:30:47.253","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This bundle memorializes the heroic defense against the Machine Legion’s march across the Multiverse with one copy of each of the three Showcase: March of the Machine drops. That’s 15 unique showcase cards, each representing a different plane at war with Phyrexia, all in stunning Halo Foil. Get the bundle, join the fight. The Multiverse is counting on you. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 1\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 2\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 3"}]},{"productId":493799,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 1 - Halo Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase March of the Machine Vol 1 Halo Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493799_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493799/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-march-of-the-machine-vol-1-halo-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:29:37.82","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Incoming reports from all corners of the Multiverse indicate the Machine Legion is sweeping across the planes, spreading their Phyrexian curse to all those unlucky enough to stand in their path! But all hope is not lost—many worlds remain defiant.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Support the resistance with these showcase treatments in stunning Halo Foil from New Capenna, Eldraine, Innistrad, Kaladesh, and Kaldheim featuring beautiful art by Samy Halim, Omar Rayyan, Samuel Araya, Warren Mahy, and Matt Stikker.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Wheel and Deal\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Questing Beast\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Olivia Voldaren\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Walking Ballista\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil The World Tree"}]},{"productId":493802,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 2 - Halo Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase March of the Machine Vol 2 Halo Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493802_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493802/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-march-of-the-machine-vol-2-halo-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:29:50.757","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>They say night is darkest before the dawn, but how can the sun rise when the Phyrexian legion blots out our sky? Under this menacing mechanical umbra, we look to the resistance efforts on other worlds for inspiration.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Find the will to keep fighting in these showcase treatments in spectacular Halo Foil from Kamigawa, Ixalan, Tarkir, Zendikar, and New Phyrexia with stunning art by Rorubei, Yeong-Hao Han, Domenico Cava, Jessica Rossier, and JungShan.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Higure, the Still Wind\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Nezahal, Primal Tide\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Dragonlord Kolaghan\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Mina and Denn, Wildborn\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Xantcha, Sleeper Agent"}]},{"productId":493803,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: March of the Machine Vol. 3 - Halo Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase March of the Machine Vol 3 Halo Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493803_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493803/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-march-of-the-machine-vol-3-halo-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T20:30:32.437","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This battle has ended. Our legion has grown. We will march on and continue our domination of the Multiverse. All will be compleat. All will be one.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>We shall be guided in our campaign to assimilate the resistance by these showcase treatments in astonishing Halo Foil from Strixhaven, Ravnica, Ikoria, Theros, and Dominaria with perfect art by Rovina Cai, Alex Dos Diaz, Steve Ellis, Jason A. Engle, and Lisa Heidhoff.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Misdirection\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Utvara Hellkite\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Kogla, the Titan Ape\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Nyxbloom Ancient\r\n<br>• 1x Halo Foil Jhoira, Weatherlight Captain"}]},{"productId":493805,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Alayna Danner - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Alayna Danner Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493805_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493805/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-alayna-danner-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:14:42.483","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Alayna Danner loves angels. Like, a lot. She also loves illustrating breathtaking, vibrant artwork, which she’s been doing for Magic since Dominaria in 2018. But more importantly… SHE LOVES ANGELS. So she selected a set of amazing angels and angelic lands for her Artist Series. She even wrote two brand new cantos to the Song of All that you can find in the flavor text of these cards, which include the first reprint of Emeria, the Sky Ruin since Commander 2014.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Linvala, Keeper of Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sunblast Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Emeria, the Sky Ruin\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Seraph Sanctuary"}]},{"productId":493806,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Alayna Danner - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Alayna Danner Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493806_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493806/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-alayna-danner-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:14:09.967","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Alayna Danner loves angels. Like, a lot. She also loves illustrating breathtaking, vibrant artwork, which she’s been doing for Magic since Dominaria in 2018. But more importantly… SHE LOVES ANGELS. So she selected a set of amazing angels and angelic lands for her Artist Series. She even wrote two brand new cantos to the Song of All that you can find in the flavor text of these cards, which include the first reprint of Emeria, the Sky Ruin since Commander 2014.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Linvala, Keeper of Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Sunblast Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Emeria, the Sky Ruin\r\n<br>• 1x Seraph Sanctuary"}]},{"productId":493807,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Randy Vargas - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Randy Vargas Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493807_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493807/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-randy-vargas-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:40:29.753","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Science fiction and fantasy illustrator Randy Vargas’s first contribution to Magic was two cards in 2017’s Hour of Devastation. Ever since, Randy has been bringing unforgettable scenes to life across multiple sets like Adventures in the Forgotten Realms, Throne of Eldraine, Zendikar Rising and more. With this series, Randy brings his dynamic and captivating style to a truly amazing set of cards, which includes the first reprint of Grand Abolisher since Archenemy: Nicol Bolas in 2017 and the first non-List reprint of Umezawa’s Jitte since 2016.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Grand Abolisher\r\n<br>• 1x Selfless Savior\r\n<br>• 1x Akroma, Angel of Fury\r\n<br>• 1x Umezawa’s Jitte"}]},{"productId":493808,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Randy Vargas - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Randy Vargas Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493808_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493808/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-randy-vargas-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:40:37.373","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Science fiction and fantasy illustrator Randy Vargas’s first contribution to Magic was two cards in 2017’s Hour of Devastation. Ever since, Randy has been bringing unforgettable scenes to life across multiple sets like Adventures in the Forgotten Realms, Throne of Eldraine, Zendikar Rising and more. With this series, Randy brings his dynamic and captivating style to a truly amazing set of cards, which includes the first reprint of Grand Abolisher since Archenemy: Nicol Bolas in 2017 and the first non-List reprint of Umezawa’s Jitte since 2016.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Grand Abolisher\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Selfless Savior\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Akroma, Angel of Fury\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Umezawa’s Jitte"}]},{"productId":493809,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Rebecca Guay - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Rebecca Guay Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493809_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493809/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-rebecca-guay-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:41:06.11","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Rebecca Guay has been a fan-favorite artist ever since she first illustrated three cards for the Alliances expansion in 1996. Since then, Rebecca has contributed more than 150 pieces to Magic: The Gathering, including some of the most iconic and evocative art the game has seen. With this series, Rebecca brings her distinctive artistic style and poetry to some fantastic cards, including the first reprint of Serra the Benevolent and an all-new take on Stoneforge Mystic. Muy Guay!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Cleansing Nova\r\n<br>• 1x Serra the Benevolent\r\n<br>• 1x Stoneforge Mystic\r\n<br>• 1x Muddle the Mixture"}]},{"productId":493810,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Rebecca Guay - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Rebecca Guay Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493810_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493810/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-rebecca-guay-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:41:17.487","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Rebecca Guay has been a fan-favorite artist ever since she first illustrated three cards for the Alliances expansion in 1996. Since then, Rebecca has contributed more than 150 pieces to Magic: The Gathering, including some of the most iconic and evocative art the game has seen. With this series, Rebecca brings her distinctive artistic style and poetry to some fantastic cards, including the first reprint of Serra the Benevolent and an all-new take on Stoneforge Mystic. Muy Guay!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Cleansing Nova\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Serra the Benevolent\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Stoneforge Mystic\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Muddle the Mixture"}]},{"productId":493811,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Nature is Adorable - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Nature is Adorable Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493811_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493811/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-nature-is-adorable-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:37:42.957","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In one of the most endearing clearings in the forest, you can find cute critters and beautiful beasties hiding behind every bramble, all brought to life with delightful art by Aya Kakeda. And if you keep your eyes peeled, you might even catch a glimpse of a lovely little Nature’s Will (we haven’t seen a new one of those since 2004). But watch out, these charming little paws and claws are still sharp.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Joraga Treespeaker\r\n<br>• 1x Nature’s Will\r\n<br>• 1x Ulvenwald Tracker\r\n<br>• 1x Yeva, Nature’s Herald"}]},{"productId":493812,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Nature is Adorable - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Nature is Adorable Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493812_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493812/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-nature-is-adorable-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:38:03.17","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In one of the most endearing clearings in the forest, you can find cute critters and beautiful beasties hiding behind every bramble, all brought to life with delightful art by Aya Kakeda. And if you keep your eyes peeled, you might even catch a glimpse of a lovely little Nature’s Will (we haven’t seen a new one of those since 2004). But watch out, these charming little paws and claws are still sharp.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Joraga Treespeaker\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nature’s Will\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ulvenwald Tracker\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Yeva, Nature’s Herald"}]},{"productId":493813,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Cool Ocean Breeze - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Cool Ocean Breeze Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493813_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493813/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-cool-ocean-breeze-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:28:12.823","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>I just heard about this AMAZING pool party! Thassa’s Oracle made the coolest playlist, Llawan is bringing her royal coterie and her pet cuttlefish, plus the Master of Waves is even turning the whole pool into a lazy river. Thassa said everyone’s invited so grab your swimsuit and bring some chips. Plus, all the art was done by Lauren YS. And she’s so cool.\r\n<br>It’s gonna be AWESOME.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Llawan, Cephalid Empress\r\n<br>• 1x Master of Waves\r\n<br>• 1x Thassa, Deep-Dwelling\r\n<br>• 1x Thassa’s Oracle"}]},{"productId":493814,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Cool Ocean Breeze - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Cool Ocean Breeze Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/493814_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/493814/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-cool-ocean-breeze-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:27:57.373","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>I just heard about this AMAZING pool party! Thassa’s Oracle made the coolest playlist, Llawan is bringing her royal coterie and her pet cuttlefish, plus the Master of Waves is even turning the whole pool into a lazy river. Thassa said everyone’s invited so grab your swimsuit and bring some chips. Plus, all the art was done by Lauren YS. And she’s so cool.\r\n<br>It’s gonna be AWESOME.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Llawan, Cephalid Empress\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Master of Waves\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Thassa, Deep-Dwelling\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Thassa’s Oracle"}]},{"productId":496129,"name":"Secret Lair Commander Deck: From Cute to Brute","cleanName":"Secret Lair Commander Deck From Cute to Brute","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496129_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496129/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-commander-deck-from-cute-to-brute","modifiedOn":"2024-01-10T17:53:41.3","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Secret Lair’s exclusive new Commander deck celebrates ARGH RELEASING THE INNER BEAST by turning your creatures from little cuties into BIG BAD BRUTIES. Our new 100-card Commander deck, From Cute to Brute, includes 42 double-faced reprints and five all-new traditional foil borderless double-faced cards featuring a “cute” side with original art by Nana Qi and a “BRUTE” SIDE WITH ORIGINAL ART BY GODMACHINE. Transform your adorable critters into TERRIFYING MONSTERS WHILE YOU WATCH YOUR ADVERSARIES TRANSFORM INTO SCARED LITTLE BABIES, MWAHAHAHA! THERE IS NO ESCAPE FROM YOUR DOOM!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Esika, God of the Tree // The Prismatic Bridge\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Archangel Avacyn // Avacyn, the Purifier\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Bloodline Keeper // Lord of Lineage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Nicol Bolas, the Ravager // Nicol Bolas, the Arisen\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Borderless Westvale Abbey // Ormendahl, Profane Prince\r\n<br>• 42x Double-Faced Reprints\r\n<br>• 53x Single-Faced Reprints\r\n<br>• 15x Double-Faced Tokens\r\n<br>• 5x Display Cards"}]},{"productId":497381,"name":"Secret Lair: Festival in a Box Barcelona 2023 - Commander Fan Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Festival in a Box Barcelona 2023 Commander Fan Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/497381_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/497381/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-festival-in-a-box-barcelona-2023-commander-fan-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:14:23.273","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Can't attend MagicCon: Barcelona? No worries, you can bring convention swag to a sunny beach near you!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This beast of a bundle is perfect for players who love Commander. It contains six powerful commander decks plus one Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box and one foil Arcane Signet. On top of all that, there's a unique Relentless Rats that's only available at MagicCon: Barcelona and here!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box  \r\n<br>• 1x Commander Legends: Battle for Baldur’s Gate Commander Deck - Party Time\r\n<br>• 1x Commander Legends: Battle for Baldur’s Gate Commander Deck - Mind Flayarrrs\r\n<br>• 1x Commander Legends: Battle for Baldur’s Gate Commander Deck - Draconic Dissent\r\n<br>• 1x Commander Legends: Battle for Baldur’s Gate Commander Deck - Exit from Exile\r\n<br>• 1x The Brothers’ War Commander Deck - Mishra's Burnished Banner\r\n<br>• 1x The Brothers’ War Commander Deck - Urza's Iron Alliance\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Relentless Rats"}]},{"productId":497382,"name":"Secret Lair: Festival in a Box Barcelona 2023 - Drafter's Dream Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Festival in a Box Barcelona 2023 Drafters Dream Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/497382_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/497382/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-festival-in-a-box-barcelona-2023-drafters-dream-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-08-24T13:14:36.823","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Can't attend MagicCon: Barcelona? No worries, you can bring convention swag to a sunny beach near you!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This beastly bundle is truly a drafter's dream. It contains one The Brothers’ War Draft Booster Box, one Dominaria Remastered Draft Booster Box plus one Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box and one foil Arcane Signet. On top of all that, we've included a unique Relentless Rats that's only available at MagicCon: Barcelona and here.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box  \r\n<br>• 1x The Brothers’ War Draft Booster Box\r\n<br>• 1x Dominaria Remastered Draft Booster Box\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Relentless Rats"}]},{"productId":501823,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Shredding A Wave of Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Shredding A Wave of Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501823_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501823/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-shredding-a-wave-of-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-11-06T19:38:46.69","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dudes and dudettes! Grab your boards and wax ’em up because summer is here and there’s a mondo wave of cards on the horizon. This sicko selection is rolling in, cresting high, and crashing hard. The foils are shining in the sun and the nonfoils are pure stoke. Just don’t lose your chill or you’ll be eating sand like a Barney.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Carving Up a Barrel of Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Tearing Up A Sick Tube of Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":501826,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Carving Up A Barrel of Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Carving Up A Barrel of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501826_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501826/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-carving-up-a-barrel-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-11-06T19:39:23.383","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Calling the saltwater dawn patrol—there’s a bodacious barrel of foils building offshore. It’s glistening in the sun, perfect to ride, ready to make chumps into champions. But this swell of shining cards is forming a once-in-a-generation tube. So if you’re gonna drop in, try not to wipe out.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x More Adventures in Middle-earth™ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Death Is Temporary, Metal Is Forever Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Stars Gaze Back Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin & Squabblin’ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: the Mountain Goats Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Bad to the Bones Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":501828,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Tearing Up A Sick Tube of Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Tearing Up A Sick Tube of Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501828_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501828/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-tearing-up-a-sick-tube-of-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-11-06T19:40:19.447","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Yo surf rats, this sick tube of nonfoils is primed and ready for only the raddest rippers. So snag your surf stick and prep to tear up that liquid canvas. Only the true wave chasers can grab all these epic cards and still rock the shaka without heading to the hack shack.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x More Adventures in Middle-earth™\r\n<br>• 1x Death Is Temporary, Metal Is Forever\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee\r\n<br>• 1x The Stars Gaze Back\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin & Squabblin’\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: the Mountain Goats\r\n<br>• 1x Bad to the Bones"}]},{"productId":501833,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: More Adventures in Middle-earth Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop More Adventures in Middle earth Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501833_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501833/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-more-adventures-in-middle-earth-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T15:17:39.13","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Famous up and down the coasts of the Belegaer, this bundle celebrates legendary artist Ralph Bakshi and includes our foil and nonfoil More Adventures in Middle-earth™ drops, featuring art from Bakshi’s 1978 animated classic <em>The Lord of the Rings</em>.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x More Adventures in <em>Middle-earth</em> Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x More Adventures in <em>Middle-earth</em>"}]},{"productId":501834,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: More Adventures in Middle-earth - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop More Adventures in Middle earth Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501834_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501834/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-more-adventures-in-middle-earth-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:26:02.727","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In far-off lands, legend tells of a powerful animator called Ralph Bakshi, whose art would come to life on a silver screen. It is said his handiwork influenced many and his talent impressed all. This set of cards celebrates his unparalleled wizardry and features art directly pulled from Bakshi’s 1978 animated classic, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em>. With these few cards, one might be able to conquer, or save, all of <em>Middle-earth</em>.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Slip On the Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gandalf, Friend of the Shire\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mirror of Galadriel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Shire Terrace"}]},{"productId":501835,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: More Adventures in Middle-earth - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop More Adventures in Middle earth Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501835_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501835/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-more-adventures-in-middle-earth-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:25:38.83","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In far-off lands, legend tells of a powerful animator called Ralph Bakshi, whose art would come to life on a silver screen. It is said his handiwork influenced many and his talent impressed all. This set of cards celebrates his unparalleled wizardry and features art directly pulled from Bakshi’s 1978 animated classic, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em>. With these few cards, one might be able to conquer, or save, all of <em>Middle-earth</em>.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Slip On the Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Gandalf, Friend of the Shire\r\n<br>• 1x Mirror of Galadriel\r\n<br>• 1x Shire Terrace"}]},{"productId":501836,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Death Is Temporary, Metal Is Forever - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Death Is Temporary Metal Is Forever Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501836_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501836/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-death-is-temporary-metal-is-forever-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:29:02.003","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Syr Konrad, the Grim\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Underworld Dreams\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Waste Not\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Wheel of Misfortune\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nekusar, the Mindrazer"}]},{"productId":501839,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Death Is Temporary, Metal Is Forever - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Death Is Temporary Metal Is Forever Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501839_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId"