dOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin Lackey\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin Matron\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin Recruiter\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin Grandee\r\n<br>• 1x Shattergang Brothers"}]},{"productId":501843,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Bad to the Bones - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Bad to the Bones Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501843_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501843/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-bad-to-the-bones-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:48:02.36","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ride or die? Why not both!?!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This drop proves you don’t need guts to be a daredevil and you can always ride hard even if you have no body to ride with.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Just open the throttle, keep the rubber side down, and remember—only numbskulls forget their helmet.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Ryan Quickfall\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Bottomless Pit\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Necrogen Mists\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reassembling Skeleton\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tinybones, Trinket Thief\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Geier Reach Sanitarium"}]},{"productId":501844,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Bad to the Bones - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Bad to the Bones Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501844_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501844/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-bad-to-the-bones-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T19:47:38.32","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ride or die? Why not both!?!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This drop proves you don’t need guts to be a daredevil and you can always ride hard even if you have no body to ride with.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Just open the throttle, keep the rubber side down, and remember—only numbskulls forget their helmet.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Ryan Quickfall\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Bottomless Pit\r\n<br>• 1x Necrogen Mists\r\n<br>• 1x Reassembling Skeleton\r\n<br>• 1x Tinybones, Trinket Thief\r\n<br>• 1x Geier Reach Sanitarium"}]},{"productId":501845,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Ryan Alexander Lee Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501845_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501845/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-ryan-alexander-lee-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:42:20.357","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Since illustrating Sphinx’s Disciple for Born of the Gods in 2014, Ryan Alexander Lee has illustrated over 50 compelling cards for Magic: The Gathering. Ryan is known for telling stories with his art, so it’s no surprise that he used this Artist Series drop to present an epic saga through the cards, art, and flavor text.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Inspired by the liner notes in an old heavy metal album, these cards show a hero charged by the gods to do battle with a colossus in the shadowlands beyond the known world. Nemesis of Reason represents the hero’s initial challenge, Gaea’s Blessing shows the hero’s first real sacrifice, Twilight Prophet depicts the hero’s greatest and final sacrifice, and the Worldspine Wurm is the monster at the end of the journey.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>And with these incredible cards, players around the world can tell all new stories right at their gaming tables.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nemesis of Reason\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gaea’s Blessing\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Twilight Prophet\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Worldspine Wurm\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Wurm Token"}]},{"productId":501846,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Ryan Alexander Lee Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501846_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501846/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-ryan-alexander-lee-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:42:09.113","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Since illustrating Sphinx’s Disciple for Born of the Gods in 2014, Ryan Alexander Lee has illustrated over 50 compelling cards for Magic: The Gathering. Ryan is known for telling stories with his art, so it’s no surprise that he used this Artist Series drop to present an epic saga through the cards, art, and flavor text.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Inspired by the liner notes in an old heavy metal album, these cards show a hero charged by the gods to do battle with a colossus in the shadowlands beyond the known world. Nemesis of Reason represents the hero’s initial challenge, Gaea’s Blessing shows the hero’s first real sacrifice, Twilight Prophet depicts the hero’s greatest and final sacrifice, and the Worldspine Wurm is the monster at the end of the journey.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>And with these incredible cards, players around the world can tell all new stories right at their gaming tables.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Nemesis of Reason\r\n<br>• 1x Gaea’s Blessing\r\n<br>• 1x Twilight Prophet\r\n<br>• 1x Worldspine Wurm\r\n<br>• 1x Wurm Token"}]},{"productId":501847,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Stars Gaze Back - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Stars Gaze Back Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501847_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501847/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-stars-gaze-back-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:58:59.163","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Beyond the celestial veil, towering elementals study us through eyes of starfire.\r\n<br>They dream and reality obeys—our destiny is their plaything.\r\n<br>And the reverie never ends.\r\n<br>Art by Yu Maeda\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Flamekin Harbinger\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Omnath, Locus of Rage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Risen Reef\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Voice of Resurgence"}]},{"productId":501848,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Stars Gaze Back - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Stars Gaze Back Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501848_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501848/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-stars-gaze-back-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T21:58:45.55","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Beyond the celestial veil, towering elementals study us through eyes of starfire.\r\n<br>They dream and reality obeys—our destiny is their plaything.\r\n<br>And the reverie never ends.\r\n<br>Art by Yu Maeda\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Flamekin Harbinger\r\n<br>• 1x Omnath, Locus of Rage\r\n<br>• 1x Risen Reef\r\n<br>• 1x Voice of Resurgence"}]},{"productId":501849,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: the Mountain Goats - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring the Mountain Goats Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501849_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501849/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-the-mountain-goats-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:59:52.65","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>John Darnielle of the Mountain Goats loves Magic. For years, his pinned tweet has been “I want to play Magic: The Gathering,” he’s posted songs celebrating his progress in MTG Arena, and he even streamed a live concert for the Mountain Goats album In League with Dragons, from Wizards of the Coast headquarters.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Knowing this drop was in good hooves, we gave the Mountain Goats full creative control. Darnielle set these cards on Lorwyn, created the art descriptions, hand selected the artists, and reviewed the art as it was being produced. On top of all that, he penned the epic prophecy featured in the flavor text across these 10 cards.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>With the first ever extended art on basic lands, these mountains truly are the home of the Mountain Goats.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Darrell Riche, Victor Adame Minguez, Mark Zug, Warren Mahy, Larry MacDougall, Omar Rayyan, Martina Pilcerova, Fred Fields, Ron Spears, Erica Williams\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 10x Foil Mountain"}]},{"productId":501850,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: the Mountain Goats - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring the Mountain Goats Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501850_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501850/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-the-mountain-goats-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:59:42.77","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>John Darnielle of the Mountain Goats loves Magic. For years, his pinned tweet has been “I want to play Magic: The Gathering,” he’s posted songs celebrating his progress in MTG Arena, and he even streamed a live concert for the Mountain Goats album In League with Dragons, from Wizards of the Coast headquarters.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Knowing this drop was in good hooves, we gave the Mountain Goats full creative control. Darnielle set these cards on Lorwyn, created the art descriptions, hand selected the artists, and reviewed the art as it was being produced. On top of all that, he penned the epic prophecy featured in the flavor text across these 10 cards.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>With the first ever extended art on basic lands, these mountains truly are the home of the Mountain Goats.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Darrell Riche, Victor Adame Minguez, Mark Zug, Warren Mahy, Larry MacDougall, Omar Rayyan, Martina Pilcerova, Fred Fields, Ron Spears, Erica Williams\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 10x Mountain"}]},{"productId":511863,"name":"Secret Lair Commander Deck: Angels: They're Just Like Us but Cooler and with Wings","cleanName":"Secret Lair Commander Deck Angels Theyre Just Like Us but Cooler and with Wings","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/511863_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/511863/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-commander-deck-angels-theyre-just-like-us-but-cooler-and-with-wings","modifiedOn":"2023-10-02T15:26:50.423","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair’s newest Commander deck, Angels: They’re Just Like Us but Cooler and with Wings, features five consecrated cards with angelic art from Scott M. Fischer and, for the first time ever in print, an Arden Angel from the 2001 video game <em>Magic: The Gathering</em>.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>So unfurl your fiery wings, draw your radiant blade, and lead this empyrean vanguard across the celestial tapestry to rend asunder those shadows threatening to engulf the righteous.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gisela, the Broken Blade // Brisela, Voice of Nightmares\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Bruna, the Fading Light // Brisela, Voice of Nightmares\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Archangel of Thune\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Court of Grace\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Commander’s Plate\r\n<br>• 95x Reprints (including 6x first-time foil reprints, 30x first-time foil basic lands)\r\n<br>• 10x Double-Faced Tokens including new Angel and Spirit tokens with art by Scott M. Fischer.\r\n<br>• 2x Double-Faced Display Cards"}]},{"productId":511864,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Seven In Heaven Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Seven In Heaven Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/511864_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/511864/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-seven-in-heaven-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-11-06T19:51:17.347","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In reverence of our new Secret Lair Commander deck, Angels: They’re Just Like Us but Cooler and with Wings, we’re bundling seven heavenly products for the devoted faithful. With this divine deal, you’ll get the new Commander deck in addition to six sublime drops from the Summer Superdrop 2023. It’d be a sin to miss this blessed bundle.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair Commander Deck | Angels: They’re Just Like Us but Cooler and with Wings\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Ryan Alexander Lee\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin & Squabblin’ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Goblin & Squabblin’\r\n<br>• 1x Bad to the Bones Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Bad to the Bones"}]},{"productId":514917,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: This One Goes Out To My Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop This One Goes Out To My Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/514917_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/514917/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-this-one-goes-out-to-my-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-12-18T19:27:38.05","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Thank you all for being here tonight! Your energy is electric, and I can feel all your love up here on stage. When I was writing this bundle, I really put everything into it. My heart. My soul. And of course, all my shimmering foils and all my timeless non-foils. Let’s create an amazing moment of pure magic together.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x This One Is Dedicated to My Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x This One Is For My Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":514919,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: This One Is Dedicated To My Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop This One Is Dedicated To My Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/514919_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/514919/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-this-one-is-dedicated-to-my-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-12-18T19:27:27.417","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>What a great crowd! I know I’m the one on stage, but you’re the real stars tonight. So this bundle is for all my bright-eyed foils out there. Each and every one of your faces shines even more than this spotlight. Just remember, even in the darkest times, there’s still a brightness deep within you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Kev Walker Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Keep Partying Hard, Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Buggin’ Out Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Absolute Annihilation Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Now on VHS! Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Magic: The Baseballing Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Gary Baseman Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":514921,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: This One Is For My Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop This One Is For My Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/514921_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/514921/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-this-one-is-for-my-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2023-12-18T19:27:17.09","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Okay for this last one, we’re bringing back a fan favorite that you all know and love. It’s a timeless non-foil bundle I made as a celebration of individuality and embracing who you truly are—bordered or borderless, classic or contemporary, sweet or scary. If you know the flavor text, sing along.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Kev Walker\r\n<br>• 1x Keep Partying Hard, Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible\r\n<br>• 1x Buggin’ Out\r\n<br>• 1x Absolute Annihilation\r\n<br>• 1x Now on VHS!\r\n<br>• 1x Magic: The Baseballing\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Gary Baseman"}]},{"productId":514991,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Bugs, Bands & Blockbusters Bundle - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Bugs Bands and Blockbusters Bundle Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/514991_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/514991/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-bugs-bands-and-blockbusters-bundle-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:06:07.527","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Picture this: it’s 2:00 AM and your record label calls. They say if you don’t record a new hit in the morning, they’ll drop you. So your producer suggests you write a song about something you love, but you have so many passions! How can you ever settle on just one?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Yet again, you must make an impossible decision from the three things you love most: playing live music, renting classic VHS tapes, or collecting and cataloguing rare insects as an amateur entomologist. Which will inspire your next single?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Sound familiar? Don’t worry, we’ve all been there. Luckily, the Bugs, Bands & Blockbusters bundle is filled with cards like Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest; Godo, Bandit Warlord; and The First Sliver, so you’ll never be at a loss for lyrical inspiration again. The only thing you’ll have to worry about is what outfit to wear to the MTG Music Awards.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Keep Partying Hard, Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Buggin’ Out Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Now on VHS! Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":514992,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Bugs, Bands & Blockbusters Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Bugs Bands and Blockbusters Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/514992_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/514992/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-bugs-bands-and-blockbusters-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:02:01.843","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Picture this: it’s 2:00 AM and your record label calls. They say if you don’t record a new hit in the morning, they’ll drop you. So your producer suggests you write a song about something you love, but you have so many passions! How can you ever settle on just one?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Yet again, you must make an impossible decision from the three things you love most: playing live music, renting classic VHS tapes, or collecting and cataloguing rare insects as an amateur entomologist. Which will inspire your next single?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Sound familiar? Don’t worry, we’ve all been there. Luckily, the Bugs, Bands & Blockbusters bundle is filled with cards like Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest; Godo, Bandit Warlord; and The First Sliver, so you’ll never be at a loss for lyrical inspiration aga