\r\n<br>Hello, this is Zachary with Bankbuster Video. I’m calling regarding an issue with your account. It seems that you have several overdue rentals, including “Rewind,” “Food Chain,” “Rampant Growth,” and “The First Sliver.”\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Oh, I love that series! You gotta watch the rest.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Anyway, these movies were due back in 1997 and my system indicates you currently owe $976.65 in late fees. We rely on our customers to return movies in a timely manner to keep our collection complete for others to enjoy, so please drop them off at your earliest convenience. Thank you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Julie Dillon, Chris Seaman, David Robert Hovey, Svetlin Velinov, and Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rewind\r\n<br>• 1x Food Chain\r\n<br>• 1x Rampant Growth\r\n<br>* 1x The First Sliver"}]},{"productId":515005,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Magic: The Baseballing - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Magic The Baseballing Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515005_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515005/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-magic-the-baseballing-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:11:15.38","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Welcome back ladies and gentlemen to this thrilling matchup between The Gatewatch and The Eldrazi at breathtaking Hedron Park on Zendikar. The stands are filled with goblins, elves, and kor—I think I even see a few vampires skulking under the bleachers.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Folks we have a mana burner on our hands. Garruk Wildspeaker is leading off with Liliana Vess on deck. Fans are excited to see explosive play from Chandra Nalaar and the return of Ajani Goldmane to The Gatewatch. And as always, we expect Jace Beleren to play some mind games from the mound.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Couldn’t ask for a better day for baseball.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Fay Dalton & Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ajani Goldmane\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jace Beleren\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Liliana Vess\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Chandra Nalaar\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Garruk Wildspeaker"}]},{"productId":515006,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Magic: The Baseballing - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Magic The Baseballing Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515006_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515006/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-magic-the-baseballing-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T16:11:01.533","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Welcome back ladies and gentlemen to this thrilling matchup between The Gatewatch and The Eldrazi at breathtaking Hedron Park on Zendikar. The stands are filled with goblins, elves, and kor—I think I even see a few vampires skulking under the bleachers.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Folks we have a mana burner on our hands. Garruk Wildspeaker is leading off with Liliana Vess on deck. Fans are excited to see explosive play from Chandra Nalaar and the return of Ajani Goldmane to The Gatewatch. And as always, we expect Jace Beleren to play some mind games from the mound.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Couldn’t ask for a better day for baseball.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Fay Dalton & Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ajani Goldmane\r\n<br>• 1x Jace Beleren\r\n<br>• 1x Liliana Vess\r\n<br>• 1x Chandra Nalaar\r\n<br>• 1x Garruk Wildspeaker"}]},{"productId":515007,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Keep Partying Hard, Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Keep Partying Hard Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515007_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515007/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-keep-partying-hard-shred-harder-than-you-previously-thought-possible-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T15:55:38.3","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This is K-SLD FM and we’re growling epic tidings across the airwaves to all you metalheads out there. The gods of rock are smiling down on you because we’ve got tickets to the hardest-rocking, meanest-talking, most electric-shocking concert of the year!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This unholy lineup features the dark melodies of Tevesh Szat, Doom of Fools; the sonic assault of Godo, Bandit Warlord; the haunting vocals of Jeska, Thrice Reborn; and the bone-crushing riffs of Vial Smasher the Fierce.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Get your tickets now to be engulfed in a metal maelstrom that will make your head bang, your ears ring, and your face melt.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Mark Riddick, rishxxv, WolfSkullJack, and N.C. Winters\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tevesh Szat, Doom of Fools\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Godo, Bandit Warlord\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jeska, Thrice Reborn\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Vial Smasher the Fierce"}]},{"productId":515008,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Keep Partying Hard, Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Keep Partying Hard Shred Harder Than You Previously Thought Possible Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515008_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https: