ackaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hugely influential artist Gary Baseman has spent a career creating creepy-cute characters within his personal universe, blurring the line between pop culture and fine art. His work explores deep feelings of love, longing, and loss through a lighthearted lens.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>On his first-ever Magic cards, he’s brought his signature style to a five-part panorama spread across a cycle of lands—each telling a whimsical story that’s a little playful, a little dark, and all Gary Baseman. If you’re a fan of the sweetly sinister, the disturbingly darling, and the beautifully bittersweet, this drop is for you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":515010,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Gary Baseman - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Gary Baseman Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515010_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515010/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-gary-baseman-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-19T13:58:33.58","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hugely influential artist Gary Baseman has spent a career creating creepy-cute characters within his personal universe, blurring the line between pop culture and fine art. His work explores deep feelings of love, longing, and loss through a lighthearted lens.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>On his first-ever Magic cards, he’s brought his signature style to a five-part panorama spread across a cycle of lands—each telling a whimsical story that’s a little playful, a little dark, and all Gary Baseman. If you’re a fan of the sweetly sinister, the disturbingly darling, and the beautifully bittersweet, this drop is for you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Island\r\n<br>• 1x Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Forest"}]},{"productId":515011,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Buggin' Out - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Buggin Out Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515011_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515011/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-buggin-out-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:01:23.363","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Check out these bugs I found under a rotten log in the graveyard! I’ve never seen bugs like this before. They’re so awesome. I don’t know which is my favorite. I really like the green and blue ones, but I also like the green and pink ones. My pockets are full of 'em! I also saw a hand coming out of the ground under the log. It didn’t have much skin, but the fingers started moving. Cool, right?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Wooden Cyclops\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Eldritch Evolution\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Giant Adephage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Noxious Revival\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Grist, the Hunger Tide\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest"}]},{"productId":515012,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Buggin' Out - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Buggin Out Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515012_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515012/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-buggin-out-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T20:01:11.013","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Check out these bugs I found under a rotten log in the graveyard! I’ve never seen bugs like this before. They’re so awesome. I don’t know which is my favorite. I really like the green and blue ones, but I also like the green and pink ones. My pockets are full of 'em! I also saw a hand coming out of the ground under the log. It didn’t have much skin, but the fingers started moving. Cool, right?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Wooden Cyclops\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Eldritch Evolution\r\n<br>• 1x Giant Adephage\r\n<br>• 1x Noxious Revival\r\n<br>• 1x Grist, the Hunger Tide\r\n<br>• 1x Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest"}]},{"productId":515013,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Kev Walker - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Kev Walker Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515013_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515013/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-kev-walker-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-01-18T14:36:06.647","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Having contributed more than 470 pieces of art since 1996’s Mirage set, Kev Walker is Magic’s most prolific artist of all time. Today, his imaginative, evocative, and iconic style is recognized by fans around the globe.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>For his Artist Series, Kev picked the cards, created the art, and wrote the flavor text about a hero’s hopeless crusade against the cruelty of the gods. This epic drop even includes the first reprint of Carnage Tyrant ever.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Fo