n’t attend MagicCon: Las Vegas in person, lady luck is on your side because we’re offering awesome MagicCon merch direct to you. For booster fans, this bundle includes a Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box and a Chaos Draft Booster Grab Bag filled with a wild variety of fan-favorite boosters from recent years.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>On top of that, you’ll get two amazing exclusives—a Relentless Rats Secret Lair promo card that’s ONLY available at MagicCon: Las Vegas and here, and Dan Frazier's Mox Box, an extraordinary Secret Lair drop featuring Mox Opal, Mox Tantalite, and Sol Ring with foil-etched, retro-framed art by the legendary Dan Frazier. Jackpot!\r\n<br>All cards are English only.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster Convention Edition Booster Box (Display Unit – 24 boosters incl. in 1 box)    \r\n<br>• 1x Dan Frazier's Mox Box – Foil Etched Secret Lair Drop\r\n<br>• 1x Relentless Rats Non-Foil – Secret Lair Promo by Graham Yarrington\r\n<br>• 1x Chaos Draft 24 Booster Grab Bag:                                                            \r\n<br>• 1x Dominaria Remastered Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 3x Modern Horizons 2 Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 1x Dominaria United Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 1x The Brothers’ War Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 2x Streets of New Capenna Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 4x Kamigawa: Neon Dynasty Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 3x Wilds of Eldraine Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 4x March of the Machine Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexia: All Will Be One Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 2x Innistrad: Crimson Vow Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 2x Innistrad: Midnight Hunt Draft Boosters"}]},{"productId":516537,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dan Frazier's Mox Box - Foil Etched Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dan Fraziers Mox Box Foil Etched Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/516537_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/516537/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dan-fraziers-mox-box-foil-etched-edition","modifiedOn":"2023-12-11T18:56:33.177","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Mox Opal\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Mox Tantalite\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Etched Retro Frame Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":516992,"name":"Secret Lair: Ponies: The Galloping 2: Extra Life 2023 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Ponies The Galloping 2 Extra Life 2023 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/516992_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/516992/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-ponies-the-galloping-2-extra-life-2023-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-05-01T18:10:43.243","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Applejack\r\n<br>• 1x Fluttershy\r\n<br>• 1x Pinkie Pie\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Dash"}]},{"productId":516993,"name":"Secret Lair: Ponies: The Galloping 2: Extra Life 2023 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Ponies The Galloping 2 Extra Life 2023 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/516993_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/516993/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-ponies-the-galloping-2-extra-life-2023-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-05-01T18:10:34.2","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.<