st Planeswalkers we ever did see! Five new powerfully precious cards from artist UTA NATSUME just scampered through the multiverse and are ready for combat, or a cuddle, it’s kinda up to you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Karn, Scion of Urza\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Chandra, Flame’s Catalyst\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Aminatou, the Fateshifter\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Daretti, Ingenious Iconoclast\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Venser, the Sojourner\r\n<br>Li’l’est Walkers Foil Edition will be printed using our experimental new Rainbow Foil treatment. Rainbow Foil is a lot like traditional foil, but it's printed using a different technique and has more vibrant colors."}]},{"productId":518821,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: PixelLands_v02.jpg - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop PixelLands_v02jpg Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518821_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518821/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixellands_v02jpg-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:10:18.173","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s time to dust off your favorite game console, connect the AV cables to the back of your tube TV, and unplug your little brother’s controller, because 1991’s hottest sequel is finally here.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>With pixel perfect art, the second set of lands from artist Jubilee are in low-res and high-demand. Just remember to keep them safe from your little bro’s sticky hands—WHY IS HE ALWAYS GOING IN YOUR ROOM?!?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Island\r\n<br>• 1x Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Forest"}]},{"productId":518822,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: PixelLands_v02.jpg - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair 