talent with his artist series by illustrating some incredible creatures and spells. This set is personal to John—he picked the cards, he wrote the flavor text, and he even had his wife pose for Serra Angel and his son pose for Brainstorm. We didn’t ask who posed for Emrakul, but we love John’s take on the iconic card. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Emrakul, the Promised End\r\n<br>• 1x Serra Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Brainstorm\r\n<br>• 1x Progenitus"}]},{"productId":518826,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: John Avon - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series John Avon Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518826_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518826/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-john-avon-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:09:08.8","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>As one of Magic’s most prolific artists, John Avon has contributed over 300 stunning pieces to the game since 1997. Although best-known for his breathtaking lands, he wanted to flex his considerable talent with his artist series by illustrating some incredible creatures and spells. This set is personal to John—he picked the cards, he wrote the flavor text, and he even had his wife pose for Serra Angel and his son pose for Brainstorm. We didn’t ask who posed for Emrakul, but we love John’s take on the iconic card. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Emrakul, the Promised End\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Serra Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Brainstorm\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Progenitus"}]},{"productId":518827,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Creepshow - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Creepshow Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518827_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518827/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-creepshow-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:08:58.583","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Prepare to descend into the darkest corners of your own psyche with a spine-tingling anthology of sinister cards with Creepshow, the cult horror franchise inspired by pulp comics. Will you wield these cards to unearth unspeakable horror or merely pay the price for your insatiable curiosity? This drop will grip your heart, leaving you breathless, trembling, and unable to run.\r\n<br>Art by Cabrol, Andrea De Dominicis, Greg Staples, Jarel Threat, Michael Walsh, and Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Unholy Grotto\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Zombie Master\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Noxious Ghoul\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Grimgrin, Corpse-Born\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Death Baron"}]},{"productId":518828,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Creepshow - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Creepshow Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518828_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518828/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-creepshow-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:08:49.19","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Prepare to descend into the darkest corners of your own psyche with a spine-tingling anthology of sinister cards with Creepshow, the cult horror franchise inspired by pulp comics. Will you wield these cards to unearth unspeakable horror or merely pay the price for your insatiable curiosity? This drop will grip your heart, leaving you breathless, trembling, and unable to run.\r\n<br>Art by Cabrol, Andrea De Dominicis, Greg Staples, Jarel Threat, Michael Walsh, and Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Unholy Grotto\r\n<br>• 1x Zombie Master\r\n<br>• 1x Noxious Ghoul\r\n<br>• 1x Grimgrin, Corpse-Born\r\n<br>• 1x Death Baron"}]},{"productId":518829,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x The Evil Dead - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x The Evil Dead Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518829_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518829/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-the-evil-dead-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:08:40.483","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>So we found a mysterious set of cards beside an old audio tape in the cellar of a secluded cabin in the woods. We played the tape and the next thing we knew, an ancient malevolence—the cult classic movie, The Evil Dead starring Bruce Campbell—was rising from the grave to take possession of this Secret Lair drop. Now all our friends are zombies, the woods are alive, and we’ve discovered some very creative uses for a chainsaw. All in all, not the worst vacation.\r\n<br>Art by Fay Dalton, Warren Mahy, and Josh Newton\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Puresteel Paladin as “Ash, Destined Survivor”\r\n<br>• 1x Vanquish the Horde as “Destroy the Dead”\r\n<br>• 1x Zombie Apocalypse as “Knowby’s Incantation”\r\n<br>• 1x Varina, Lich Queen as “Linda, Kandarian Queen”\r\n<br>• 1x Field of the Dead as “Cabin of the Dead”\r\n<br>• 1x Zombie Token"}]},{"productId":518830,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x The Evil Dead - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x The Evil Dead Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518830_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518830/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-the-evil-dead-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:08:30.93","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>So we found a mysterious set of cards beside an old audio tape in the cellar of a secluded cabin in the woods. We played the tape and the next thing we knew, an ancient malevolence—the cult classic movie, The Evil Dead starring Bruce Campbell—was rising from the grave to take possession of this Secret Lair drop. Now all our friends are zombies, the woods are alive, and we’ve discovered some very creative uses for a chainsaw. All in all, not the worst vacation.\r\n<br>Art by Fay Dalton, Warren Mahy, and Josh Newton\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Puresteel Paladin as “Ash, Destined Survivor”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Vanquish the Horde as “Destroy the Dead”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Zombie Apocalypse as “Knowby’s Incantation”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Varina, Lich Queen as “Linda, Kandarian Queen”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Field of the Dead as “Cabin of the Dead”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Zombie Token"}]},{"productId":518831,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Weeping Angels - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Doctor Who The Weeping Angels Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518831_200w.jpg","categoryI