multi-dimensional predators that feed on time energy. And right now, for as long as we keep looking at them, they’re quantum locked, just waiting for an opportunity to strike. I hope the Doctor gets here soon. Until then…\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Don’t. Blink.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Helge C. Balzer, fang.xinyu, and Nephelomancer\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Angel of Serenity\r\n<br>• 1x Angel of the Ruins\r\n<br>• 1x Blinding Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Restoration Angel\r\n<br>• 1x Sublime Archangel"}]},{"productId":518834,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Doctor Who The Dalek Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518834_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518834/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-doctor-who-the-dalek-lands-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:08:04.19","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In this drop, we see the Daleks continue their intergalactic campaign of conquest and annihilation across five lands. Armed with advanced technology and an unwavering belief in their own supremacy, only the Doctor can hope to stop them. The age of the Daleks has arrived, and the final sound heard by entire civilizations will be a single word, “Exterminate!”\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Shahab Alizadeh and Nino Is\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Concealed Courtyard\r\n<br>• 1x Spirebluff Canal\r\n<br>• 1x Blooming Marsh\r\n<br>• 1x Inspiring Vantage\r\n<br>• 1x Botanical Sanctum"}]},{"productId":518835,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Doctor Who The Dalek L