, scenes, and quotes from the iconic film, The Princess Bride, with gorgeous storybook-inspired art. It is said these cards had the power to take us back to an age of courtly intrigue, swashbuckling adventure, and true love conquering all—  \r\n<br>“Hold it, hold it. What is this? Are you trying to trick me? Is this a kissing drop?”\r\n<br>“Wait, just wait…”\r\n<br>“When’s it get good!?”\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Ekaterina Burmak, Sam Hogg, Lius Lasahido, Marta Nael, Néstor Ossandón Leal, Anna Pavleeva, Magali Villeneuve, and Andreas Zafirators\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sisay, Weatherlight Captain as “Buttercup, Provincial Princess”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Battle of Wits\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Baral, Chief of Compliance as “Vizzini, Criminal Mastermind”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Pack Rat as “Rodents of Unusual Size”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Fynn, the Fangbearer as “Westley, Dread Pirate Roberts”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Brion Stoutarm as “Fezzik, Rhyming Giant”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Samut, Voice of Dissent as “Inigo, Avenging Swordsman”\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Marchesa, the Black Rose as “Miracle Max, Unemployed”"}]},{"productId":518839,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x The Princess Bride - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x The Princess Bride Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518839_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518839/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-the-princess-bride-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:07:07.283","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Once upon a time there was a set of cards that featured the beloved characters, scenes, and quotes from the iconic film, The Princess Bride, with gorgeous storybook-inspired art. It is said these cards had the power to take us back to an age of courtly intrigue, swashbuckling adventure, and true love conquering all—  \r\n<br>“Hold it, hold it. What is this? Are you trying to trick me? Is this a kissing drop?”\r\n<br>“Wait, just wait…”\r\n<br>“When’s it get good!?”\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Ekaterina Burmak, Sam Hogg, Lius Lasahido, Marta Nael, Néstor Ossandón Leal, Anna Pavleeva, Magali Villeneuve, and Andreas Zafirators\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Sisay, Weatherlight Captain as “Buttercup, Provincial Princess”\r\n<br>• 1x Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Battle of Wits\r\n<br>• 1x Baral, Chief of Compliance as “Vizzini, Criminal Mastermind”\r\n<br>• 1x Pack Rat as “Rodents of Unusual Size”\r\n<br>• 1x Fynn, the Fangbearer as “Westley, Dread Pirate Roberts”\r\n<br>• 1x Brion Stoutarm as “Fezzik, Rhyming Giant”\r\n<br>• 1x Samut, Voice of Dissent as “Inigo, Avenging Swordsman”\r\n<br>• 1x Marchesa, the Black Rose as “Miracle Max, Unemployed”"}]},{"productId":518840,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Places to Trick or Treat Non-Foil Lands Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Places to Trick or Treat Non Foil Lands Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518840_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518840/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-places-to-trick-or-treat-non-foil-lands-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:03:42.447","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>I’ve pinpointed the absolute best places to go trick-or-treating this year and put them on these beautiful land cards. Using this bundle of non-foil lands, we’ll be able to find all the best candy hot spots. Plus, you can keep the awesome non-foil cards!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Meditations on Nature Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x PixelLands_v02.jpg Non-Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":518841,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Places to Trick or Treat Foil Lands Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Places to Trick or Treat Foil Lands Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518841_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518841/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-places-to-trick-or-treat-foil-lands-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:03:31.88","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>I’ve pinpointed the absolute best places to go trick-or-treating this year and put them on these beautiful land cards. Using this bundle of foil lands, we’ll be able to find all the best candy hot spots. Plus, you can keep the awesome foil cards!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Meditations on Nature Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x PixelLands_v02.jpg Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":518842,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Cards in Costume Non-Foil Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Cards in Costume Non Foil Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518842_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518842/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-cards-in-costume-non-foil-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:02:55.617","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>