roduct/518844/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-fill-my-cauldron-with-dr-who-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:02:15.6","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>So you crave a Potion of Time Travel, do you? Yes, yes, I have just the thing… shard of frozen lightning… a few sprigs of primrose… chipped gargoyle claw… and I almost forgot! All the incredible Doctor Who cards from Spookydrop 2023! All the foils, all the non-foils, all the Doctor Who. These cards are brimming with the mysteries of space-time, and the beauty of space-time for that matter. Brilliant!\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Weeping Angels Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Weeping Angels Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands Non-Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":518847,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Fill My Cauldron with Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Fill My Cauldron with Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518847_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518847/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-fill-my-cauldron-with-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:01:39.213","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>So you desire a Draught of Might? Classic, timeless even. We’ll add… essence of a laughing goblin… jellied crow’s teeth… sprinkle of midnight powder… and, yes! The astounding non-foils from Spookydrop 2023! These rare curios are simply brimming with power. Into the cauldron they go! Ooh, smell that? A bit like fresh bread and wet dog. Reminds me of my first love…\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This bundle does not contain any Secret Lair x The Evil Dead products.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Creepshow Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Weeping Angels Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Dalek Lands Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x The Princess Bride Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: John Avon Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x PixelLands_v02.jpg Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Meditations on Nature Non-Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":518849,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Fill My Cauldron with Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Fill My Cauldron with Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/518849_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/518849/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-fill-my-cauldron-with-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-04T17:01:29.76","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>So you’re looking for an Elixir of Shimmering Strength? Hmm… carapace of a giant beetle… dollop of silver dragon paste… a dash of starlight… and, oh, of course! All the lustrous foils from Spookydrop 2023. I can’t think of a better representation “Shimmering Strength” than these amazing cards. I probably could have saved that silver dragon paste for my face peel... oh well, no use crying over spilt dragon paste.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>This bundle does not contain any Secret Lair x The Evil Dead products.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Creepshow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Doctor Who: The Weeping Angels Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Docto