ition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x The Princess Bride Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: John Avon Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x PixelLands_v02.jpg Non-Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Meditations on Nature Non-Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":522559,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Calling All Hydra Heads (WPN Exclusive) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Calling All Hydra Heads WPN Exclusive Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522559_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/522559/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-calling-all-hydra-heads-wpn-exclusive-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-02-06T15:51:15.91","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Art by CatDirty\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Zaxara, The Exemplary\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Unbound Flourishing\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Primordial Hydra\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hydroid Krasis\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gargos, Vicious Watcher\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hydra token"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166250939"}]},{"productId":522720,"name":"Counterspell (SL PLAYTEST)","cleanName":"Counterspell SL PLAYTEST","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522720_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/522720/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-counterspell-sl-playtest","modifiedOn":"2025-08-29T17:10:57","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"P"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Instant"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<div class=\"SecretLair\"><strong> Promos / Special</strong></div><br><strong><em>This counterspell that mimics inkjet playtest cards is included randomly in 2023 Secret Lairs, and it is not tournament legal.</em></strong>\n<br>Counter target spell."}]},{"productId":528390,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Jurassic World Dr Ian Malcolm Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528390_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528390/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-jurassic-world-dr-ian-malcolm-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:48:13.51","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nDr. Ian Malcolm is here to sweep you off your feet and slip into your collection. Whether the magnetic mathematician is scolding a megalomaniacal millionaire, recovering from a dinosaur attack, or slowly dripping water on your hand while explaining the intricacies of entropy, he’s got charisma to spare. And with art like this, chaos has never been so beautiful.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Laboratory Maniac as “Chaotic Chaotician”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tasha’s Hideous Laughter as “Malcolm’s Mercurial Mirth”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tasigur, the Golden Fang as “Ian, Convalescent Charmer”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Atla Palani, Nest Tender as “Dr. Ian Malcolm”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Egg token"}]},{"productId":528391,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Jurassic World Dr Ian Malcolm Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528391_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528391/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-jura