eir appearances in the Jurassic World franchise. Be on the lookout for eye-popping art, movie-inspired frames, and foot-long teeth. Please do not feed the animals—even the herbivores will follow you home.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Etali, Primal Storm as “Tyrannosaurus Rex”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rampaging Ferocidon as “Velociraptor”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Polyraptor as “Indominus Rex”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Wayward Swordtooth as “Triceratops”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Regisaur Alpha as “Spinosaurus”"}]},{"productId":528393,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Jurassic World Life Breaks Free Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528393_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528393/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-jurassic-world-life-breaks-free-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:47:10","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\n:::ALERT::: :::ALERT::: :::ALERT:::\r\nGigantic reptilian clones have broken free of their enclosures and are now roaming Secret Lair. They are big, they are hungry, and they are famous for their appearances in the Jurassic World franchise. Be on the lookout for eye-popping art, movie-inspired frames, and foot-long teeth. Please do not feed the animals—even the herbivores will follow you home.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Etali, Primal Storm as “Tyrannosaurus Rex”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Rampaging Ferocidon as “Velociraptor”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Polyraptor as “Indominus Rex”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Wayward Swordtooth as “Triceratops”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Regisaur Alpha as “Spinosaurus”"}]},{"productId":528394,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Tomb Raider - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Tomb Raider Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528394_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528394/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-tomb-raider-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:47:00.433","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nLegendary explorer Lara Croft has uncovered an arcane vault filled with danger and wonder unlike any she’s ever seen before—Secret Lair. In this daring drop, you’ll discover fan-favorite cards like Shadowspear and Academy Ruins with art inspired by the Tomb Raider series, plus an all-new, mechanically unique card—Lara Croft, Tomb Raider. The hunt for rare artifacts is over, but the danger is just beginning...\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Lara Croft, Tomb Raider\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Search for Azcanta // Azcanta, the Sunken Ruin as “Heart of the Explorer // The Lost Valley”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Anger of the Gods as “Storms of Yamatai”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Bow of Nylea as “The Grim Whisper”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Shadowspear as “Totec’s Spear”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Academy Ruins as “Kitezh, Sunken City”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Treasure token"}]},{"productId":528395,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Tomb Raider - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Tomb Raider Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528395_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528395/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-tomb-raider-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:46:36.767","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nLegendary explorer Lara Croft has uncovered an arcane vault filled with danger and wonder unlike any she’s ever seen before—Secret Lair. In this daring drop, you’ll discover fan-favorite cards like Shadowspear and Academy Ruins with art inspired by the Tomb Raider series, plus an all-new, mechanically unique card—Lara Croft, Tomb Raider. The hunt for rare artifacts is over, but the danger is just beginning...\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Lara Croft, Tomb Raider\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Search for Azcanta // Azcanta, the Sunken Ruin as “Heart of the Explorer // The Lost Valley”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Anger of the Gods as “Storms of Yamatai”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Bow of Nylea as “The Grim Whisper”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Shadowspear as “Totec’s Spear”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Academy Ruins as “Kitezh, Sunken City”\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Treasure token"}]},{"productId":528396,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase The Lost Caverns of Ixalan Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528396_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528396/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-the-lost-caverns-of-ixalan-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:46:25.573","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nFan-favorite characters originally introduced in Ixalan® and Rivals of Ixalan™ have delved into the subterranean depths beneath the jungles and returned with new The Lost Caverns of Ixalan showcase treatments. These cards feature stunning art by Michael Walsh, Richard Luong, rishxxv, Chun Lo, and Pig Hands. As they say, good things come in dank, subterranean packages.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Captain Lannery Storm\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Admiral Beckett Brass\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Elenda, the Dusk Rose\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Kumena, Tyrant of Orazca\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Vona, Butcher of Magan"}]},{"productId":528397,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase The Lost Caverns of Ixalan Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528397_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528397/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-the-lost-caverns-of-ixalan-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:45:58.767","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nFan-favorite characters originally introduced in Ixalan® and Rivals of Ixalan™ have delved into the subterranean depths beneath the jungles and returned with new The Lost Caverns of Ixalan showcase treatments. These cards feature stunning art by Michael Walsh, Richard Luong, rishxxv, Chun Lo, and Pig Hands. As they say, good things come in dank, subterranean packages.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Captain Lannery Storm\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Admiral Beckett Brass\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Elenda, the Dusk Rose\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Kumena, Tyrant of Orazca\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Vona, Butcher of Magan"}]},{"productId":528398,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Mycosynthwave - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Mycosynthwave Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528398_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528398/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-mycosynthwave-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:45:14.59","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nEnter a retro-futuristic daydream where the neon sun is always setting. Sonic melodies thrum with a hypnotic heartbeat, imbued with electric life by artist Signalnoise. There is no past. There is no future. There is only the color of sound. And it commands us to vibe.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Mycosynth Golem\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Mycosynth Lattice\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Mycosynth Wellspring"}]},{"productId":528399,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Mycosynthwave - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Mycosynthwave Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528399_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528399/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-mycosynthwave-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:44:58.68","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nEnter a retro-futuristic daydream where the neon sun is always setting. Sonic melodies thrum with a hypnotic heartbeat, imbued with electric life by artist Signalnoise. There is no past. There is no future. There is only the color of sound. And it commands us to vibe.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Mycosynth Golem\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Mycosynth Lattice\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Mycosynth Wellspring"}]},{"productId":528400,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Gift Wrapped - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Gift Wrapped Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528400_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528400/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-gift-wrapped-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:44:45.763","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nMy dearest,\r\n<br>\r\nI’ve Gift Wrapped this drop to show you just how much you mean to me. Each card features scenic, abstract art by Jesse LeDoux inspired by festive wrapping paper, evoking the spirit of the season. Look closely and you’ll find holiday stories concealed among the joyful figures.\r\n<br>\r\nYours,\r\n<br>\r\nxoxo\r\n<br>\r\nP.S. Please keep these cards away from scissors and tape…\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Giver of Runes\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Distant Melody\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Cathartic Reunion\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Moment’s Peace\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Homeward Path"}]},{"productId":528401,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Gift Wrapped - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Gift Wrapped Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528401_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528401/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-gift-wrapped-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:44:25.88","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nMy dearest,\r\n<br>\r\nI’ve Gift Wrapped this drop to show you just how much you mean to me. Each card features scenic, abstract art by Jesse LeDoux inspired by festive wrapping paper, evoking the spirit of the season. Look closely and you’ll find holiday stories concealed among the joyful figures.\r\n<br>\r\nYours,\r\n<br>\r\nxoxo\r\n<br>\r\nP.S. Please keep these cards away from scissors and tape…\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Giver of Runes\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Distant Melody\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Cathartic Reunion\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Moment’s Peace\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Homeward Path"}]},{"productId":528402,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Paradise Frost - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Paradise Frost Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528402_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528402/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-paradise-frost-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:44:12.31","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe air is cold and still, but the sun is bright. The chirping of birds punctuates the otherwise silent morning. And the whole world feels like it’s still dreaming under a blanket of snow.\r\n<br>\r\nThis idyllic midwinter scene brought to you by the art of ELK64.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Snow-Covered Plains\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Snow-Covered Island\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Snow-Covered Swamp\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Snow-Covered Mountain\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Snow-Covered Forest"}]},{"productId":528403,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Paradise Frost - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Paradise Frost Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528403_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528403/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-paradise-frost-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:43:57.49","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe air is cold and still, but the sun is bright. The chirping of birds punctuates the otherwise silent morning. And the whole world feels like it’s still dreaming under a blanket of snow.\r\n<br>\r\nThis idyllic midwinter scene brought to you by the art of ELK64.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Snow-Covered Plains\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Snow-Covered Island\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Snow-Covered Swamp\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Snow-Covered Mountain\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Snow-Covered Forest"}]},{"productId":528404,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Tales of the Time Stoppers - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Tales of the Time Stoppers Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528404_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528404/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-tales-of-the-time-stoppers-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:43:38.47","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nFor those of us who can merely travel forward in time at the rate of sixty seconds per minute, the infinite possibilities unlocked by temporal manipulation are impossible to comprehend. But to the Time Stoppers, turning back time is as easy as turning the page in a book. Especially if that book—like these cards—features graphic illustration by Micha Huigen in the style of vintage comics.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Beacon of Tomorrows\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Nexus of Fate\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Time Reversal\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Time Stop"}]},{"productId":528405,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Tales of the Time Stoppers - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Tales of the Time Stoppers Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528405_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528405/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-tales-of-the-time-stoppers-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:43:15.947","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nFor those of us who can merely travel forward in time at the rate of sixty seconds per minute, the infinite possibilities unlocked by temporal manipulation are impossible to comprehend. But to the Time Stoppers, turning back time is as easy as turning the page in a book. Especially if that book—like these cards—features graphic illustration by Micha Huigen in the style of vintage comics.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Beacon of Tomorrows\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Nexus of Fate\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Time Reversal\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Time Stop"}]},{"productId":528406,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Through the Wormhole - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Through the Wormhole Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528406_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528406/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-through-the-wormhole-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:42:56.793","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe vastness of space stretches out towards infinity, but everything you need to survive is in your hands. Featuring stellar art by Dani Pendergast available in the otherworldly galaxy foil treatment, Through the Wormhole includes all the tools every starship captain can’t leave home without. Suit up, commander. There’s a galaxy to explore.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Thought Vessel\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Command Tower"}]},{"productId":528407,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Through the Wormhole - Galaxy Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Through the Wormhole Galaxy Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528407_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528407/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-through-the-wormhole-galaxy-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:42:46.677","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe vastness of space stretches out towards infinity, but everything you need to survive is in your hands. Featuring stellar art by Dani Pendergast available in the otherworldly galaxy foil treatment, Through the Wormhole includes all the tools every starship captain can’t leave home without. Suit up, commander. There’s a galaxy to explore.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Galaxy Foil Arcane Signet\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Galaxy Foil Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Galaxy Foil Sol Ring\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Galaxy Foil Thought Vessel\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Galaxy Foil Command Tower"}]},{"productId":528408,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Jungle Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Jungle Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528408_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528408/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-jungle-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:42:08.57","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nIn an ancient rainforest teeming with ferocious dinosaurs, rakish rogues, and tangled romance, the Jungle Bundle Non-Foil Edition conceals untold riches and threatens certain death. With two epic Jurassic World drops and the stunning Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan, this bundle is filled with perilous adventure. Maybe you’re the predator, maybe you’re the prey, and maybe you’re both and falling in love with an incorrigible chaotician. Only the jungle knows.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan"}]},{"productId":528409,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Jungle Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Jungle Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528409_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528409/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-jungle-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:41:57.343","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nIn an ancient rainforest teeming with ferocious dinosaurs, rakish rogues, and tangled romance, the Jungle Bundle Non-Foil Edition conceals untold riches and threatens certain death. With two epic Jurassic World drops and the stunning Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan, this bundle is filled with perilous adventure. Maybe you’re the predator, maybe you’re the prey, and maybe you’re both and falling in love with an incorrigible chaotician. Only the jungle knows.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan - Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":528410,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Holiday Gift Bag Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Holiday Gift Bag Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528410_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528410/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-holiday-gift-bag-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:41:47.803","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Holiday Gift Bag Bundle Non-Foil Edition is the perfect gift for the Secret Lair lover in your life, even if it’s you! This bundle includes non-foil editions of the sci-fi odyssey Through the Wormhole, the festive Gift Wrapped, and the tranquil snow lands in Paradise Frost. Happy holidays and secret Secretversary!\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Gift Wrapped\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Paradise Frost"}]},{"productId":528411,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Holiday Gift Bag Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Holiday Gift Bag Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528411_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528411/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-holiday-gift-bag-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:41:25.143","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Holiday Gift Bag Bundle Non-Foil Edition is the perfect gift for the Secret Lair lover in your life, even if it’s you! This bundle includes non-foil editions of the sci-fi odyssey Through the Wormhole, the festive Gift Wrapped, and the tranquil snow lands in Paradise Frost. Happy holidays and secret Secretversary!\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole - Galaxy Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Gift Wrapped - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Paradise Frost - Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":528412,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Lara Croft's Adventuring Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Lara Crofts Adventuring Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528412_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528412/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-lara-crofts-adventuring-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:41:16.903","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nAfter evading obstacles, solving puzzles, and uncovering mysteries, Lara Croft has returned from yet another intrepid adventure with artifacts in hand—Lara Croft’s Adventuring Bundle Non-Foil Edition. This thrilling collection features three non-foil-edition SLDs filled with epic art, arcane wonders, and enough synergy to begin building a Lara Croft Commander deck. What a find!\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Tomb Raider\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tales of the Time Stoppers\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole"}]},{"productId":528413,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Lara Croft's Adventuring Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Lara Crofts Adventuring Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528413_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528413/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-lara-crofts-adventuring-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:41:05.46","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nAfter evading obstacles, solving puzzles, and uncovering mysteries, Lara Croft has returned from yet another intrepid adventure with artifacts in hand—Lara Croft’s Adventuring Bundle Non-Foil Edition. This thrilling collection features three non-foil-edition SLDs filled with epic art, arcane wonders, and enough synergy to begin building a Lara Croft Commander deck. What a find!\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Tomb Raider - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tales of the Time Stoppers - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole - Galaxy Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":528414,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Welcome to Jurassic World Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Welcome to Jurassic World Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528414_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528414/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-welcome-to-jurassic-world-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:40:56.697","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nHold onto your butts because the Welcome to Jurassic World Bundle is bursting with spectacular cards. With this era-defining collection you get all four Jurassic World Secret Lair Drops, two in foil and two in non-foil, for a blockbuster bundle 65 million years in the making.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm"}]},{"productId":528415,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Goodie Bag Loaded with Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Goodie Bag Loaded with Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528415_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528415/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-goodie-bag-loaded-with-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:40:39.743","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nCheers to Secretversary 2023! I’ve been looking for you all night—can you introduce me to Yargle? I think he came with Multani, but honestly, I’m not sure it’s going to last. Anyway, here’s your Goodie Bag Loaded with Non-Foils Bundle. We’ve been planning this bundle all year and it’s filled with all the amazing non-foil cards from the Secretversary 2023 Superdrop. Oh, and watch out—that is not a bathroom. It’s a Nexus of Fate. I think Fblthp wandered through earlier. I probably should have locked it… I’m sure he’ll turn up…\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Tomb Raider\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Mycosynthwave\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tales of the Time Stoppers\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Gift Wrapped\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Paradise Frost"}]},{"productId":528416,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Goodie Bag Loaded with Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Goodie Bag Loaded with Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528416_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528416/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-goodie-bag-loaded-with-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:40:28.733","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nHere’s to Secretversary 2023! I’m so glad you could join the festivities; did you hear that Rionya is planning to perform a fire dance later? Must see. Before I forget, here’s a Goodie Bag Loaded with Foils Bundle. It’s got every single shiny foil from the Secretversary 2023 Superdrop. They’re powerful. They’re dazzling. And they’ll look great with those new Lightning Greaves. OMG, snatched. Find me later, there is some tea to spill and it is piping hot.\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Life Breaks Free - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Jurassic World: Dr. Ian Malcolm - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Secret Lair x Tomb Raider - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Through the Wormhole - Galaxy Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Showcase: The Lost Caverns of Ixalan - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Mycosynthwave - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Tales of the Time Stoppers - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Gift Wrapped - Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Paradise Frost - Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":528417,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secretversary Superdrop 2023: Goodie Bag Loaded with Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secretversary Superdrop 2023 Goodie Bag Loaded with Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528417_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528417/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secretversary-superdrop-2023-goodie-bag-loaded-with-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-03-11T18:40:18.797","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nHappy Secretversary 2023! Thank you so much for coming, it just wouldn’t be the same without you. There’s a lovely spread of food tokens in the dining room and here’s a Goodie Bag Loaded with Everything Bundle. Each bundle is filled with all the foils, all the non-foils, and all the celebration from the Secretversary 2023 Superdrop. Also… somebody invited Baron Sengir inside and now he won’t stop talking about his castle renovations. Don’t let him corner you. Have fun!\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Goodie Bag Loaded with Foils Bundle\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Goodie Bag Loaded with Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":530779,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Doctor Who: Regeneration - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Doctor Who Regeneration Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/530779_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530779/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-doctor-who-regeneration-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-07-08T13:02:31.85","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"In celebration of the interdimensional event 60 years in the making, Secret Lair x Doctor Who: Regeneration features iconic characters and moments from the Doctor Who 60th Anniversary Specials on new, mechanically unique cards. Whether you're a fan of the Doctor and their loyal companions, or the terrifying villains they face, this drop is filled with good, sci-fi timey-wimey fun.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rose Noble\r\n<br>• 1x The Meep\r\n<br>• 1x The Celestial Toymaker\r\n<br>• 1x The Fourteenth Doctor\r\n<br>• 1x The Fifteenth Doctor"}]},{"productId":530780,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Doctor Who: Regeneration - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Doctor Who Regeneration Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/530780_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530780/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-doctor-who-regeneration-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-07-08T13:02:40.02","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"In celebration of the interdimensional event 60 years in the making, Secret Lair x Doctor Who: Regeneration features iconic characters and moments from the Doctor Who 60th Anniversary Specials on new, mechanically unique cards. Whether you're a fan of the Doctor and their loyal companions, or the terrifying villains they face, this drop is filled with good, sci-fi timey-wimey fun.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rose Noble\r\n<br>• 1x Foil The Meep\r\n<br>• 1x Foil The Celestial Toymaker\r\n<br>• 1x Foil The Fourteenth Doctor\r\n<br>• 1x Foil The Fifteenth Doctor"}]},{"productId":534124,"name":"Secret Lair Commander Deck: Raining Cats and Dogs","cleanName":"Secret Lair Commander Deck Raining Cats and Dogs","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/534124_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/534124/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-commander-deck-raining-cats-and-dogs","modifiedOn":"2024-04-30T19:03:01.6","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Whether you’re a cat person, a dog person, or just a Commander person, Raining Cats and Dogs will get your tail wagging.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Featuring five double-faced cards, each with a cat side and a dog side, this high purr-formance deck lets you flaunt your cat-titude or prove your bite is worse than your bark. First you’ll fill your board with fur-rocious friends, then you’ll unleash a doggone cat-tastrophe on your pet-rified pup-ponents—all for your own a-mews-ment.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Plus, these cards feature paws-itively wag-nificent new art by Allison Carl, Alayna Danner, Jakob Eirich, Nicole Gustafsson, Fiona Hsieh, Jack Hughes, Nana Qi, and Andrea Radeck.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-Faced Rin and Seri, Inseparable\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-Faced Jetmir, Nexus of Revels\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-Faced Jinnie Fay, Jetmir’s Second\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-Faced Anointed Procession\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-Faced Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 73x Reprints\r\n<br>• 22x Foil Basic Lands with New Art\r\n<br>• 2x Double-Faced Tokens with New Art\r\n<br>• 11x Reprint Tokens\r\n<br>• 3x Double-Faced Display Cards"}]},{"productId":537661,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2024: Everything on the Menu Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2024 Everything on the Menu Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537661_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537661/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2024-everything-on-the-menu-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T16:00:05.75","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Welcome to the multiverse’s trendiest new gastropub! Our delicious prix fixe Everything on the Menu Bundle includes each of our artisanal drops. All the foils. All the non-foils. All the flavor. Plus you’ll get a sweet promo card for dessert. It’s the perfect tasting for those curious about everything Secret Lair has to offer this season.Welcome to the multiverse’s trendiest new gastropub! Our delicious prix fixe Everything on the Menu Bundle includes each of our artisanal drops. All the foils. All the non-foils. All the flavor. Plus you’ll get a sweet promo card for dessert. It’s the perfect tasting for those curious about everything Secret Lair has to offer this season.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x All the Sweet Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x All the Savory Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":537665,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2024: All the Sweet Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2024 All the Sweet Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537665_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537665/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2024-all-the-sweet-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:59:41.77","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Our All the Sweet Foils Bundle is a discerning degustation of six small-plate, all-foil drops with one extra special promo card. Chef crafted each individual drop with unique recipes that balance the sweetness of great cards with the tanginess of unique art.  And of course, the signature glaze makes everything on the plate shine.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Deceptive Divination Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Prismatic Nightmares Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Just Add Milk: Second Helpings Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Hard-Boiled Thrillers Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Murders at Karlov Manor Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x The Beauty of the Beasts Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":537667,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2024: All the Savory Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2024 All the Savory Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537667_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537667/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2024-all-the-savory-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:59:32.11","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This bundle celebrates the essence of what makes a drop super. You’ll find a fusion of full-bodied cards and gourmet art resulting in a bundle that’s both new and timeless. Bite into these robust cards to discover a mouthfeel that’s light, flaky and almost papery. And don’t forget the promo card garnish. Bon appétit.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Deceptive Divination\r\n<br>• 1x Prismatic Nightmares\r\n<br>• 1x Just Add Milk: Second Helpings\r\n<br>• 1x Hard-Boiled Thrillers\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: Murders at Karlov Manor\r\n<br>• 1x The Beauty of the Beasts"}]},{"productId":537669,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2024: 