and I ought to know better than to trust someone so lovely.” The bitter taste of betrayal always makes the truth even harder to swallow.\r\n<br>Now there were only two things left to do. Make sure that two-faced gangster gets what’s his, and don’t forget the hat.\r\n<br>Art by Josh Newton & Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Reconnaissance\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Jace, Wielder of Mysteries\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Black Market\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Dire Undercurrents\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Obeka, Brute Chronologist"}]},{"productId":537681,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Hard-Boiled Thrillers - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Hard Boiled Thrillers Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537681_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537681/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-hard-boiled-thrillers-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:58:04.4","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dirty puddles reflect blinking neon lights as some deep, urgent jazz tune hangs heavy in the air. A rain-soaked fedora sits in the gutter.\r\n<br>“Was I double-crossed, or did I do the double-crossing?” the bruised detective asks no one but himself as he lurches to his feet. “Maybe it doesn’t matter—even the secrets have secrets in this town, and I ought to know better than to trust someone so lovely.” The bitter taste of betrayal always makes the truth even harder to swallow.\r\n<br>Now there were only two things left to do. Make sure that two-faced gangster gets what’s his, and don’t forget the hat.\r\n<br>Art by Josh Newton & Scott Okumura\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reconnaissance\r\n<br>• 1x Jace, Wielder of Mysteries\r\n<br>• 1x Black Marke