duct/537686_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537686/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-prismatic-nightmares-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:57:21.627","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Lurking in the abyss of a sleeping god’s subconscious, haunting visions shudder to life. Vivid dreams of decay and control and power infiltrate the waking world. Their terror is beautiful, their power—magnetic. Soon the dreams become reality and reality becomes the nightmare.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Denial\r\n<br>• 1x Nightscape Familiar\r\n<br>• 1x Rain of Filth\r\n<br>• 1x Simian Spirit Guide\r\n<br>• 1x Prince of Thralls"}]},{"productId":537687,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Beauty of the Beasts - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Beauty of the Beasts Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537687_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537687/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-beauty-of-the-beasts-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:57:10.707","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>On a mist-covered isle concealed by tempestuous seas, the mundane meets the mythological and untamed nature radiates ethereal grace. Hidden here, in forgotten caves and otherworldly caverns, a majestic menagerie waits to be discovered. Inspired by ancient stories, this modern bestiary is as ferocious as it is enchanting.\r\n<br>Art by Rowynn Ellis\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Felidar Guardian\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Peregrine Drake\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Serpent of Yawning Depths\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Scourge of Valkas\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Voracious Hydra"}]},{"productId":537688,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Beauty of the Beasts - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Beauty of the Beasts Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537688_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537688/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-beauty-of-the-beasts-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:57:00.833","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>On a mist-covered isle concealed by tempestuous seas, the mundane meets the mythological and untamed nature radiates ethereal grace. Hidden here, in forgotten caves and otherworldly caverns, a majestic menagerie waits to be discovered. Inspired by ancient stories, this modern bestiary is as ferocious as it is enchanting.\r\n<br>Art by Rowynn Ellis\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Felidar Guardian\r\n<br>• 1x Peregrine Drake\r\n<br>• 1x Serpent of Yawning Depths\r\n<br>• 1x Scourge of Valkas\r\n<br>• 1x Voracious Hydra"}]},{"productId":537689,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Deceptive Divination - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Deceptive Divination Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537689_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537689/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-deceptive-divination-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:56:50.56","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Raven’s feather, serpent’s hiss,\r\n<br>Kingly knowledge, queenly kiss.\r\n<br>Lying whispers weave and wend\r\n<br>In cauldron dark, shadows blend.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Twist of fate and fortune’s flame,\r\n<br>Toss the dice, a cunning game.\r\n<br>Scattered secrets, hidden truth\r\n<br>Trust no one, ’tis forsooth.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Alex Khabbazi\r\n<br>\r\n<br>The copy of the card Circular Logic found in the “Deceptive Divination” drop was inadvertently printed as a sorcery, though we assure you, you can still cast it as an instant and the oracle text rules remain accurate. The error is found in both foil and non-foil versions.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wall of Omens\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Circular Logic\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Scheming Symmetry\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Price of Progress\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Eternal Witness"}]},{"productId":537690,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Deceptive Divination - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Deceptive Divination Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/537690_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/537690/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-deceptive-divination-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-06-08T15:56:22.7","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Raven’s feather, serpent’s hiss,\r\n<br>Kingly knowledge, queenly kiss.\r\n<br>Lying whispers weave and wend\r\n<br>In cauldron dark, shadows blend.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Twist of fate and fortune’s flame,\r\n<br>Toss the dice, a cunning game.\r\n<br>Scattered secrets, hidden truth\r\n<br>Trust no one, ’tis forsooth.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Art by Alex Khabbazi\r\n<br>\r\n<br>The copy of the card Circular Logic found in the “Deceptive Divination” drop was inadvertently printed as a sorcery, though we assure you, you can still cast it as an instant and the oracle text rules remain accurate. The error is found in both foil and non-foil versions.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Wall of Omens\r\n<br>• 1x Circular Logic\r\n<br>• 1x Scheming Symmetry\r\n<br>• 1x Price of Progress\r\n<br>• 1x Eternal Witness"}]},{"productId":539212,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Sheldon's Spellbook - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Sheldons Spellbook Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/539212_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/539212/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-sheldons-spellbook-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-08-19T12:49:23.28","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair collaborated with Sheldon Menery, the godfather of the Commander format, to create a drop that would showcase his love of the game and the Magic community. Sheldon had a tremendous positive impact on the game, and this drop honors his many contributions. Sheldon helped a lot on this drop: he selected cards and collaborated on the art descriptions. Inside you’ll find cards he designed, like Inkshield; his signature commander, Ruhan; beloved format staples, like Teferi’s Protection; and more.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Teferi’s Protection\r\n<br>• 1x Eladamri’s Vineyard\r\n<br>• 1x Italian-language Greater Good\r\n<br>• 1x Inkshield\r\n<br>• 1x Ruhan of the Fomori as Sheldon, the Commander\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Command Tower"}]},{"productId":539213,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Sheldon's Spellbook - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Sheldons Spellbook Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/539213_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/539213/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-sheldons-spellbook-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-08-19T12:49:48.713","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair collaborated with Sheldon Menery, the godfather of the Commander format, to create a drop that would showcase his love of the game and the Magic community. Sheldon had a tremendous positive impact on the game, and this drop honors his many contributions. Sheldon helped a lot on this drop: he selected cards and collaborated on the art descriptions. Inside you’ll find cards he designed, like Inkshield; his signature commander, Ruhan; beloved format staples, like Teferi’s Protection; and more.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Teferi’s Protection\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Eladamri’s Vineyard\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Italian-language Greater Good\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Inkshield\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Ruhan of the Fomori as Sheldon, the Commander\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Command Tower"}]},{"productId":540769,"name":"Secret Lair Roadshow Edition: Burning Revelations - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Roadshow Edition Burning Revelations Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/540769_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/540769/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-roadshow-edition-burning-revelations-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-25T19:29:32.803","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This Secret Lair Drop was only available to purchase at 2024 MagicCon Events.\r\n<br>Art by Ricardo Cavolo. \r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Inspiring Overseer\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Consider\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Price of Glory\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Reckless Fireweaver\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Akroma's Memorial"}]},{"productId":545701,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Equinox Superdrop 2024: A Celebration of Everything Foil and Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Equinox Superdrop 2024 A Celebration of Everything Foil and Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/545701_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/545701/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-equinox-superdrop-2024-a-celebration-of-everything-foil-and-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-07-19T15:49:24.4","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>As the sun crosses over the foil/non-foil equator in a stunning astrological event, it heralds the arrival of new cards from Secret Lair in equal parts foil and non. This bundle praises all cards equally, by including every single card from the Equinox Superdrop 2024.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x We Celebrate the Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x We Celebrate the Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":545702,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Equinox Superdrop 2024: We Celebrate the Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Equinox Superdrop 2024 We Celebrate the Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/545702_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/545702/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-equinox-superdrop-2024-we-celebrate-the-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-07-19T15:49:15.117","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>While the equinox marks the time of year when foil and non-foil are equal in the sky, there are some more drawn to the resplendence of foils. For them, this bundle includes only the scintillating foil cards that warm us with their luminous shine.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: Vault Boy Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: Points of Interest Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: S.P.E.C.I.A.L. Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Phoebe Wahl Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Diabolical Dioramas Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Rovina Cai Rainbow Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":545703,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Equinox Superdrop 2024: We Celebrate the Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Equinox Superdrop 2024 We Celebrate the Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/545703_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/545703/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-equinox-superdrop-2024-we-celebrate-the-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-07-19T15:49:06.993","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Although foils and non-foils share the equinox equally, some are more enticed by the allure of non-foils. This bundle was made for them and includes only the enigmatic non-foils that draw us in with their tempting allure.\r\n<br>Contents