null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>You’ve found a bundle of powerful non-foil cards featuring new art inspired by Fallout®! Use these cards to survive encounters with ghouls, super mutants, and even deathclaws. Scavenging the post-apocalyptic wastelands has never been so fruitful.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: Vault Boy\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: Points of Interest\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Fallout®: S.P.E.C.I.A.L."}]},{"productId":545706,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Equinox Superdrop 2024: Sunlight and Moonbeams Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Equinox Superdrop 2024 Sunlight and Moonbeams Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/545706_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/545706/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-equinox-superdrop-2024-sunlight-and-moonbeams-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-07-19T15:48:36.99","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Some are drawn to the radiant whimsy of faeries frolicking, while others to the shadowy sorcery of witches plotting. This bundle of wonderous foil cards offers glimpses into both enchanting worlds and invites you to choose what kind of magic you wish to cast.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Phoebe Wahl Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Diabolical Dioramas Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Rovina Cai Rainbow Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":545707,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Equinox Superdrop 2024: Sunlight and Moonbeams Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Equinox Superdrop 2024 Sunlight and Moonbe