6,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561453/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-monty-python-monty-python-and-the-holy-grail-vol-1-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:13:30.223","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Five decades ago, King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table set off on a sacred quest to reclaim the Holy Grail. They … still haven't found it. But they stopped by Secret Lair and told us all about their escapades, immortalized in <em>Monty Python and the Holy Grail</em>. Go watch it! We liked it so much that we made two drops inspired by it. This drop even has a double-sided Birds of Paradise that lets you choose between an African and European Swallow. How do we know so much about swallows? Well, you have to know these things when you're a king.\r\n<br>Art by Stephen Andrade, Filipe Pagliuso, Chris Rallis, Greg Staples, and Andreas Zafiratos\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Prodigal Sorcerer as \"Tim the Enchanter\"\r\n<br>• 1x Buried Alive as \"Bring Out Your Dead!\"\r\n<br>• 1x Dismember as \"'Tis But a Scratch!\"\r\n<br>• 1x Double-sided Birds of Paradise as \"African Swallow\" // \"European Swallow\"\r\n<br>• 1x Three Visits as \"We Want … A SHRUBBERY!\""}]},{"productId":561454,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Monty Python: Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 1 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Monty Python Monty Python and the Holy Grail Vol 1 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561454_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561454/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-monty-python-monty-python-and-the-holy-grail-vol-1-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:13:23.003","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Five decades ago, King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table set off on a sacred quest to reclaim the Holy Grail. They … still haven't found it. But they stopped by Secret Lair and told us all about their escapades, immortalized in <em>Monty Python and the Holy Grail</em>. Go watch it! We liked it so much that we made two drops inspired by it. This drop even has a double-sided Birds of Paradise that lets you choose between an African and European Swallow. How do we know so much about swallows? Well, you have to know these things when you're a king.\r\n<br>Art by Stephen Andrade, Filipe Pagliuso, Chris Rallis, Greg Staples, and Andreas Zafiratos\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Prodigal Sorcerer as \"Tim the Enchanter\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Buried Alive as \"Bring Out Your Dead!\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dismember as \"'Tis But a Scratch!\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Double-sided Birds of Paradise as \"African Swallow\" // \"European Swallow\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Three Visits as \"We Want … A SHRUBBERY!\""}]},{"productId":561455,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Monty Python: Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Monty Python Monty Python and the Holy Grail Vol 2 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561455_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561455/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-monty-python-monty-python-and-the-holy-grail-vol-2-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:13:18.25","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The volume of this drop shall be \"2,\" no more, no less. If thou proclaim it \"1,\" thou speakest of our other drop. The cards herein are different. If thou pronounce the volume to be \"3,\" thou speakest falsely for there is no such thing. \"2\" shall be the volume of this drop. And in this drop, thou shalt discover cards featuring scenes and quotes from <em>Monty Python and the Holy Grail</em>. And perchance thou shalt lobbest thine cards against thy foe to gain victory most sweet.\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Sam Hogg, Simon Dominic, and Craig J Spearing\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Door to Nothingness as \"The Bridge of Death\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ashnod's Altar as \"Sir Bedivere's Scales\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dark Depths as \"Castle of Aaargh\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Marit Lage as \"The Black Beast of Aaargh\""}]},{"productId":561456,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Brain Dead Creatures Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561456_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561456/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-brain-dead-creatures-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:13:12.79","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Los Angeles–based collective of global artists and designers Brain Dead has brought their defiant approach to creating art while mixing subcultures to Secret Lair across three disruptive drops. In their Creatures drop, Brain Dead hand-picked some of their favorite game-changing creatures and then changed the game with the art and frames. This monster drop is unlike anything you've ever seen creep across your game table.\r\n<br>Art by Gage Lindsten, Ema Gaspar, Gomzé, JRZ251, and Kogan\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>• 1x Chaotic Goo\r\n<br>• 1x Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker\r\n<br>• 1x Meteor Golem\r\n<br>• 1x Wurmcoil Engine"}]},{"productId":561457,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Brain Dead Creatures Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561457_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561457/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-brain-dead-creatures-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:13:08.27","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Los Angeles–based collective of global artists and designers Brain Dead has brought their defiant approach to creating art while mixing subcultures to Secret Lair across three disruptive drops. In their Creatures drop, Brain Dead hand-picked some of their favorite game-changing creatures and then changed the game with the art and frames. This monster drop is unlike anything you've ever seen creep across your game table.\r\n<br>Art by Gage Lindsten, Ema Gaspar, Gomzé, JRZ251, and Kogan\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Chaotic Goo\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Meteor Golem\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wurmcoil Engine"}]},{"productId":561458,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Lands - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Brain Dead Lands Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/