laneswalkers into adorable animals who are living their beast lives. Enjoy your new pets. Please do not feed the Planeswalkers.\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Javier Charro, Justin Gerard, Nathaniel Himawan, and Leonardo Santanna\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Sorin Markov\r\n<br>• 1x Huatli, Radiant Champion\r\n<br>• 1x Kiora, Behemoth Beckoner\r\n<br>• 1x Tezzeret, Master of the Bridge\r\n<br>• 1x Vraska, Golgari Queen"}]},{"productId":561463,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Bloomburrow - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Bloomburrow Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561463_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561463/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-bloomburrow-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:10:58.873","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Absolutely everyone's been asking us, \"Hey, Secret Lair, what if Sorin, Huatli, Kiora, Tezzeret, and Vraska all traveled to Bloomburrow?\" And honestly, the constant barrage of questions was really getting in the way of official Secret Lair Business™. So listen up, everyone—you can stop asking. We transformed those five powerful Planeswalkers into adorable animals who are living their beast lives. Enjoy your new pets. Please do not feed the Planeswalkers.\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Javier Charro, Justin Gerard, Nathaniel Himawan, and Leonardo Santanna\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sorin Markov\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Huatli, Radiant Champion\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Kiora, Behemoth Beckoner\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Tezzeret, Master of the Bridge\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Vraska, Golgari Queen"}]},{"productId":561464,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Andrew Maclean - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Andrew Maclean Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561464_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561464/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-andrew-maclean-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:10:52.88","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Creator, writer, and artist of the Diamond Gem Award–winning series Head Lopper, Andrew Maclean has brought his unique style and incredible talent to Secret Lair! This drop combines Andrew's lifelong fandom of fantasy with his contemporary approach to illustration across four fan-favorite cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Nirkana Revenant\r\n<br>• 1x Arbor Elf\r\n<br>• 1x Terastodon\r\n<br>• 1x Maelstrom Wanderer"}]},{"productId":561465,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Andrew Maclean - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Andrew Maclean Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561465_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561465/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-andrew-maclean-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:10:48.107","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Creator, writer, and artist of the Diamond Gem Award–winning series Head Lopper, Andrew Maclean has brought his unique style and incredible talent to Secret Lair! This drop combines Andrew's lifelong fandom of fantasy with his contemporary approach to illustration across four fan-favorite cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Nirkana Revenant\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Arbor Elf\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Terastodon\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Maelstrom Wanderer"}]},{"productId":561479,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Monty Python: Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Monty Python Monty Python and the Holy Grail Vol 2 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561479_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561479/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-monty-python-monty-python-and-the-holy-grail-vol-2-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:10:42.41","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The volume of this drop shall be \"2,\" no more, no less. If thou proclaim it \"1,\" thou speakest of our other drop. The cards herein are different. If thou pronounce the volume to be \"3,\" thou speakest falsely for there is no such thing. \"2\" shall be the volume of this drop. And in this drop, thou shalt discover cards featuring scenes and quotes from <em>Monty Python and the Holy Grail</em>. And perchance thou shalt lobbest thine cards against thy foe to gain victory most sweet.\r\n<br>Art by Dmitry Burmak, Sam Hogg, Simon Dominic, and Craig J Spearing\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Door to Nothingness as \"The Bridge of Death\"\r\n<br>• 1x Ashnod's Altar as \"Sir Bedivere's Scales\"\r\n<br>• 1x Dark Depths as \"Castle of Aaargh\"\r\n<br>• 1x Marit Lage as \"The Black Beast of Aaargh\""}]},{"productId":561522,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Take Me to the Floor with Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Take Me to the Floor with Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561522_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561522/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-take-me-to-the-floor-with-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:29.033","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hmmm. Which floor has the Everything Bundle? Is it… P? No, that’s probably parking. Or maybe penthouse? I’m just looking for the floor with all the foils and all the non-foils from the Inside an Elevator Superdrop. You don’t know? It’s the floor with an amazing selection of cards with incredible art in foil and non-foil. I just don’t know which floor… Maybe I’ll just hit all the buttons and see…\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Take Me to The Floor with Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Take Me to the Floor with Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":561525,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Take Me to the Floor with Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Take Me to the Floor with Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561525_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561525/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-take-me-to-the-floor-with-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:23.953","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hold the door! Hold the door! Thanks. Close one. Almost had to wait for another elevator. I’m just trying to get to the floor with the Foils Bundle from the Inside an Elevator Superdrop. Me? Oh, yeah, I’m a big foils fan. Love the foils… Big fan. And you know these foils have really cool art on them. This bundle has them all. Oh, you’re in data and logistics? Is there, um, a foil version of that? I don’t think the elevator is moving…\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Staples Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 1 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Bloomburrow</em>™ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Andrew MacLean Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":561526,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Take Me to the Floor with Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Take Me to the Floor with Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561526_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561526/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-take-me-to-the-floor-with-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:19.733","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Excuse me, pardon me, sorry, just squeezing in. Yeah, just trying to get to the floor with the Non-Foils Bundle… yeah, the non-foils bundle from the Inside an Elevator Superdrop. I love those cards. So cool. Oh, you’re all going there too? Awesome. A little hot in here, huh? That’s okay. It’s all for the bundle. Look! The doors are opening! Let’s go. Hmph. HMPH. HMMMMPH. Uh oh, we’re stuck. Let’s try it one at a time. HMMMPH. I said one at a time! HMPH! Oh no. Doors are closing…<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Lands\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Staples\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 1\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Bloomburrow</em>™ \r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Andrew MacLean"}]},{"productId":561528,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Awkward Small Talk Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Awkward Small Talk Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561528_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561528/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-awkward-small-talk-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:10.36","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ahem. Um… going up? Yeah. Me too. I’m picking up a bundle of four foil drops. Oh, you are too? That’s funny. Not like “funny” funny. I just mean… a coincidence. *cough* Weird… the door won’t close. Yeah, I’m a big fan of Monty Python, Bloomburrow™ and Andrew Maclean. I agree, great bundle. What? Oh you didn’t say anything. Sorry... The weather’s nice…\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 1 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Bloomburrow</em>™ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Andrew MacLean Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":561529,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Awkward Small Talk Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Awkward Small Talk Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561529_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561529/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-awkward-small-talk-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:05.333","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nAhem. Um… going up? Yeah. Me too. I’m picking up a bundle of four non-foil drops. Oh, you are too? That’s funny. Not like “funny” funny. I just mean… a coincidence. *cough* Weird… the door won’t close. Yeah, I’m a big fan of Monty Python, Bloomburrow™ and Andrew Maclean. I agree, great bundle. What? Oh you didn’t say anything. Sorry... The weather’s nice…\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 1\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Monty Python and the Holy Grail: Vol. 2\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Bloomburrow</em>™\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Andrew MacLean"}]},{"productId":561536,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Brain Dead Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Brain Dead Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561536_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561536/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-brain-dead-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:09:00.29","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This iconoclastic bundle includes all three foil drops from the unprecedented Secret Lair x Brain Dead collab. Grab this bundle and shatter your opponents’ hopes with cards that shatter expectations.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Lands Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Staples Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":561540,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Inside an Elevator Superdrop: Brain Dead Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Inside an Elevator Superdrop Brain Dead Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/561540_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/561540/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-inside-an-elevator-superdrop-brain-dead-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-30T20:08:55.147","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This unbelievable bundle includes all three non-foil Secret Lair x Brain Dead drops. Pack your deck with some of Magic’s most innovative card designs ever. All the spoils, none of the foils.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Creatures\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Lands\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Brain Dead: Staples"}]},{"productId":563836,"name":"Secret Lair: Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2024 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2024 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/563836_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/563836/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-festival-in-a-box-las-vegas-2024-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-09-29T15:06:29.333","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Can’t make it to MagicCon Las Vegas? There’s always MagicCon Your House! Invite your closest friends and bitterest rivals to battle it out around your home gaming table with Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2024. This amazing bundle brings the feeling of being at MagicCon straight to you.\r\n<br>This Festival in a Box is your first opportunity to get your hands on the Mystery Booster 2 Display Box. Inside you’ll find 24 packs of cards with up to nearly 200 set symbols, future sight frames, and the first white-border cards in 19 years, making every draft completely different. Plus you’ll get three Collector Boosters filled with awesome cards and jaw-dropping art.\r\n<br>In addition to all that, you’ll get the Li’l Legends Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop featuring some of the cutest legendary creatures you ever saw as well as a promo pack that includes an exclusive Convention Maro playtest promo card as well as three additional MagicCon promo cards.\r\n<br>So power up your neon lights and Viva Las MagicCon at home.\r\n<br>All cards are English only.\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster 2 Display Box (24 boosters per display box)\r\n<br>• 1x The Lost Caverns of Ixalan Collector Booster\r\n<br>• 1x Wilds of Eldraine Collector Booster\r\n<br>• 1x Commander Masters Collector Booster\r\n<br>• 1x Li'l Legends Foil Edition Secret Lair drop:\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional foil Reya Dawnbringer\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional foil Orvar, the All-Form\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional foil Drana, the Last Bloodchief\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional foil Lavinia, Azorius Renegade\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional foil Omnath, Locus of Creation\r\n<br>• 1x MagicCon non-foil promo pack:\r\n<br>• 1x Ponder\r\n<br>• 1x Swords to Plowshares\r\n<br>• 1x Convention Maro playtest card\r\n<br>• 1x Plains"}]},{"productId":564133,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Li'l Legends - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Lil Legends Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/564133_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/564133/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-lil-legends-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-09-25T17:47:33.8","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow foil Reya Dawnbringer\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow foil Orvar, the All-Form\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow foil Drana, the Last Bloodchief\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow foil Lavinia, Azorius Renegade\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow foil Omnath, Locus of Creation\r\n\r\n<br><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:red\">When purchasing this unique product,</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color:red\"> please keep in mind that this Secret Lair Drop Series Sealed Product will ship out to you <em>after</em> the seller receives the product directly from Wizards of the Coast.</span</em><br><br><em><span style=\"color:red\"> The estimated time frame for sellers to receive stock is not fixed, so it could be anywhere between 1 - 10 weeks for delivery.</span></em></strong>"}]},{"productId":565535,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dungeons & Dragons 50th Anniversary: Loot the Room with Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dungeons and Dragons 50th Anniversary Loot the Room with Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565535_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565535/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dungeons-and-dragons-50th-anniversary-loot-the-room-with-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:19:54.803","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There’s only one true way to celebrate 50 years of Dungeons & Dragons—loot EVERYTHING. All the foils, all the non-foils, every single incredible card. Stash ’em in your Bag of Holding and flee before any wandering monsters turn this dungeon into their new lair.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Loot the Room with Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Loot the Room with Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":565536,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dungeons & Dragons 50th Anniversary: Loot the Room with Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dungeons and Dragons 50th Anniversary Loot the Room with Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565536_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565536/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dungeons-and-dragons-50th-anniversary-loot-the-room-with-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:19:44.793","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For 50 years Dungeons & Dragons has taught generations of adventurers the same lesson—after the beast is slain, grab whatever glints in the torchlight and RUN. Returning to town with this bundle of every single shiny foil will make you the talk of the tavern.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: An Exhibition of Adventure Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Death Is in the Eyes of the Beholder I Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Death Is in the Eyes of the Beholder II Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Astarion’s Thirst Rainbow Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Karlach’s Rage Rainbow Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":565538,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dungeons & Dragons 50th Anniversary: Loot the Room with Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dungeons and Dragons 50th Anniversary Loot the Room with Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565538_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565538/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dungeons-and-dragons-50th-anniversary-loot-the-room-with-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:19:34.67","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>After 50 years of Dungeons and Dragons, every adventurer knows you can’t leave a crypt without investigating every bookshelf, every torch holder, and every ceremonial altar for a hidden… *click* And voila—a hidden vault and a bundle filled with all the precious non-foils, prime to be plundered.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: An Exhibition of Adventure\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Death Is in the Eyes of the Beholder I\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Death Is in the Eyes of the Beholder II\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Astarion’s Thirst\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons®: Karlach’s Rage"}]},{"productId":565541,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: An Exhibition of Adventure - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons An Exhibition of Adventure Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565541_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565541/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-an-exhibition-of-adventure-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:19:11.393","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For 50 years, some of the world’s most evocative fantasy art has graced the covers of Dungeons & Dragons tomes, inspiring generations of gamers to imagine themselves in a world suffused with sorcery and danger. In this retrospective drop, we’ve taken some of our favorite cover art from actual Dungeon & Dragons books and paired those pieces with iconic spells.\r\n<br>Across seven cards, you’ll find art from Supplement I: Greyhawk (1975), Players Handbook (1978), the “Red Box” Basic Rules (1983), 2nd Edition Dungeon Master Guide (1989), 3rd Edition Monster Manual (2000), 4th Edition Dungeon Master’s Guide (2008), and 5th Edition Dungeon Master’s Guide (2014).\r\n<br>Art by Greg Bell, Jeff Easley, Larry Elmore, Henry G. Higginbotham, Tyler Jacobson, Wayne Reynolds, and Dave Trampier\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Fell the Mighty\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Faithless Looting\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Goldspan Dragon\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Reality Shift\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Monster Manual\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Ponder\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Acererak the Archlich"}]},{"productId":565542,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: An Exhibition of Adventure - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons An Exhibition of Adventure Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565542_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565542/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-an-exhibition-of-adventure-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:58.123","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For 50 years, some of the world’s most evocative fantasy art has graced the covers of Dungeons & Dragons tomes, inspiring generations of gamers to imagine themselves in a world suffused with sorcery and danger. In this retrospective drop, we’ve taken some of our favorite cover art from actual Dungeon & Dragons books and paired those pieces with iconic spells.\r\n<br>Across seven cards, you’ll find art from Supplement I: Greyhawk (1975), Players Handbook (1978), the “Red Box” Basic Rules (1983), 2nd Edition Dungeon Master Guide (1989), 3rd Edition Monster Manual (2000), 4th Edition Dungeon Master’s Guide (2008), and 5th Edition Dungeon Master’s Guide (2014).\r\n<br>Art by Greg Bell, Jeff Easley, Larry Elmore, Henry G. Higginbotham, Tyler Jacobson, Wayne Reynolds, and Dave Trampier\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Fell the Mighty\r\n<br>• 1x Faithless Looting\r\n<br>• 1x Goldspan Dragon\r\n<br>• 1x Reality Shift\r\n<br>• 1x Monster Manual\r\n<br>• 1x Ponder\r\n<br>• 1x Acererak the Archlich"}]},{"productId":565545,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder I - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder I Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565545_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565545/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-death-is-in-the-eyes-of-the-beholder-i-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:49.383","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Xanathar is the title held by the beholder crime lord that lives in the dungeons under Waterdeep. There have been many called Xanathar—this isn’t the first beholder to claim this mantle, nor will it be the last. Witness the brilliance of Xanathar’s machinations as it fires its Charm Ray, Sleep Ray, Slowing Ray, Petrification Ray and Fear Ray towards its helpless and hapless foes.\r\n<br>Art by Natalie Andrewson, Ricardo Cavolo, Ricardo Diseño, Doodleskelly, Wojtek Lebski, and Jordan Speer\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Xanathar, Guild Kingpin\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Bribery as “Beholder’s Charm Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Stifle as “Beholder’s Sleep Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Delay as “Beholder’s Slowing Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Blood Money as “Beholder’s Petrification Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Drown in the Loch as “Beholder’s Fear Ray”"}]},{"productId":565547,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder I - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder I Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565547_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565547/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-death-is-in-the-eyes-of-the-beholder-i-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:40.61","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Xanathar is the title held by the beholder crime lord that lives in the dungeons under Waterdeep. There have been many called Xanathar—this isn’t the first beholder to claim this mantle, nor will it be the last. Witness the brilliance of Xanathar’s machinations as it fires its Charm Ray, Sleep Ray, Slowing Ray, Petrification Ray and Fear Ray towards its helpless and hapless foes.\r\n<br>Art by Natalie Andrewson, Ricardo Cavolo, Ricardo Diseño, Doodleskelly, Wojtek Lebski, and Jordan Speer\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Xanathar, Guild Kingpin\r\n<br>• 1x Bribery as “Beholder’s Charm Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Stifle as “Beholder’s Sleep Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Delay as “Beholder’s Slowing Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Blood Money as “Beholder’s Petrification Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Drown in the Loch as “Beholder’s Fear Ray”"}]},{"productId":565548,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder II - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder II Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565548_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565548/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-death-is-in-the-eyes-of-the-beholder-ii-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:27.843","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Karazikar regards itself as the overlord of all that comes under its many-eyed gaze. And unlike many beholders, Karazikar doesn’t live in solitude, rather it keeps its lair full of servants and dispensable thralls. Wield Karazikar’s tyranny against your enemies by casting Death Ray, Enervation Ray, Paralyzing Ray, Telekinetic Ray and Disintegration Ray.\r\n<br>Art by Cabrol, Dan Mumford, Ed Repka, Skinner, Will Sweeney, and Jon Vermilyea\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Karazikar, the Eye Tyrant\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Snuff Out as “Beholder’s Death Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Defile as “Beholder’s Enervation Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Oubliette as “Beholder’s Paralyzing Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Fling as “Beholder’s Telekinetic Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Fire Covenant as “Beholder’s Disintegration Ray”"}]},{"productId":565549,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder II - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Death is in the Eyes of the Beholder II Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565549_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565549/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-death-is-in-the-eyes-of-the-beholder-ii-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:17.503","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Karazikar regards itself as the overlord of all that comes under its many-eyed gaze. And unlike many beholders, Karazikar doesn’t live in solitude, rather it keeps its lair full of servants and dispensable thralls. Wield Karazikar’s tyranny against your enemies by casting Death Ray, Enervation Ray, Paralyzing Ray, Telekinetic Ray and Disintegration Ray.\r\n<br>Art by Cabrol, Dan Mumford, Ed Repka, Skinner, Will Sweeney, and Jon Vermilyea\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Karazikar, the Eye Tyrant\r\n<br>• 1x Snuff Out as “Beholder’s Death Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Defile as “Beholder’s Enervation Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Oubliette as “Beholder’s Paralyzing Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Fling as “Beholder’s Telekinetic Ray”\r\n<br>• 1x Fire Covenant as “Beholder’s Disintegration Ray”"}]},{"productId":565550,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Astarion's Thirst - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Astarions Thirst Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565550_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565550/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-astarions-thirst-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:18:03.937","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Yearning a bite of something… forbidden? Disarming, deadly and desperately devious, Astarion is in hot pursuit of sweet revenge across five cards with alluring new art. Give in to your craving to lurk in the shadows, stalk your prey, and slowly sink your teeth in… into building your next Commander deck. How delicious.\r\n<br>Art by Justyna Dura, Bartek Fedyczak, Nereida, Mila Pesic, and Livia Prima\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Astarion, the Decadent\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Exquisite Blood\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sanguine Bond\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Anguished Unmaking\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Mortify"}]},{"productId":565551,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Astarion's Thirst - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Astarions Thirst Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565551_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565551/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-astarions-thirst-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:17:47.25","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Yearning a bite of something… forbidden? Disarming, deadly and desperately devious, Astarion is in hot pursuit of sweet revenge across five cards with alluring new art. Give in to your craving to lurk in the shadows, stalk your prey, and slowly sink your teeth in… into building your next Commander deck. How delicious.\r\n<br>Art by Justyna Dura, Bartek Fedyczak, Nereida, Mila Pesic, and Livia Prima\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Astarion, the Decadent\r\n<br>• 1x Exquisite Blood\r\n<br>• 1x Sanguine Bond\r\n<br>• 1x Anguished Unmaking\r\n<br>• 1x Mortify"}]},{"productId":565552,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Karlach's Rage - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Karlachs Rage Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565552_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565552/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-karlachs-rage-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:17:19.857","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Things are heating up with a blazing-hot drop featuring tiefling barbarian, Karlach. Five smoldering cards showcase Karlach raging to repair her heart while retaining her freedom. Construct your next Commander deck with Karlach at the helm and you’ll be playing with fire.\r\n<br>Art by Justyna Dura, Bartek Fedyczak, Mila Pesic, Fajareka Setiawan, and Johannes Voss\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Karlach, Fury of Avernus\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil City on Fire\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Stranglehold\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Thrill of Possibility\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Dolmen Gate"}]},{"productId":565553,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Karlach's Rage - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Karlachs Rage Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/565553_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/565553/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-karlachs-rage-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-11-18T15:17:08.407","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Things are heating up with a blazing-hot drop featuring tiefling barbarian, Karlach. Five smoldering cards showcase Karlach raging to repair her heart while retaining her freedom. Construct your next Commander deck with Karlach at the helm and you’ll be playing with fire.\r\n<br>Art by Justyna Dura, Bartek Fedyczak, Mila Pesic, Fajareka Setiawan, and Johannes Voss\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Karlach, Fury of Avernus\r\n<br>• 1x City on Fire\r\n<br>• 1x Stranglehold\r\n<br>• 1x Thrill of Possibility\r\n<br>• 1x Dolmen Gate"}]},{"productId":584512,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: The Cabin with Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop The Cabin with Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584512_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584512/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-the-cabin-with-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:41:13.31","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Woah, check out this abandoned cabin! It’s filled with all the foil and non-foil cards from the Camp Totally Safe Superdrop. Kinda weird that they’re all strewn across the ground, on top of that big red paint stain. I guess someone didn’t finish redecorating last summer. Never mind all that—let’s grab those cards!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x The Cabin with Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x The Cabin with Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":584513,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: The Cabin with Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop The Cabin with Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584513_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584513/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-the-cabin-with-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:41:03.747","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Come here, quick! I just found all the foil cards from the Camp Totally Safe Superdrop inside this trashed cabin. I assumed all the shimmering on the ground was just reflections from the broken window and the broken mirror and that huge knife. But it’s actually from all the beautiful, shining foil cards! I guess a wild raccoon must’ve broken in looking for food. Oh well, snag those foils!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage JP Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Chucky Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Duskmourn</em>™ Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monstrous Magazines Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Peach Momoko Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Tome of the Astral Sorceress Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":584514,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: The Cabin with Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop The Cabin with Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584514_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584514/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-the-cabin-with-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:40:55.557","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Uh oh, looks like I just found the . . . “party cabin!” All the beds are broken, the dresser is knocked over, and there’s a huge axe stuck in the wall. Plus, there’s a pile of all the non-foil cards from the Camp Totally Safe Superdrop! It looks like somebody had a great time in here. I hope we party like this while we’re here at Camp Totally Safe.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage JP\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Chucky\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Duskmourn</em>™ \r\n<br>• 1x Monstrous Magazines\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Peach Momoko\r\n<br>• 1x Tome of the Astral Sorceress"}]},{"productId":584515,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop Hatsune Miku Electric Entourage Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584515_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584515/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-hatsune-miku-electric-entourage-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:40:46.207","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Score a star-studded lineup of drops featuring Hatsune Miku and the rest of the Character Vocal Series. This bundle includes the foil and non-foil versions of Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage in both English and Japanese.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage JP Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage JP"}]},{"productId":584516,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: Noise from the Woods Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop Noise from the Woods Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584516_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584516/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-noise-from-the-woods-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:40:32.523","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Did you hear that? There was a noise just beyond the campfire light. It sounded like a twig breaking, or maybe a bundle of four amazing drops. And there was a glint of something shining in the trees too, like probably foil cards? We should go check it out, one-by-one.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Chucky Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Monstrous Magazines Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Peach Momoko Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Tome of the Astral Sorceress Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":584517,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: Noise from the Woods Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop Noise from the Woods Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584517_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584517/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-noise-from-the-woods-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:40:22.387","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>I definitely just heard something weird coming from behind the cabin. Like, maybe it was a scream? Something like, “Help me . . .”? It was probably just someone saying, “Help me . . . grab these four awesome bundles and build some cool Commander decks.” Um, where’s Peyton?\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Chucky\r\n<br>• 1x Monstrous Magazines\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Peach Momoko\r\n<br>• 1x Tome of the Astral Sorceress"}]},{"productId":584518,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: Night Swim Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop Night Swim Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584518_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584518/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-night-swim-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:40:10.35","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There’s nothing like a nice, moonlit swim to take your mind off all the unexplained disappearances. All alone, just you, the lake, and three foil drops shimmering in the moonlight. Plus there’s that empty canoe in the distance. Is it getting closer?\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Duskmourn</em>™ Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":584519,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Camp Totally Safe Superdrop: Night Swim Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Camp Totally Safe Superdrop Night Swim Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584519_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584519/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-camp-totally-safe-superdrop-night-swim-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:39:51.533","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>MARCO! . . . MARCO! . . . Okay, y’all, this isn’t funny. We all agreed to play Marco Polo in the lake at midnight and the winner gets these three spooky non-foil drops. But now, nobody’s answering me! MARCO! . . . Hey, who just touched my ankle? Guess what—you’re it.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer\r\n<br>• 1x Showcase: <em>Duskmourn</em>™"}]},{"productId":584520,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku Electric Entourage EN Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584520_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584520/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-hatsune-miku-electric-entourage-en-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:39:41.953","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hatsune Miku’s is back for the third stop on her Secret Lair tour, and this time she’s brought her friends! The digital diva is joined by the rest of the Character Vocal Series in an absolute party of a drop. This ensemble of electric superstars and fan-favorite cards is a can’t-miss collaboration!\r\n<br>Art by Naomi Baker, Clint Cearley, Jesper Ejsing, RAITA KAZAMA, Livia Prima\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Elspeth Tirel as “Miku, Divine Diva”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Jace, Unraveler of Secrets as “KAITO Mysterious Maestro”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Liliana of the Dark Realms as “Luka, the Traveling Sound”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Freyalise, Llanowar’s Fury as “Miku, Voice of Power”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil The Royal Scions as “Len and Rin, Harmony Incarnate”"}]},{"productId":584521,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage EN - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku Electric Entourage EN Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584521_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584521/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-hatsune-miku-electric-entourage-en-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:39:31.217","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Produ