\n<br>• 1x Japanese Rainbow Foil Jace, Unraveler of Secrets as “KAITO Mysterious Maestro”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Rainbow Foil Liliana of the Dark Realms as “Luka, the Traveling Sound”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Rainbow Foil Freyalise, Llanowar’s Fury as “Miku, Voice of Power”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Rainbow FoilThe Royal Scions as “Len and Rin, Harmony Incarnate”"}]},{"productId":584523,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Electric Entourage JP - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku Electric Entourage JP Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584523_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584523/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-hatsune-miku-electric-entourage-jp-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:39:11.093","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hatsune Miku’s is back for the third stop on her Secret Lair tour, and this time she’s brought her friends! The digital diva is joined by the rest of the Character Vocal Series in an absolute party of a drop. This ensemble of electric superstars and fan-favorite cards is a can’t-miss collaboration!\r\n<br>Art by Naomi Baker, Clint Cearley, Jesper Ejsing, RAITA KAZAMA, Livia Prima\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Elspeth Tirel as “Miku, Divine Diva”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Jace, Unraveler of Secrets as “KAITO Mysterious Maestro”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Liliana of the Dark Realms as “Luka, the Traveling Sound”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese Freyalise, Llanowar’s Fury as “Miku, Voice of Power”\r\n<br>• 1x Japanese The Royal Scions as “Len and Rin, Harmony Incarnate”"}]},{"productId":584524,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Ghostbusters The Real Ghostbusters Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584524_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584524/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-ghostbusters-the-real-ghostbusters-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:38:44.77","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Mom! Mom! You gotta check out these awesome cards! They’ve got the REAL GHOSTBUSTERS on ’em! No Mom, it doesn’t matter that it’s 1984 and they’re for a game that won’t even exist for nine years. How do you even know that, anyway? Never mind. All that matters is that I get these cards and another bowl of cereal. The show’s about to come back on! Mom!\r\n<br>Art by Tyler Walpole\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Careful Study\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Living End as “Total Containment Failure”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Eladamri’s Call as “Answer the Call”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Boros Charm as “Ghostbuster’s Patch”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Unlicensed Hearse as “Ecto-1”"}]},{"productId":584525,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: The Real Ghostbusters - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Ghostbusters The Real Ghostbusters Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584525_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584525/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-ghostbusters-the-real-ghostbusters-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:38:26.77","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Mom! Mom! You gotta check out these awesome cards! They’ve got the REAL GHOSTBUSTERS on ’em! No Mom, it doesn’t matter that it’s 1984 and they’re for a game that won’t even exist for nine years. How do you even know that, anyway? Never mind. All that matters is that I get these cards and another bowl of cereal. The show’s about to come back on! Mom!\r\n<br>Art by Tyler Walpole\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Careful Study\r\n<br>• 1x Living End as “Total Containment Failure”\r\n<br>• 1x Eladamri’s Call as “Answer the Call”\r\n<br>• 1x Boros Charm as “Ghostbuster’s Patch”\r\n<br>• 1x Unlicensed Hearse as “Ecto-1”"}]},{"productId":584526,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Ghostbusters Slimer Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584526_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584526/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-ghostbusters-slimer-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:38:13.44","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Oh no! A non-terminal repeating phantasm, or a Class Five full-roaming vapor, is haunting Secret Lair. It’s Slimer, the Ghostbuster’s sometimes friend, sometimes foe, and always gluttonous green ghost. This mischievous spirit glides and grunts across five ghastly cards, ready to gorge on your opponents across the table and leave a slimy trail of ectoplasm in his wake.\r\n<br>Art by Clint Cearley, Simon Dominic, Bill McConkey, Jason Rainville, Leonardo Santanna.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil The Mimeoplasm as “Slimer, Voracious Apparition”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Trickbind as “Slimed”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Windfall as “Slimer’s Feast”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Incarnation Technique as “Escape Containment”\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Pernicious Deed"}]},{"productId":584527,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Ghostbusters: Slimer - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Ghostbusters Slimer Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584527_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584527/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-ghostbusters-slimer-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:37:50.547","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Oh no! A non-terminal repeating phantasm, or a Class Five full-roaming vapor, is haunting Secret Lair. It’s Slimer, the Ghostbuster’s sometimes friend, sometimes foe, and always gluttonous green ghost. This mischievous spirit glides and grunts across five ghastly cards, ready to gorge on your opponents across the table and leave a slimy trail of ectoplasm in his wake.\r\n<br>Art by Clint Cearley, Simon Dominic, Bill McConkey, Jason Rainville, Leonardo Santanna.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x The Mimeoplasm as “Slimer, Voracious Apparition”\r\n<br>• 1x Trickbind as “Slimed”\r\n<br>• 1x Windfall as “Slimer’s Feast”\r\n<br>• 1x Incarnation Technique as “Escape Containment”\r\n<br>• 1x Pernicious Deed"}]},{"productId":584528,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Duskmourn - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Duskmourn Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584528_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584528/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-duskmourn-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:52.877","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The TV in the Secret Lair rumpus room keeps turning on to static, even though we unplugged it . . . A scrambled voice coming from the speakers is narrating every move we make . . . And we keep getting fragmented texts begging us not to leave . . . It all adds up to one thing—the glitched-out Showcase: Duskmourn™ drop is finally overriding our servers. Best to just accept fate and wait to be sucked into cyberspace for all eternity. At least we’ll have some awesomely uncanny cards to keep us company.\r\n<br>Art by Scott Buoncristiano, Alexandre Chaudret, Bastien Grivet, Cacho Rubione, Ivan Shavrin.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Phyrexian Metamorph\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Cauldron Familiar\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Dauthi Voidwalker\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Magus of the Moon\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Witch’s Oven"}]},{"productId":584529,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Showcase: Duskmourn - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Showcase Duskmourn Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584529_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584529/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-showcase-duskmourn-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:47.393","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The TV in the Secret Lair rumpus room keeps turning on to static, even though we unplugged it . . . A scrambled voice coming from the speakers is narrating every move we make . . . And we keep getting fragmented texts begging us not to leave . . . It all adds up to one thing—the glitched-out Showcase: Duskmourn™ drop is finally overriding our servers. Best to just accept fate and wait to be sucked into cyberspace for all eternity. At least we’ll have some awesomely uncanny cards to keep us company.\r\n<br>Art by Scott Buoncristiano, Alexandre Chaudret, Bastien Grivet, Cacho Rubione, Ivan Shavrin.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Metamorph\r\n<br>• 1x Cauldron Familiar\r\n<br>• 1x Dauthi Voidwalker\r\n<br>• 1x Magus of the Moon\r\n<br>• 1x Witch’s Oven"}]},{"productId":584530,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Monstrous Magazines - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Monstrous Magazines Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584530_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584530/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-monstrous-magazines-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:42.877","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Only the most grotesque ghouls, bloodthirsty beasts, and famous fiends make it onto the cover of Horrors from Across the Planes—Magic’s only periodical celebrating all the creepiest creeps from across the Multiverse. Give your opponents nightmares as you take these macabre monsters from magazine cover to your gaming table.\r\n<br>Art by Ed Repka\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Doom Whisperer\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Ravenous Chupacabra\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Koma, Cosmos Serpent\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Uril, the Miststalker"}]},{"productId":584531,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Monstrous Magazines - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Monstrous Magazines Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584531_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584531/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-monstrous-magazines-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:30.017","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Only the most grotesque ghouls, bloodthirsty beasts, and famous fiends make it onto the cover of Horrors from Across the Planes—Magic’s only periodical celebrating all the creepiest creeps from across the Multiverse. Give your opponents nightmares as you take these macabre monsters from magazine cover to your gaming table.\r\n<br>Art by Ed Repka\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Doom Whisperer\r\n<br>• 1x Ravenous Chupacabra\r\n<br>• 1x Koma, Cosmos Serpent\r\n<br>• 1x Mazirek, Kraul Death Priest\r\n<br>• 1x Uril, the Miststalker"}]},{"productId":584532,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Peach Momoko - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Peach Momoko Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584532_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584532/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-peach-momoko-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:17.53","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Eisner and Ringo Award winning comic-book artist Peach Momoko brings her iconic and deeply personal illustrative style to Secret Lair across five breathtaking cards. In striking black and white, the first-time Magic artist contrasts light and shadow while combining feminine mystique with madness to create compositions that are chillingly beautiful.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Aetherize\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Drown in Dreams\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Psychic Corrosion\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Visions of Beyond\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Time Sieve"}]},{"productId":584534,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Peach Momoko - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Peach Momoko Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584534_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584534/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-peach-momoko-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:35:06.68","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Eisner and Ringo Award winning comic-book artist Peach Momoko brings her iconic and deeply personal illustrative style to Secret Lair across five breathtaking cards. In striking black and white, the first-time Magic artist contrasts light and shadow while combining feminine mystique with madness to create compositions that are chillingly beautiful.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Aetherize\r\n<br>• 1x Drown in Dreams\r\n<br>• 1x Psychic Corrosion\r\n<br>• 1x Visions of Beyond\r\n<br>• 1x Time Sieve"}]},{"productId":584536,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Tome of the Astral Sorceress - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Tome of the Astral Sorceress Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584536_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584536/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-tome-of-the-astral-sorceress-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:34:54.83","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Look to the stars. Transcend the unknown. Illuminate answers hiding behind the veil of time. With art that feels torn from the pages of a modern spell book, the Tome of the Astral Sorceress lets you unlock your potential for celestial divination and glimpse gently into what may be. But take caution, knowing the future might make you change it . . .\r\n<br>Art by Helvetica Blanc\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Back to Basics\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Preordain\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sphinx of the Second Sun\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Teferi’s Ageless Insight"}]},{"productId":584539,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Tome of the Astral Sorceress - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Tome of the Astral Sorceress Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584539_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584539/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-tome-of-the-astral-sorceress-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:34:29.127","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Look to the stars. Transcend the unknown. Illuminate answers hiding behind the veil of time. With art that feels torn from the pages of a modern spell book, the Tome of the Astral Sorceress lets you unlock your potential for celestial divination and glimpse gently into what may be. But take caution, knowing the future might make you change it . . .\r\n<br>Art by Helvetica Blanc\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Back to Basics\r\n<br>• 1x Preordain\r\n<br>• 1x Sphinx of the Second Sun\r\n<br>• 1x Teferi’s Ageless Insight"}]},{"productId":584541,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Chucky - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Chucky Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584541_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584541/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-chucky-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:34:13.607","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Whelp . . . we got a new Good Guys doll delivered, and it came with this strange amulet and ancient tome. So obviously we started reading the tome aloud and when we turned around the doll was gone! Weird, right? Now we keep hearing the pitter-patter of small feet echoing all around the Secret Lair . . . but it’s probably nothing. Inspired by the whole experience, we’ve made five killer cards that are all dolled up with Chucky and absolutely must be possessed. Wanna play?\r\n<br>Art by Domenico Cava, Justine Cruz, Eddie Mendoza, Sean Vo, Tomasz Zarucki & Thomas Roach\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Reversible Kardur, Doomscourge as “Chucky”\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Phyrexian Reclamation as “Sorry, Jack . . . Chucky’s Back”\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Varragoth, Bloodsky Sire as “Tiffany, Bride of Chucky”\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Twinflame as “Friends to the End”\r\n<br>• 1x Traditional Foil Genesis Chamber as “Play Pals Factory”"}]},{"productId":584544,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Chucky - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Chucky Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584544_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584544/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-chucky-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-16T15:28:24.91","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Whelp . . . we got a new Good Guys doll delivered, and it came with this strange amulet and ancient tome. So obviously we started reading the tome aloud and when we turned around the doll was gone! Weird, right? Now we keep hearing the pitter-patter of small feet echoing all around the Secret Lair . . . but it’s probably nothing. Inspired by the whole experience, we’ve made five killer cards that are all dolled up with Chucky and absolutely must be possessed. Wanna play?\r\n<br>Art by Domenico Cava, Justine Cruz, Eddie Mendoza, Sean Vo, Tomasz Zarucki & Thomas Roach\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Kardur, Doomscourge as “Chucky”\r\n<br>• 1x Phyrexian Reclamation as “Sorry, Jack . . . Chucky’s Back”\r\n<br>• 1x Varragoth, Bloodsky Sire as “Tiffany, Bride of Chucky”\r\n<br>• 1x Twinflame as “Friends to the End”\r\n<br>• 1x Genesis Chamber as “Play Pals Factory”"}]},{"productId":586952,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Pixel Perfect: Extra Life 2024 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Pixel Perfect Extra Life 2024 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/586952_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/586952/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixel-perfect-extra-life-2024-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-13T17:29:47.33","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This side-scrolling, platforming drop features Fblthp braving a lava-filled adventure to battle the big, bad boss Nicol Bolas and save the day! With four amazing cards and awesome video game–inspired art, including Fierce Guardianship, this drop is the perfect power-up for your next deck.\r\n<br>Art by Mike Burns\r\n<br>Contents: \r\n<br>• 1x Mana Geyser \r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Bolt  \r\n<br>• 1x Fierce Guardianship  \r\n<br>• 1x Delayed Blast Fireball"}]},{"productId":586953,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Pixel Perfect: Extra Life 2024 - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Pixel Perfect Extra Life 2024 Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/586953_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/586953/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-pixel-perfect-extra-life-2024-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-13T17:29:53.007","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This side-scrolling, platforming drop features Fblthp braving a lava-filled adventure to battle the big, bad boss Nicol Bolas and save the day! With four amazing cards and awesome video game–inspired art, including Fierce Guardianship, this drop is the perfect power-up for your next deck.\r\n<br>Art by Mike Burns\r\n<br>Contents: \r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Mana Geyser \r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Lightning Bolt  \r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Fierce Guardianship  \r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Delayed Blast Fireball"}]},{"productId":592056,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Marvel Superdrop: The Heroic Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Marvel Superdrop The Heroic Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/592056_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/592056/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-marvel-superdrop-the-heroic-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-23T13:50:43.753","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s the team-up of the century! All the foils, all the non-foils, all the cards from the Marvel Superdrop! When the world is in danger, this is the bundle that rises up to defend us.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x The Astonishing Foil Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x The Mighty Non-Foil Bundle"}]},{"productId":592059,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Marvel Superdrop: The Astonishing Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Marvel Superdrop The Astonishing Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/592059_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/592059/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-marvel-superdrop-the-astonishing-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-23T13:50:36.59","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Black Panther’s Vibranium Suit, Captain America’s Shield, Iron Man’s Arc Reactor, Storm’s Lightning, and Wolverine’s Claws—they all shine brightly when the day is darkest. And now you can see every single one shimmering in this bundle of foil drops from the Marvel Superdrop.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Iron Man Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Wolverine Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Storm Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Captain America Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Black Panther Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":592060,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Marvel Superdrop: The Mighty Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Marvel Superdrop The Mighty Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/592060_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/592060/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-marvel-superdrop-the-mighty-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2024-12-23T13:50:29.487","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Look out! This superpowered bundle of five heroic non-foil drops from the Marvel Superdrop has the power to STUN both your friends and your foes at the game table. Thank goodness those cards are on our side.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Iron Man\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Wolverine\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Storm\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Captain America\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Black Panther"}]},{"productId":592061,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Captain America - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Captain America Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/592061_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/592061/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-captain-america-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2024-12-23T13:50:22.123","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Justice, liberty, honor—these are the values Captain America protects with his shield held high. That’s why each and every courageous card in this drop, including the all-new, legendary Cap