94,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Strange Sands: Forest - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Strange Sands Forest Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/610794_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/610794/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-strange-sands-forest-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-03-03T15:42:39.647","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For this sale Scott Balmer created five surreal lands and then we divided them up into separate releases, so pick the version you want and receive 10 copies of that card for your deck.\r\n<br>Art by Scott Balmer\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 10x Forest"}]},{"productId":610795,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Strange Sands: Forest - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Strange Sands Forest Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/610795_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/610795/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-strange-sands-forest-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-03-03T15:42:28.757","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For this sale Scott Balmer created five surreal lands and then we divided them up into separate releases, so pick the version you want and receive 10 copies of that card for your deck.\r\n<br>Art by Scott Balmer\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 10x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":616921,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Animar & Friends - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Animar and Friends Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/616921_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/616921/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-animar-and-friends-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:19:58.177","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nWith playful new art from Jack Teagle and five cards that synergize around Animar, Soul of Elements, this drop can inspire your next commander deck or just give you something to admire while dipping your Italian beef into some delicious au jus.\r\n<br>\r\nContents:\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Animar, Soul of Elements\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Benevolent Hydra\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Forgotten Ancient\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil All Will Be One\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Mulldrifter"}]},{"productId":616923,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Festival in a Box Chicago 2025 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Festival in a Box Chicago 2025 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/616923_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/616923/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-chicago-2025-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:20:23.01","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nTo celebrate MagicCon in the Windy City, we’re serving up a tasty Festival in a Box with all the fixings.\r\n<br>\r\nInside each Mystery Booster 2 display box you’ll find 24 booster packs featuring cards with nearly 200 set symbols. Each 15-card pack includes one white-border card, one playtest card, and one Future Sight frame card which might even be one of 15 exclusively foil cards. Drafting will feel like you’re cracking packs from Magic’s past, Magic’s future, and Magic’s weird alternate timeline where everyone has a moustache and an Italian beef sandwich.\r\n<br>\r\nPlus, you’ll get the Animar & Friends Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop. With playful new art from Jack Teagle and five cards that synergize around Animar, Soul of Elements, this drop can inspire your next commander deck or just give you something to admire while dipping your Italian beef into some delicious au jus.\r\n<br>\r\nTo top it all off, four promo cards including a Foil Retro Frame Serra the Benevolent, a Foil Future Sight Frame Ponder, a Foil Future Sight Frame The First Sliver, and a “Second City” playtest card. These cards are hot. Probably as hot as the spicy giardiniera on an Italian beef sandwich. Yum!\r\n<br>\r\nAll cards are English only.\r\n<br>\r\nFestival in a Box: Chicago 2025 is limited to 3 per customer.\r\n<br>\r\nContents:\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Animar, Soul of Elements\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Benevolent Hydra\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Forgotten Ancient\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil All Will Be One\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Mulldrifter\r\n<br>\r\n4x Promo Cards\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Serra the Benevolent\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil Ponder\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Foil The First Sliver\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Second City playtest card"}]},{"productId":618046,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva EN - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku Winter Diva EN Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618046_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618046/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-hatsune-miku-winter-diva-en-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:29