Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Danish illustrator Jesper Ejsing holds a lifelong love of fantasy and fantasy art rooted in the first time he played Dungeons & Dragons® on Christmas Day in 1986. He decided then and there, with a d20 in his hand, to become a fantasy artist. Just over 20 years later, Jesper made his Magic: The Gathering debut with art on five cards in 2007’s Lorwyn™. Since then, Ejsing has illustrated over 250 Magic cards in his vibrant, dramatic and imaginative style. This Artist Series features four cards selected by Jesper, new art illustrated by Jesper, and flavor text curated by Jesper. It’s the quintessential “Jesper” experience.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sun Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Breeches, Eager Pillager\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Deflecting Swat\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Llanowar Elves"}]},{"productId":618096,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Jesper Ejsing - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Jesper Ejsing Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618096_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618096/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-jesper-ejsing-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-06T13:13:38.95","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Danish illustrator Jesper Ejsing holds a lifelong love of fantasy and fantasy art rooted in the first time he played Dungeons & Dragons® on Christmas Day in 1986. He decided then and there, with a d20 in his hand, to become a fantasy artist. Just over 20 years later, Jesper made his Magic: The Gathering debut with art on five cards in 2007’s Lorwyn™. Since then, Ejsing has illustrated over 250 Magic cards in his vibrant, dramatic and imaginative style. This Artist Series features four cards selected by Jesper, new art illustrated by Jesper, and flavor text curated by Jesper. It’s the quintessential “Jesper” experience.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Sun Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Breeches, Eager Pillager\r\n<br>• 1x Deflecting Swat\r\n<br>• 1x Llanowar Elves"}]},{"productId":618097,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Luke Pearson - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Luke Pearson Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618097_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618097/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-luke-pearson-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:31:06.95","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Illustrator and writer of the award-winning graphic novel series Hilda, Luke Pearson brings his charming style to Secret Lair for his first Featuring drop. Across four fantastic cards set in an enchanting world of his own imagination, each playful piece of art feels like a snapshot of a new and thrilling story filled with heroes, villains, unlikely friends, and unexpected adventure.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Witch of the Moors\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Bear Umbra\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Realmwalker\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Solemn Simulacrum"}]},{"productId":618098,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Luke Pearson - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Luke Pearson Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618098_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618098/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secr