he metal!\r\n<br>Art by 6VCR, Kirokaze, and Chuck Lukacs.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Big Score\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Final Fortune\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Heat Shimmer\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Roiling Vortex\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wheel of Misfortune"}]},{"productId":618100,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Arcade Racers - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Arcade Racers Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618100_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618100/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-arcade-racers-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:31:23.947","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ready to race? Insert token to IGNITE ENGINES! \r\n<br>— Select Your Track —\r\n<br>- Big Score: You’ve stolen the loot, now it’s time to escape.\r\n<br>- Final Fortune: When push comes to shove, you make your own luck.\r\n<br>- Heat Shimmer: The desert is hot, but your engine is hotter.\r\n<br>- Roiling Vortex: Outrace your opponents, outrun the lava.\r\n<br>- Wheel of Misfortune: Doom awaits you around every turn.\r\n<br>Get ready to grab the wheel and push the pedal to the metal!\r\n<br>Art by 6VCR, Kirokaze, and Chuck Lukacs.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Big Score\r\n<br>• 1x Final Fortune\r\n<br>• 1x Heat Shimmer\r\n<br>• 1x Roiling Vortex\r\n<br>• 1x Wheel of Misfortune"}]},{"productId":618102,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop City Styles 2 Dressed to Kill Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618102_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618102/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-city-styles-2-dressed-to-kill-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-10-14T19:48:16.583","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Fluid yet bold. Raw yet refined. Ethereal yet timeless.\r\n<br>Another cutting-edge collection by Tsubonari reminds us that killer fashion is always in season.\r\n<br>And that season is… now.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Karmic Guide\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Ninja of the Deep Hours\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Captain Sisay\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Selvala, Explorer Returned\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Veyran, Voice of Duality"}]},{"productId":618103,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop City Styles 2 Dressed to Kill Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618103_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618103/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-city-styles-2-dressed-to-kill-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-10-14T19:48:11.483","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Fluid yet bold. Raw yet refined. Ethereal yet timeless.\r\n<br>Another cutting-edge collection by Tsubonari reminds us that killer fashion is always in season.\r\n<br>And that season is… now.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Karmic Guide\r\n<br>• 1x Ninja of the Deep Hours\r\n<br>• 1x Captain Sisay\r\n<br>• 1x Selvala, Explorer Returned\r\n<br>• 1x Veyran, Voice of Duality"}]},{"productId":618105,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Mitsuhiro Arita Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618105_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618105/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-mitsuhiro-arita-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:31:54.693","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>With nearly 30 years of experience creating beloved art for trading card games, Mitsuhiro Arita’s work has become some of the most recognizable in the world. His first collaboration with <em>Magic: The Gathering</em> was on a borderless Lumra, Bellow of the Woods released in 2024’s <em>Bloomburrow</em>, which quickly became a fan-favorite. In this Secret Lair Drop, the legendary artist returns to showcase his iconic creature design across four remarkable cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Light-Paws, Emperor’s Voice\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Murktide Regent\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Shorikai, Genesis Engine"}]},{"productId":618106,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Mitsuhiro Arita Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618106_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618106/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-mitsuhiro-arita-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:31:58.867","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>With nearly 30 years of experience creating beloved art for trading card games, Mitsuhiro Arita’s work has become some of the most recognizable in the world. His first collaboration with <em>Magic: The Gathering</em> was on a borderless Lumra, Bellow of the Woods released in 2024’s <em>Bloomburrow</em>, which quickly became a fan-favorite. In this Secret Lair Drop, the legendary artist returns to showcase his iconic creature design across four remarkable cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Light-Paws, Emperor’s Voice\r\n<br>• 1x Murktide Regent\r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Shorikai, Genesis Engine"}]},{"productId":618109,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Lorwyn Lightboxes - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Lorwyn Lightboxes Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618109_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618109/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-lorwyn-lightboxes-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:18.587","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>When light and darkness play, liminal spaces on the border between reality and imagination spring into existence. This is where goblins swarm and merfolk swim, where giants fight and faeries frolic, it’s where elves sing—under an umbra created by starlight.\r\n<br>With meticulously painted and cut paper, assembled into scenic lightboxes and beautifully photographed, artists Hari & Deepti bring the cycle of typal lands from <em>Lorwyn</em> out of the shadow of the past and into the spotlight.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Ancient Amphitheater\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Auntie’s Hovel\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Gilt-Leaf Palace\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Secluded Glen\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wanderwine Hub"}]},{"productId":618110,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Lorwyn Lightboxes - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Lorwyn Lightboxes Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618110_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618110/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-lorwyn-lightboxes-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:23.3","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>When light and darkness play, liminal spaces on the border between reality and imagination spring into existence. This is where goblins swarm and merfolk swim, where giants fight and faeries frolic, it’s where elves sing—under an umbra created by starlight.\r\n<br>With meticulously painted and cut paper, assembled into scenic lightboxes and beautifully photographed, artists Hari & Deepti bring the cycle of typal lands from <em>Lorwyn</em> out of the shadow of the past and into the spotlight.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ancient Amphitheater\r\n<br>• 1x Auntie’s Hovel\r\n<br>• 1x Gilt-Leaf Palace\r\n<br>• 1x Secluded Glen\r\n<br>• 1x Wanderwine Hub"}]},{"productId":618111,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Aether Drifters - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Aether Drifters Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618111_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618111/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-aether-drifters-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:28.37","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Buckle-up, speedsters, an all-new set of Aether Drifters race cards are zooming from the Ghirapur Grand Prix racetrack to your front door. These high-octane, reversible cards feature some of Magic’s most action-packed vehicles with all-new toy car art. So blast your turbo boosters and catch ’em before they speed away.\r\n<br>Art by Doogie Horner, Rob Pavic, and Ivan Shavrin.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Parhelion II\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Mechtitan Core\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Peacewalker Colossus\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Reckoner Bankbuster\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Smuggler’s Copter\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reversible Mechtitan token"}]},{"productId":618112,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Aether Drifters - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Aether Drifters Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618112_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618112/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-aether-drifters-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:32.487","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Buckle-up, speedsters, an all-new set of Aether Drifters race cards are zooming from the Ghirapur Grand Prix racetrack to your front door. These high-octane, reversible cards feature some of Magic’s most action-packed vehicles with all-new toy car art. So blast your turbo boosters and catch ’em before they speed away.\r\n<br>Art by Doogie Horner, Rob Pavic, and Ivan Shavrin.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Parhelion II\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Mechtitan Core\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Peacewalker Colossus\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Reckoner Bankbuster\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Smuggler’s Copter\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Mechtitan token"}]},{"productId":618113,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Hatsune Miku Winter Diva Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618113_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618113/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-hatsune-miku-winter-diva-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:37.717","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hatsune Miku is taking the Secret Lair stage for her fourth, electrifying stop at Secret Lair, and this bundle includes the greatest hits from her ultimate performance—the foil and non-foil versions of Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Digital Sensation in both English and Japanese.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva EN Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva JP Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva EN\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva JP"}]},{"productId":618114,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Trailblazing Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Trailblazing Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618114_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618114/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-trailblazing-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:41.7","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>As the cold sets in, there is no substitute for traveling expeditiously. Each day that we dilly-dally means another night in the snow before the next town. The Trailblazing Bundle Foil Edition is sure to help keep us moving apace.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Arcade Racers Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Aether Drifters Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":618115,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Trailblazing Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Trailblazing Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618115_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618115/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-trailblazing-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:32:58.94","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We musn’t tarry. No matter the hardship, we must press on. Yes, Jacob has typhoid, and Daniel seems struck by cholera. But the good doctor is seeing to them. Nevertheless, we have the Trailblazing Bundle Non-Foil Edition, so we must press on.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita\r\n<br>• 1x Arcade Racers\r\n<br>• 1x Aether Drifters"}]},{"productId":618116,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Everything a Pioneer Needs Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Everything a Pioneer Needs Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618116_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618116/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-everything-a-pioneer-needs-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:33:04.013","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s been two weeks since the storm started. The food stores are dwindling, and we haven’t seen hide nor hair to hunt. Thank goodness I have my Everything a Pioneer Needs Bundle. Each card, foil and non, has proven its utility time and again. They are powerful. They are precious. Although, I am often tempted to sink my hungry teeth into them. But no, we’ll be at the next trading post soon.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Survival-Grade Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Trail-Ready Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":618117,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Survival-Grade Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Survival Grade Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618117_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618117/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-survival-grade-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:33:08.533","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Last night there was another avalanche and the snow buried me to my neck. I almost lost hope, but then I remembered the Survival-Grade Foils Bundle in my pack. I lifted one of those beautiful, shimmering cards into the air and caught the setting winter’s sun at just the right angle. Within hours, friends from camp had dug me out of my most embarrassing predicament. Again.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva EN Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva JP Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Arcade Racers Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Aether Drifters Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Luke Pearson Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Jesper Ejsing Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Lorwyn Lightboxes Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":618118,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Trail-Ready Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Trail Ready Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618118_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618118/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-trail-ready-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:33:13.233","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>An axle broke this morning. As I was using my Trail-Ready Non-Foils Bundle to repair it, a fracas erupted behind me. A hungry, desperate cougar tried to take advantage of our misfortune it seems. Luckily, I turned and raised the card I was holding high above my head and scared that devil cat away. But not before she managed to pilfer our finest buffalo haunch. Oh well, this is the life of a pioneer.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva EN\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Hatsune Miku: Winter Diva JP\r\n<br>• 1x Arcade Racers\r\n<br>• 1x Aether Drifters\r\n<br>• 1x City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Luke Pearson\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Mitsuhiro Arita\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Jesper Ejsing\r\n<br>• 1x Lorwyn Lightboxes"}]},{"productId":618120,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Campfire Merriment Bundle - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Campfire Merriment Bundle Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618120_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618120/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-campfire-merriment-bundle-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:33:17.81","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Artists, make your art! Musicians, make your music! And someone grab the Campfire Merriment Bundle Foil Edition. We must have something to take our minds off of the incessant howling of the wolves.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Luke Pearson Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Jesper Ejsing Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Lorwyn Lightboxes Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":618121,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Winter Superdrop 2025: Campfire Merriment Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Winter Superdrop 2025 Campfire Merriment Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/618121_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/618121/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-winter-superdrop-2025-campfire-merriment-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-20T19:33:22.7","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Artists, make your art! Musicians, make your music! And someone grab the Campfire Merriment Bundle Foil Edition. We must have something to take our minds off of the incessant howling of the wolves.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Featuring: Luke Pearson\r\n<br>• 1x Artist Series: Jesper Ejsing\r\n<br>• 1x City Styles 2: Dressed to Kill\r\n<br>• 1x Lorwyn Lightboxes"}]},{"productId":619698,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: A Devastation of Dragons - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop A Devastation of Dragons Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/619698_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/619698/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-a-devastation-of-dragons-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-05-29T19:36:19.673","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\nThis Secret Lair Drop was only available to purchase at 2025 MagicCon Events.\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Erol Otus.\r\n<br>\r\nContents:\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Kokusho, the Evening Star\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Niv-Mizzet, Parun\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Scion of the Ur-Dragon\r\n<br>\r\n• 1x Rainbow Foil Skyline Despot"}]},{"productId":622973,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair Promo: Sol Ring - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair Promo Sol Ring Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/622973_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/622973/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-promo-sol-ring-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-02-18T12:40:59.72","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This sealed product contains 1 Rainbow Foil Sol Ring."}]},{"productId":624506,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dogs Are Better Than Cats - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dogs Are Better Than Cats Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624506_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624506/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dogs-are-better-than-cats-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-03-26T20:22:52.887","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dogs vs Cats. Which are better? Which should inspire a whole Superdrop next year? Well, we can’t seem to agree. So we’re letting you decide.\r\n<br>It’ll be all puppers all the time—on the cards, in the art, across each drop. All in about a year, or maybe a little more. It depends on how well they're trained.\r\n<br>This drop boasts the exact same, fan-favorite cards as Cats Are Better Than Dogs and while either is a great add to your favorite deck, this drop features fetching dog art on every powerful card. Plus, getting this drop is a vote for an ALL DOGS SUPERDROP.\r\n<br>If you’re still undecided, Secret Lair’s canine crew put together this of reasons why dogs rule:\r\n<br>• Never leave you alone, ever. Ever.\r\n<br>• Bark at doorbell so you don’t have to.\r\n<br>• Learn fun tricks and forget them in front of guests.\r\n<br>• Always sometimes listens.\r\n<br>• That head tilt thing when trying to understand. <3\r\n<br>• Free guilt trips whenever you leave the house.\r\n<br>• Tippy taps.\r\n<br>• Dig through blankets in search of coziness.\r\n<br>Art by Narendra Bintara Adi, Allison Carl, Cory Godbey, Rhonda Libbey and Nana Qi\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Escape to the Wilds\r\n<br>• 1x Rip Apart\r\n<br>• 1x Titanic Ultimatum\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Basilisk Collar"}]},{"productId":624507,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dogs Are Better Than Cats - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dogs Are Better Than Cats Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624507_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624507/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dogs-are-better-than-cats-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-03-26T20:23:03.993","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dogs vs Cats. Which are better? Which should inspire a whole Superdrop next year? Well, we can’t seem to agree. So we’re letting you decide.\r\n<br>It’ll be all puppers all the time—on the cards, in the art, across each drop. All in about a year, or maybe a little more. It depends on how well they're trained.\r\n<br>This drop boasts the exact same, fan-favorite cards as Cats Are Better Than Dogs and while either is a great add to your favorite deck, this drop features fetching dog art on every powerful card. Plus, getting this drop is a vote for an ALL DOGS SUPERDROP.\r\n<br>If you’re still undecided, Secret Lair’s canine crew put together this of reasons why dogs rule:\r\n<br>• Never leave you alone, ever. Ever.\r\n<br>• Bark at doorbell so you don’t have to.\r\n<br>• Learn fun tricks and forget them in front of guests.\r\n<br>• Always sometimes listens.\r\n<br>• That head tilt thing when trying to understand. <3\r\n<br>• Free guilt trips whenever you leave the house.\r\n<br>• Tippy taps.\r\n<br>• Dig through blankets in search of coziness.\r\n<br>Art by Narendra Bintara Adi, Allison Carl, Cory Godbey, Rhonda Libbey and Nana Qi\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Escape to the Wilds\r\n<br>• 1x Rip Apart\r\n<br>• 1x Titanic Ultimatum\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Basilisk Collar"}]},{"productId":624519,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Cats Are Better Than Dogs - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Cats Are Better Than Dogs Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624519_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624519/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-cats-are-better-than-dogs-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-03-26T20:22:25.29","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>This event is all about Cats vs Dogs—because we just can’t agree on which pet should inspire an entire Superdrop next year. That’s why we’re asking you to decide for us.\r\n<br>This drop features the same powerful cards as Dogs Are Better Than Cats, except this version features adorable cat art instead of dog art. These fan-favorite cards can bolster any deck, but buying this drop is also a vote for an ALL CATS SUPERDROP.\r\n<br>If you’re still on the fence, some of our pro-feline employees had this to say about cats:\r\n<br>• Research suggests cats know what you’re saying but just don’t care. That’s cool.\r\n<br>• Knock stuff off your desk so you don’t have to.\r\n<br>• Pspspspspspspsps.\r\n<br>• Won’t do tricks. Not for anybody.\r\n<br>• Instinct for making biscuits.\r\n<br>• Hate lasers. Must destroy lasers.\r\n<br>• Self-cleaning like a dishwasher.\r\n<br>• Zoomies mean you don’t have to set your alarm for 3:00 AM.\r\n<br>Art by Joy Ang, Ashley Mackenzie, Andrea Sipl, Trashkittyart and Erica Williams\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Escape to the Wilds\r\n<br>• 1x Rip Apart\r\n<br>• 1x Titanic Ultimatum\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Basilisk Collar"}]},{"productId":624520,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Cats Are Better Than Dogs - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Cats Are Better Than Dogs Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624520_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624520/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-cats-are-better-than-dogs-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2