ion","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:23:21.41","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Embark on a guided tour of five deep-sea destinations from the underwater world of SpongeBob SquarePants. From Bikini Bottom to Jellyfish Fields and beyond, this set of barnacle-covered basic lands features art by Jon Vermilyea and showcases some of the liveliest locales and tidal territories that SpongeBob and friends call home.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Island\r\n<br>• 2x Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Forest"}]},{"productId":624706,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants: Lands Under the Sea - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Lands Under the Sea Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624706_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624706/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-lands-under-the-sea-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:23:15.227","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Embark on a guided tour of five deep-sea destinations from the underwater world of SpongeBob SquarePants. From Bikini Bottom to Jellyfish Fields and beyond, this set of barnacle-covered basic lands features art by Jon Vermilyea and showcases some of the liveliest locales and tidal territories that SpongeBob and friends call home.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Island\r\n<br>• 2x Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Forest"}]},{"productId":624707,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants: Legends of Bikini Bottom - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Legends of Bikini Bottom Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624707_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624707/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-legends-of-bikini-bottom-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:23:08.96","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>After appearing in over 300 episodes across 15 seasons (and on countless birthday cakes), SpongeBob has finally surfaced from Bikini Bottom and entered Secret Lair. In a drop featuring fantastic art by Caleb Meurer and Gregg Schigiel, SpongeBob’s most famous characters on some of Magic’s™ most powerful cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Skrelv, Defector Mite as “Plankton, Tiny Tyrant”\r\n<br>• 1x Charix, the Raging Isle as “Mr. Krabs, Penny Pincher”\r\n<br>• 1x Grazilaxx, Illithid Scholar as “Squidward, Sarcastic Snob”\r\n<br>• 1x Toxrill, the Corrosive as “Gary, the Snail”\r\n<br>• 1x Toski, Bearer of Secrets as “Sandy Cheeks, Martial Astronaut”\r\n<br>• 1x Barktooth Warbeard as “Patrick Star”\r\n<br>• 1x Jodah, the Unifier as “SpongeBob SquarePants”"}]},{"productId":624709,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants: Legends of Bikini Bottom - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Legends of Bikini Bottom Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624709_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624709/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-legends-of-bikini-bottom-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:23:03.597","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>After appearing in over 300 episodes across 15 seasons (and on countless birthday cakes), SpongeBob has finally surfaced from Bikini Bottom and entered Secret Lair. In a drop featuring fantastic art by Caleb Meurer and Gregg Schigiel, SpongeBob’s most famous characters on some of Magic’s™ most powerful cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Skrelv, Defector Mite as “Plankton, Tiny Tyrant”\r\n<br>• 1x Charix, the Raging Isle as “Mr. Krabs, Penny Pincher”\r\n<br>• 1x Grazilaxx, Illithid Scholar as “Squidward, Sarcastic Snob”\r\n<br>• 1x Toxrill, the Corrosive as “Gary, the Snail”\r\n<br>• 1x Toski, Bearer of Secrets as “Sandy Cheeks, Martial Astronaut”\r\n<br>• 1x Barktooth Warbeard as “Patrick Star”\r\n<br>• 1x Jodah, the Unifier as “SpongeBob SquarePants”"}]},{"productId":624710,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants: Internet Sensation - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Internet Sensation Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624710_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624710/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-internet-sensation-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:22:56.257","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>SpongeBob SquarePants’s impact on digital culture is indelible—perhaps more so than any other cartoon sponge in recent history. Along with his friends from Bikini Bottom, SpongeBob has inspired countless reaction GIFs, image macros, and viral posts. His optimism, joy, and childlike wonder have taken the internet by storm.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Counterspell\r\n<br>• 1x Daze\r\n<br>• 1x Inevitable Betrayal\r\n<br>• 1x Force of Despair\r\n<br>• 1x Night’s Whisper\r\n<br>• 1x Food Token"}]},{"productId":624711,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants: Internet Sensation - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Internet Sensation Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624711_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624711/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-internet-sensation-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:22:45.76","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>SpongeBob SquarePants’s impact on digital culture is indelible—perhaps more so than any other cartoon sponge in recent history. Along with his friends from Bikini Bottom, SpongeBob has inspired countless reaction GIFs, image macros, and viral posts. His optimism, joy, and childlike wonder have taken the internet by storm.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Counterspell\r\n<br>• 1x Daze\r\n<br>• 1x Inevitable Betrayal\r\n<br>• 1x Force of Despair\r\n<br>• 1x Night’s Whisper\r\n<br>• 1x Food Token"}]},{"productId":624714,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Twisted Toons - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Twisted Toons Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624714_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624714/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-twisted-toons-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:21:17.05","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair’s business department recently received an unpublished report detailing the impact of mid-20th century cartoon archetypes on broader trends in business and market integration. Particularly, this report theorized that adopting the madcap antics and absurd pratfalls of a cartoon protagonist can lead a business to higher market capitalization and outsized returns over time. We found the logic to be sound.\r\n<br>While this is normally the type of thing we’d run up the ladder to the boss, she’s gone. So we went ahead and made a drop of vintage cartoon art from Desmuncubic that’s subtly packed with allusions to comparative advantage theory, post-Keynesian economics, and other monetary models. Look closely and you might even see the Phillips curve!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Winds of Abandon\r\n<br>• 1x Culling the Weak\r\n<br>• 1x Fatal Push\r\n<br>• 1x Young Wolf"}]},{"productId":624715,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Twisted Toons - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Twisted Toons Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624715_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624715/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-twisted-toons-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:21:06.123","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair’s business department recently received an unpublished report detailing the impact of mid-20th century cartoon archetypes on broader trends in business and market integration. Particularly, this report theorized that adopting the madcap antics and absurd pratfalls of a cartoon protagonist can lead a business to higher market capitalization and outsized returns over time. We found the logic to be sound.\r\n<br>While this is normally the type of thing we’d run up the ladder to the boss, she’s gone. So we went ahead and made a drop of vintage cartoon art from Desmuncubic that’s subtly packed with allusions to comparative advantage theory, post-Keynesian economics, and other monetary models. Look closely and you might even see the Phillips curve!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Silence\r\n<br>• 1x Winds of Abandon\r\n<br>• 1x Culling the Weak\r\n<br>• 1x Fatal Push\r\n<br>• 1x Young Wolf"}]},{"productId":624716,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Tragic Romance - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Tragic Romance Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624716_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624716/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-tragic-romance-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:20:47.523","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Our art director has been reading a lot of romantasy lately—like “a new book every day” a lot. Then, he started reading it out loud. Then he started writing fanfic and reading that out loud too. Recently, he commissioned art from the incredibly talented Abigail Larson based on his fanfic and has been posting it around the office. To be clear, we’re all super into it. So we put it on cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Skithiryx, the Blight Dragon\r\n<br>• 1x Kaalia of the Vast\r\n<br>• 1x Angel of Despair\r\n<br>• 1x Master of Cruelties"}]},{"productId":624717,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Tragic Romance - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Tragic Romance Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624717_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624717/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-tragic-romance-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:20:27.963","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Our art director has been reading a lot of romantasy lately—like “a new book every day” a lot. Then, he started reading it out loud. Then he started writing fanfic and reading that out loud too. Recently, he commissioned art from the incredibly talented Abigail Larson based on his fanfic and has been posting it around the office. To be clear, we’re all super into it. So we put it on cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Skithiryx, the Blight Dragon\r\n<br>• 1x Kaalia of the Vast\r\n<br>• 1x Angel of Despair\r\n<br>• 1x Master of Cruelties"}]},{"productId":624721,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: They Grow Up So Fast - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop They Grow Up So Fast Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624721_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624721/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-they-grow-up-so-fast-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:20:18.087","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>At Secret Lair, we may disagree from time to time about our favorite cards, artists, or how to pronounce GIF, but we all agree on one thing—not enough Magic: The Gathering® art captures the captivating science of draconic lifecycle biology. We want to do more than entertain here at Secret Lair. We aim to educate too.\r\n<br>Therefore, this drop presents a visual analysis of five dragons as they mature from adorable wyrmling to scourge of the skies. By simply flipping each card over, you’ll witness a dragon’s physiological development as it ages, including the hypertrophy of wing musculature, fire gland maturation, and scale ossification. Fascinating stuff.\r\n<br>Art by Allen Douglas, Alison Johnstun, Antonio José Manzanedo, Brooklyn Smith, and Crystal Sully\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Atarka\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Dromoka\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Kolaghan\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Ojutai\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Silumgar"}]},{"productId":624722,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: They Grow Up So Fast - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop They Grow Up So Fast Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624722_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624722/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-they-grow-up-so-fast-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:20:02.67","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>At Secret Lair, we may disagree from time to time about our favorite cards, artists, or how to pronounce GIF, but we all agree on one thing—not enough Magic: The Gathering® art captures the captivating science of draconic lifecycle biology. We want to do more than entertain here at Secret Lair. We aim to educate too.\r\n<br>Therefore, this drop presents a visual analysis of five dragons as they mature from adorable wyrmling to scourge of the skies. By simply flipping each card over, you’ll witness a dragon’s physiological development as it ages, including the hypertrophy of wing musculature, fire gland maturation, and scale ossification. Fascinating stuff.\r\n<br>Art by Allen Douglas, Alison Johnstun, Antonio José Manzanedo, Brooklyn Smith, and Crystal Sully\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Atarka\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Dromoka\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Kolaghan\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Ojutai\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Dragonlord Silumgar"}]},{"productId":624739,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Secret Lair High Class of '87 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Secret Lair High Class of 87 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624739_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624739/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-secret-lair-high-class-of-87-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:19:57.08","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Somebody on the Secret Lair team, and I’m not naming names, really thrived in high school. We’re talking all-state homecoming royalty with valedictorian energy—a real yearbook superstar. And, well, they kinda . . . miss it and bring it up all the time. So this drop of legends, reimagined in their high-school glory days by Stephen Andrade & Scott Okumura, is a little bit of wish fulfillment. But then again, so is every drop. Have a Great Summer!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Aesi, Tyrant of Gyre Strait\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Anje Falkenrath\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Chulane, Teller of Tales\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Radha, Heart of Keld"}]},{"productId":624740,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Secret Lair High Class of '87 - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Secret Lair High Class of 87 Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624740_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624740/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-secret-lair-high-class-of-87-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-26T12:23:29.803","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Somebody on the Secret Lair team, and I’m not naming names, really thrived in high school. We’re talking all-state homecoming royalty with valedictorian energy—a real yearbook superstar. And, well, they kinda . . . miss it and bring it up all the time. So this drop of legends, reimagined in their high-school glory days by Stephen Andrade & Scott Okumura, is a little bit of wish fulfillment. But then again, so is every drop. Have a Great Summer!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Aesi, Tyrant of Gyre Strait\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Anje Falkenrath\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Chulane, Teller of Tales\r\n<br>• 1x Reversible Radha, Heart of Keld"}]},{"productId":624742,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Garden Buds - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Garden Buds Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624742_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624742/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-garden-buds-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:19:26.48","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Have you ever misplaced something important? Something really important? We have. For example, our product architect designed an entire Ashaya, Soul of the Wild Commander deck, with amazing art from Jordan Crane, for our plant-loving project manager’s birthday. Then someone accidentally deleted the deck list and misplaced 95 of the cards. They were the only copies. But the boss is gone so we made an executive decision, let’s just print the cards we have and let people grow their own Ashaya deck from these five seeds. Happy gardening!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ashaya, Soul of the Wild\r\n<br>• 1x Elvish Reclaimer\r\n<br>• 1x Harrow\r\n<br>• 1x World Shaper\r\n<br>• 1x Horn of Greed"}]},{"productId":624743,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Garden Buds - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Garden Buds Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624743_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624743/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-garden-buds-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:19:15.457","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Have you ever misplaced something important? Something really important? We have. For example, our product architect designed an entire Ashaya, Soul of the Wild Commander deck, with amazing art from Jordan Crane, for our plant-loving project manager’s birthday. Then someone accidentally deleted the deck list and misplaced 95 of the cards. They were the only copies. But the boss is gone so we made an executive decision, let’s just print the cards we have and let people grow their own Ashaya deck from these five seeds. Happy gardening!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ashaya, Soul of the Wild\r\n<br>• 1x Elvish Reclaimer\r\n<br>• 1x Harrow\r\n<br>• 1x World Shaper\r\n<br>• 1x Horn of Greed"}]},{"productId":624745,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Pick 'Em and Stick 'Em - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Pick Em and Stick Em Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624745_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624745/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-pick-em-and-stick-em-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:19:02.79","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There was a . . . disagreement—a big one—about what art Rian Gonzales should put on this prismatic drop of candy-colored cards. Some people wanted more pirate gear, others wanted more summer fun, a few just wanted to get weird with it. Fingers were pointed. Words were exchanged. Shade was thrown. And the decision was made to put everything on ice for the good of the Lair. But when the boss left, we decided to just combine all our awesome ideas onto five sticker sheets to let fans decide! You can peel, pull, and sprinkle your favorite bubbly sticker art however you want across all five fantastic cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Thalia, Heretic Cathar\r\n<br>• 1x Clever Impersonator\r\n<br>• 1x Hedron Crab\r\n<br>• 1x Pitiless Plunderer\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure Token\r\n<br>• 5x Sticker Sheets"}]},{"productId":624746,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Pick 'Em and Stick 'Em - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Pick Em and Stick Em Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624746_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624746/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-pick-em-and-stick-em-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:18:57.107","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There was a . . . disagreement—a big one—about what art Rian Gonzales should put on this prismatic drop of candy-colored cards. Some people wanted more pirate gear, others wanted more summer fun, a few just wanted to get weird with it. Fingers were pointed. Words were exchanged. Shade was thrown. And the decision was made to put everything on ice for the good of the Lair. But when the boss left, we decided to just combine all our awesome ideas onto five sticker sheets to let fans decide! You can peel, pull, and sprinkle your favorite bubbly sticker art however you want across all five fantastic cards.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Thalia, Heretic Cathar\r\n<br>• 1x Clever Impersonator\r\n<br>• 1x Hedron Crab\r\n<br>• 1x Pitiless Plunderer\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure Token\r\n<br>• 5x Sticker Sheets"}]},{"productId":624749,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants Bundle - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Bundle Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624749_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624749/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-bundle-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:00.88","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dive into Bikini Bottom and dredge the depths to discover a bundle featuring characters, locations, scenes, and memes from SpongeBob SquarePants. You can drop these quirky cards into your favorite deck, or better yet, jam them all into a new Commander deck helmed by the five-color SpongeBob SquarePants. I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom  \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation"}]},{"productId":624750,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Spongebob Squarepants Bundle - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Spongebob Squarepants Bundle Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624750_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624750/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-spongebob-squarepants-bundle-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:16.97","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Dive into Bikini Bottom and dredge the depths to discover a bundle featuring characters, locations, scenes, and memes from SpongeBob SquarePants. You can drop these quirky cards into your favorite deck, or better yet, jam them all into a new Commander deck helmed by the five-color SpongeBob SquarePants. I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready! I’m ready!\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom  \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation"}]},{"productId":624751,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Desk Fort Made of Non-Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Desk Fort Made of Non Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624751_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624751/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-desk-fort-made-of-non-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:22.99","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>With the boss away, there was no one left to protect us from all sorts of inter-office dangers—desk hoverers, scope creepers, and most dangerous of all, encroaching deadlines. So we gathered all the non-foils together as raw materials to fortify our workspaces. How many top-tier non-foil cards with incredible new art are in this bundle? Easy. All of them. Which is coincidentally, also a desk fort’s worth.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea  \r\n<br>• 1x They Grow Up So Fast\r\n<br>• 1x Garden Buds\r\n<br>• 1x Tragic Romance\r\n<br>• 1x Twisted Toons\r\n<br>• 1x Pick ’Em and Stick ’Em\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair High: Class of ’87"}]},{"productId":624753,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Break Room Disco Ball Made of Foils Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Break Room Disco Ball Made of Foils Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624753_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624753/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-break-room-disco-ball-made-of-foils-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:29.89","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>With all our weekly check-ins canceled, we finally have a little time to give the break room that makeover we’ve been talking about for years. Not too much. Rearrange the furniture. Slap a fresh coat of gooseberry red on the accent wall. And, you know what? Let’s bundle all the shimmering foils together to hang from the ceiling like a disco ball—just a little razzle dazzle. Oh yeah, that new art looks great up there. That’s a bundle with style.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x They Grow Up So Fast Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Garden Buds Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Tragic Romance Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Twisted Toons Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Pick ’Em and Stick ’Em Foil Edition  \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair High: Class of ’87 Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":624758,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Interim Boss's Bant Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Interim Bosss Bant Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624758_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624758/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-interim-bosss-bant-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:47.28","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Before this sale, somebody on the team asked “Hey, what if we combine some of the new cards with some of the Chaos Vault cards? Can we do that? Is that even allowed?” We all stopped in our tracks and said, “The boss is gone. You’re in charge now.” Then we couldn’t remember who actually had the idea first, so after some discussion, we all agreed to share acting manager duties. But after a few days, we realized we don’t like being boss. So we’re all going back to our old jobs. Nevertheless, this collection of green, white, and blue cards is a perfect starting bundle for building your next Bant commander deck. It’s maybe the best thing we ever did as interim boss.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Garden Buds Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Fairest Drop of All Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Tome of the Astral Sorceress\r\n<br>• 1x Strange Sands – Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Strange Sands – Forest"}]},{"productId":624759,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Cover the Boss's Office with Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Cover the Bosss Office with Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624759_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624759/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-cover-the-bosss-office-with-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:24:53.007","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Let’s prepare a little surprise for when the boss gets back. A harmless prank. A playful goof. A welcome home present. Let’s cover her office with all the awesome foils and non-foils in this bundle! Her desk, her computer, her gold-framed print of Magritte’s The Treachery of Images. Everything. When she gets back, she’ll be so confused! It’ll be hilarious! She’ll probably say something legendary, like “Uh, what? I didn’t leave cards all over my office and gold-framed print of Magritte’s The Treachery of Images. That’s weird.” Classic.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Break Room Disco Ball Made of Foils Bundle\r\n<br>• 1x Desk Fort Made of Non-Foils Bundle"}]},{"productId":624906,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop: Biggest. Bundle. Ever. Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Our Boss is on Vacation Superdrop Biggest Bundle Ever Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/624906_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/624906/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-our-boss-is-on-vacation-superdrop-biggest-bundle-ever-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-08-21T12:25:07.063","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>YOU WANTED A BIGGER BUNDLE? WELL NOW YOU’VE GOT THE BIGGEST BUNDLE EVER. THIS BUNDLE HAS FOUR COPIES OF EVERY DROP IN FOIL AND IN NON-FOIL. THE BOSS DIDN’T WANT THIS BUNDLE. BUT WE NEEDED THIS BUNDLE. AND THE BOSS IS GONE. SO BIG BUNDLE IS HERE. BUNDLE.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x They Grow Up So Fast Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Garden Buds Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Tragic Romance Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Twisted Toons Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Pick ’Em and Stick ’Em Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair High: Class of ’87 Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Legends of Bikini Bottom\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Internet Sensation\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair x SpongeBob SquarePants: Lands Under the Sea\r\n<br>• 4x They Grow Up So Fast\r\n<br>• 4x Garden Buds\r\n<br>• 4x Tragic Romance\r\n<br>• 4x Twisted Toons\r\n<br>• 4x Pick ’Em and Stick ’Em\r\n<br>• 4x Secret Lair High: Class of ’87"}]},{"productId":625876,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/625876_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/625876/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-15T17:35:29.39","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Well look who it is! Come in, come in. Don’t mind the robe. “Uncle Deadpool” is just crashing at Secret Lair for a few days. I’m actually doing a little tour of lairs, hideouts, sanctums, and strongholds and leaving ratings online. It’s been a blast.\r\n<br>But I wasn’t expecting guests. Just, uh, kick back, relax, and . . . don’t sit on my red suit! It’s drying out. But check this out—Secret Lair made me my own Deadpool cards! Isn’t that nice? So pretty. This one even says, “trading card,” so you don’t forget. Anyway, make yourself comfortable and if you need anything, I’ll be in the kitchen making chimichangas.\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Deadpool, Trading Card\r\n<br>• 1x Deadly Rollick\r\n<br>• 1x Saw in Half\r\n<br>• 1x Blasphemous Act\r\n<br>• 1x Vandalblast"}]},{"productId":625877,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/625877_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/625877/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-15T17:35:45.58","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Well look who it is! Come in, come in. Don’t mind the robe. “Uncle Deadpool” is just crashing at Secret Lair for a few days. I’m actually doing a little tour of lairs, hideouts, sanctums, and strongholds and leaving ratings online. It’s been a blast.\r\n<br>But I wasn’t expecting guests. Just, uh, kick back, relax, and . . . don’t sit on my red suit! It’s drying out. But check this out—Secret Lair made me my own Deadpool cards! Isn’t that nice? So pretty. This one even says, “trading card,” so you don’t forget. Anyway, make yourself comfortable and if you need anything, I’ll be in the kitchen making chimichangas.\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Deadpool, Trading Card\r\n<br>• 1x Deadly Rollick\r\n<br>• 1x Saw in Half\r\n<br>• 1x Blasphemous Act\r\n<br>• 1x Vandalblast"}]},{"productId":626611,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Oishii! Tokens - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Oishii Tokens Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/626611_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/626611/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-oishii-tokens-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-04-24T19:23:07.903","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We care about our tokens here at Secret Lair. Sure, sometimes we use whatever random tokens are nearby on the table, and in a pinch, yes, we’ll throw a rubber band or a nickel out there. But given the choice, we’re bringing something really sick to the table and turning heads. Look sharp, play sharp.\r\n<br>Inspired by the unthinkably cool food packaging we saw on our last trip to Japan, we created these wild Food tokens. What do you think?\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 4x Food Tokens"}]},{"productId":626612,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Oishii! Tokens - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Oishii Tokens Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/626612_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/626612/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-oishii-tokens-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-04-24T19:22:57.04","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>We care about our tokens here at Secret Lair. Sure, sometimes we use whatever random tokens are nearby on the table, and in a pinch, yes, we’ll throw a rubber band or a nickel out there. But given the choice, we’re bringing something really sick to the table and turning heads. Look sharp, play sharp.\r\n<br>Inspired by the unthinkably cool food packaging we saw on our last trip to Japan, we created these wild Food tokens. What do you think?\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 4x Food Tokens"}]},{"productId":627697,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair Promo: Deadeye Navigator - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair Promo Deadeye Navigator Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/627697_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/627697/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-promo-deadeye-navigator-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-02-18T12:40:51.32","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This sealed product contains 1 Rainbow Foil Deadeye Navigator."}]},{"productId":629761,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Adventures of the Little Witch - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Adventures of the Little Witch Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/629761_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/629761/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-adventures-of-the-little-witch-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-02T04:10:17.013","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-02T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>These reprints were individually selected to go with the art style and tone of Heikala's amazing work, and we think they turned out great. But then later, for fun, we challenged our designer to brew up the least-terrible possible Legacy deck he could using all four of them. Someone please go take down a tournament with this thing, can you imagine how hilarious that would be?\r\n<br>Art by Heikala\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Rendezvous\r\n<br>• 1x Serenity\r\n<br>• 1x Esika’s Chariot\r\n<br>• 1x Realms Uncharted"}]},{"productId":629762,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Adventures of the Little Witch - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Adventures of the Little Witch Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/629762_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/629762/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-adventures-of-the-little-witch-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-02T04:10:17.013","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-02T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>These reprints were individually selected to go with the art style and tone of Heikala's amazing work, and we think they turned out great. But then later, for fun, we challenged our designer to brew up the least-terrible possible Legacy deck he could using all four of them. Someone please go take down a tournament with this thing, can you imagine how hilarious that would be?\r\n<br>Art by Heikala\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Rendezvous\r\n<br>• 1x Serenity\r\n<br>• 1x Esika’s Chariot\r\n<br>• 1x Realms Uncharted"}]},{"productId":631564,"name":"Secret Lair Commander Deck: Everyone's Invited! - Double Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Commander Deck Everyones Invited Double Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/631564_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/631564/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-commander-deck-everyones-invited-double-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-06T15:15:01.81","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"The woods are aglow with a neon aurora and filled with new friends because there’s a prismatic party happening tonight and everyone’s invited.\r\n<br>Built around a core crew of powerful Shapeshifters and featuring a guest list of Dryads, Elementals, Faeries, Slivers, Cats and more, this deck is a celebration for every creature type (as long as they love to party). Ten cards and four tokens showcase luminous new art of unexpected friends enjoying a bass-thumping celebration in an enchanted forest until the sun comes up. Plus, powerful effects from cards like Arcane Adaptation, Maskwood Nexus, and Mirror Entity make sure everyone gets along.\r\n<br>Overwhelm your opponents with a swarm of Shapeshifters, or just invite them in to enjoy the good times—it’s your party.\r\n<br>New art by Natalie Andrewson, Ejiwa “Edge” Ebenebe, Caroline Gariba, Rian Gonzales, Nathan Jurevicius, Wojtek Lebski, Alex Negrea, Aeron Ng, Princess Hidir, Jordan Speer, and Meel Tamphanon.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>1x Foil Morophon, the Boundless\r\n<br>1x Foil Raise the Palisade\r\n<br>1x Foil Bitterblossom\r\n<br>1x Foil Taurean Mauler\r\n<br>1x Foil Avenger of Zendikar\r\n<br>1x Foil Kindred Summons\r\n<br>1x Foil Tendershoot Dryad\r\n<br>1x Foil Coat of Arms\r\n<br>1x Foil Maskwood Nexus\r\n<br>1x Foil Sol Ring\r\n<br>4x Foil Shapeshifter tokens\r\n<br>1x Foil Morophon, the Boundless Display Card\r\n<br>90x Reprints"}]},{"productId":632009,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: KEXP: You Are Not Alone - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop KEXP You Are Not Alone Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632009_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632009/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kexp-you-are-not-alone-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Tune in to legendary independent radio station KEXP and in between songs you’ll often hear a phrase repeated by DJs: “You are not alone.” It’s a simple phrase, but in those moments when you’re feeling down it makes the world feel a little bit brighter and a little less lonely. Every time.\r\n<br>\r\nInspired by KEXP’s commitment to bringing people together through all kinds of music, the visuals on these cards honor a diverse range of gig poster art styles. For the card choices, we picked five “group-hug” cards that will get everyone at the table smiling together.\r\n <br>\r\nMusic brings us together. Magic brings us together. You are not alone.\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Bráulio Amado, Jesse LeDoux, Max Loeffler, Bene Rohlmann, and Jay Ryan\r\n<br>Friends of KEXP®\r\n<br>Where the Music Matters® \r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Cultural Exchange\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Folio of Fancies\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Concordant Crossroads\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rites of Flourishing\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Font of Mythos"}]},{"productId":632010,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: KEXP: You Are Not Alone - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop KEXP You Are Not Alone Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632010_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632010/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kexp-you-are-not-alone-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Tune in to legendary independent radio station KEXP and in between songs you’ll often hear a phrase repeated by DJs: “You are not alone.” It’s a simple phrase, but in those moments when you’re feeling down it makes the world feel a little bit brighter and a little less lonely. Every time.\r\n<br>\r\nInspired by KEXP’s commitment to bringing people together through all kinds of music, the visuals on these cards honor a diverse range of gig poster art styles. For the card choices, we picked five “group-hug” cards that will get everyone at the table smiling together.\r\n <br>\r\nMusic brings us together. Magic brings us together. You are not alone.\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Bráulio Amado, Jesse LeDoux, Max Loeffler, Bene Rohlmann, and Jay Ryan\r\n<br>Friends of KEXP®\r\n<br>Where the Music Matters® \r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Cultural Exchange\r\n<br>• 1x Folio of Fancies\r\n<br>• 1x Concordant Crossroads\r\n<br>• 1x Rites of Flourishing\r\n<br>• 1x Font of Mythos"}]},{"productId":632011,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: KEXP: Where the Music Matters - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop KEXP Where the Music Matters Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632011_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632011/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kexp-where-the-music-matters-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>From the sketchy basement where you caught your first punk show to the legendary “Gathering Space” at independent radio station KEXP’s headquarters, Music and Place have a special relationship. Quick experiment: Put on a song you used to love and close your eyes—where are you transported? Stand quietly on an empty stage—what do you hear?\r\n <br>\r\nThese lands celebrate the places where music lives, and where music matters. KEXP originates from a very specific place in the shadow of the Space Needle (you can actually just show up and drink coffee while you watch the DJs spin, it’s great), but it extends across the universe, spreading music and love in places you might never expect.\r\n<br>Art by Dan Black and Jessica Seamans\r\n<br>Friends of KEXP®\r\n<br>Where the Music Matters®\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":632012,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: KEXP: Where the Music Matters - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop KEXP Where the Music Matters Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632012_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632012/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-kexp-where-the-music-matters-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>From the sketchy basement where you caught your first punk show to the legendary “Gathering Space” at independent radio station KEXP’s headquarters, Music and Place have a special relationship. Quick experiment: Put on a song you used to love and close your eyes—where are you transported? Stand quietly on an empty stage—what do you hear?\r\n <br>\r\nThese lands celebrate the places where music lives, and where music matters. KEXP originates from a very specific place in the shadow of the Space Needle (you can actually just show up and drink coffee while you watch the DJs spin, it’s great), but it extends across the universe, spreading music and love in places you might never expect.\r\n<br>Art by Dan Black and Jessica Seamans\r\n<br>Friends of KEXP®\r\n<br>Where the Music Matters®\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Island\r\n<br>• 2x Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Forest"}]},{"productId":632013,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Jay Howell - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Jay Howell Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632013_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632013/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-jay-howell-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Los Angeles-based illustrator Jay Howell is the best. He’s built a fandom across animation, illustration, and—fortunately for us—within the Secret Lair team. We were absolutely thrilled to get to work with him on these cards.\r\n<br>\r\nThere’s the start of a nice Marchesa Commander deck in here, but it’s up to you to decide how you want to play these. More importantly, we’re happy to have you in the game, Jay.\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Jay Howell\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Agent of Treachery\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Priest of Forgotten Gods\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Treasonous Ogre\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Uncivil Unrest\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Marchesa, the Black Rose"}]},{"productId":632014,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Jay Howell - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Jay Howell Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632014_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632014/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-jay-howell-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Los Angeles-based illustrator Jay Howell is the best. He’s built a fandom across animation, illustration, and—fortunately for us—within the Secret Lair team. We were absolutely thrilled to get to work with him on these cards.\r\n<br>\r\nThere’s the start of a nice Marchesa Commander deck in here, but it’s up to you to decide how you want to play these. More importantly, we’re happy to have you in the game, Jay.\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Jay Howell\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Agent of Treachery\r\n<br>• 1x Priest of Forgotten Gods\r\n<br>• 1x Treasonous Ogre\r\n<br>• 1x Uncivil Unrest\r\n<br>• 1x Marchesa, the Black Rose"}]},{"productId":632015,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: vroooOOOMMMMMM! - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop vroooOOOMMMMMM Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632015_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632015/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-vroooooommmmmm-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Toru Terada has been on our radar for a while. While he’s less known stateside, he’s built a reputation in the Japanese illustration world and we’re fans. When it came time to do a drop based on depicting aggressive speed, his name was the first to come to mind, and he really stepped up to the challenge. In conclusion… Good grief, look at that Lava Dart! I mean come on—are you kidding me?\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Toru Terada\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lava Dart\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Monastery Swiftspear\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Soul-Scar Mage\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Underworld Breach\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mishra’s Bauble"}]},{"productId":632016,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: vroooOOOMMMMMM! - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop vroooOOOMMMMMM Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632016_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632016/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-vroooooommmmmm-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Toru Terada has been on our radar for a while. While he’s less known stateside, he’s built a reputation in the Japanese illustration world and we’re fans. When it came time to do a drop based on depicting aggressive speed, his name was the first to come to mind, and he really stepped up to the challenge. In conclusion… Good grief, look at that Lava Dart! I mean come on—are you kidding me?\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Toru Terada\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Lava Dart\r\n<br>• 1x Monastery Swiftspear\r\n<br>• 1x Soul-Scar Mage\r\n<br>• 1x Underworld Breach\r\n<br>• 1x Mishra’s Bauble"}]},{"productId":632017,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: vroooOOOMMMMMM! - Raised Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop vroooOOOMMMMMM Raised Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632017_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/632017/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-vroooooommmmmm-raised-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-05-23T04:10:18.203","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2025-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Toru Terada has been on our radar for a while. While he’s less known stateside, he’s built a reputation in the Japanese illustration world and we’re fans. When it came time to do a drop based on depicting aggressive speed, his name was the first to come to mind, and he really stepped up to the challenge. In conclusion… Good grief, look at that Lava Dart! I mean come on—are you kidding me?\r\n<br>\r\nArt by Toru Terada\r\n<br><br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Raised Foil Lava Dart\r\n<br>• 1x Raised Foil Monastery Swiftspear\r\n<br>• 1x Raised Foil Soul-Scar Mage\r\n<br>• 1x Raised Foil Underworld Breach\r\n<br>• 1x Raised Foil Mishra’s Bauble"}]},{"productId":632018,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: EVERYTHING IS ON FIRE - Raised Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop EVERYTHING IS ON FIRE Raised Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/632018_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576