https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/633045_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/633045/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-las-vegas-2025-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-09-25T12:27:34.957","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Viva MagicCon: Las Vegas! What happens there might stay there, but you can get a full experience from the comfort of your own home with this year’s Festival in a Box: Las Vegas.\r\n<br>Inside each Mystery Booster 2 display box you’ll find 24 booster packs featuring cards with nearly 200 set symbols. Each 15-card pack includes one white-border card, one playtest card, and one Future Sight frame card which might even be one of 15 exclusively foil cards. Drafting will feel like you’re cracking packs from Magic’s past, Magic’s present, and Magic’s future.\r\n<br>You’ll also get the Slay the Day Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop, an exclusive part of Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2025. These fan-favorite Commanders will be the best dressed at the table, thanks to the inspiring work and fashion instincts of artist Craig Drake.\r\n<br>Plus, the age-old question of who would win in a championship bout, a Sliver Hive or Ugin the massive spirit dragon Planeswalker, can finally be answered in gorgeous retro-frame foil. After the fight, everyone can head to the All You Can Eat Buffet playtest card for a celebratory meal.\r\n<br>All cards are English only.\r\n<br>Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2025 is limited to 3 per customer.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>•1x Mystery Booster 2 Display (24 Booster packs in 1 Box)\r\n<br>•1x Foil Marwyn, the Nurturer\r\n<br>•1x Foil Liesa, Shroud of Dusk\r\n<br>•1x Foil Oloro, Ageless Ascetic\r\n<br>•1x Foil Sythis, Harvest's Hand\r\n<br>•1x Foil Sliver Hive\r\n<br>•1x Foil Ugin, the Spirit Dragon\r\n<br>•1x All-You-Can-Eat-Buffet playtest card"}]},{"productId":636315,"name":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop: Nuestra Magia (Non-Foil)","cleanName":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop Nuestra Magia Non Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/636315_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/636315/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-nalac-drop-nuestra-magia-non-foil","modifiedOn":"2025-10-23T14:42:07.68","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Magic: The Gathering and Wizards of the Coast is excited to announce our partnership with the National Association of Latino Arts and Cultures (NALAC). For this partnership, we're releasing a brand-new Secret Lair drop in support of NALAC: Nuestra Magia. We worked with multiple Latinx artists to create illustrations and select cards that were inspired by the many cultures of Latin America.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents</strong>:\r\n<br>• 1x Tireless Provisioner as \"La abuela, siempre generosa\"\r\n<br>• 1x Sylvan Library as \"La abundancia de Yúcahu\"\r\n<br>• 1x Ancient Greenwarden as \"Pastor da Selva\"\r\n<br>• 1x Expressive Iteration as \"La danza del pueblo\"\r\n<br>• 1x Xenagos, God of Revels as \"La Madre Tierra\"\r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Greaves as \"Chancla Relámpagos\"\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Food token\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure token"}]},{"productId":636316,"name":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop: Nuestra Magia (Rainbow Foil)","cleanName":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop Nuestra Magia Rainbow Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/636316_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/636316/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-nalac-drop-nuestra-magia-rainbow-foil","modifiedOn":"2025-10-23T14:42:17.59","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releas