29.527","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"When we had the chance to work with Imiri Sakabashira, there was only one thing to do: give him license to make the WEIRDEST. CREATURES. POSSIBLE. And wow, did he deliver. These cards look like they crawled out of a dream halfway through a kaiju fight—surreal and bursting with that signature Sakabashira energy. We would watch every single one of these if they were movies.\r\n<br><strong>Contents</strong>:\r\n<br>• 1x foil Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>• 1x foil Resculpt\r\n<br>• 1x foil Mirage Mirror\r\n<br>• 1x foil Scion of Draco"}]},{"productId":637673,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop 2025 - Featuring: Imiri Sakabashira (Non-Foil Edition)","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Summer Superdrop 2025 Featuring Imiri Sakabashira Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/637673_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/637673/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-summer-superdrop-2025-featuring-imiri-sakabashira-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-09-17T14:35:23.43","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"When we had the chance to work with Imiri Sakabashira, there was only one thing to do: give him license to make the WEIRDEST. CREATURES. POSSIBLE. And wow, did he deliver. These cards look like they crawled out of a dream halfway through a kaiju fight—surreal and bursting with that signature Sakabashira energy. We would watch every single one of these if they were movies.\r\n<br><strong>Contents</strong>:\r\n<br>• 1x Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>• 1x Resculpt\r\n<br>• 1x Mirage Mirror\r\n<br>• 1x Scion of Draco"}]},{"productId":637674,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Summer Superdrop 2025 - Artist Series: Phil Fog