rds of the Coast is excited to announce our partnership with the National Association of Latino Arts and Cultures (NALAC). For this partnership, we're releasing a brand-new Secret Lair drop in support of NALAC: Nuestra Magia. We worked with multiple Latinx artists to create illustrations and select cards that were inspired by the many cultures of Latin America.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents</strong>:\r\n<br>• 1x Tireless Provisioner as \"La abuela, siempre generosa\"\r\n<br>• 1x Sylvan Library as \"La abundancia de Yúcahu\"\r\n<br>• 1x Ancient Greenwarden as \"Pastor da Selva\"\r\n<br>• 1x Expressive Iteration as \"La danza del pueblo\"\r\n<br>• 1x Xenagos, God of Revels as \"La Madre Tierra\"\r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Greaves as \"Chancla Relámpagos\"\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Food token\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure token"}]},{"productId":638089,"name":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop: Nuestra Magia (SP Rainbow Foil)","cleanName":"Secret Lair x NALAC Drop Nuestra Magia SP Rainbow Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/638089_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/638089/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-nalac-drop-nuestra-magia-sp-rainbow-foil","modifiedOn":"2025-10-23T14:42:43.517","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Magic: The Gathering and Wizards of the Coast is excited to announce our partnership with the National Association of Latino Arts and Cultures (NALAC). For this partnership, we're releasing a brand-new Secret Lair drop in support of NALAC: Nuestra Magia. We worked with multiple Latinx artists to create illustrations and select cards that were inspired by the many cultures of Latin America.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents</strong>:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tireless Provisioner as \"La abuela, siempre generosa\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sylvan Library as \"La abundancia de Yúcahu\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ancient Greenwarden as \"Pastor da Selva\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Expressive Iteration as \"La danza del pueblo\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Xenagos, God of Revels as \"La Madre Tierra\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Greaves as \"Chancla Relámpagos\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Food token\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Treasure token"}]},{"productId":638883,"name":"Secret Lair x FINAL FANTASY: Gilded Lotus - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x FINAL FANTASY Gilded Lotus Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/638883_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/638883/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-final-fantasy-gilded-lotus-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-06-23T17:46:24.933","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gilded Lotus"}]},{"productId":640242,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2025 - Slay the Day (Rainbow Foil)","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2025 Slay the Day Rainbow Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/640242_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/640242/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-las-vegas-2025-slay-the-day-rainbow-foil","modifiedOn":"2025-09-25T12:28:23.813","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Slay the Day Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop is  an exclusive part of Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2025. These fan-favorite Commanders will be the best dressed at the table, thanks to the inspiring work and fashion instincts of artist Craig Drake.\r\n<br>All cards are Englis