n the potential of your Counter Intelligence Commander deck from Edge of Eternities with the sleek, cybernetic enhancements of Secret Lair Featuring: Deathburger.\r\n<br>Featuring: Deathburger comes chock full of discounts for casting artifacts, toolbox utility, recursion, and even includes the biggest robot of all: Arcbound Ravager. Strengthen your robot army, grow them to unreasonable sizes, and turn them sideways to initiate the final phase of the robot uprising. Victory is not optional—it’s programmed.\r\n<br>Beyond mechanical upgrades, Featuring: Deathburger also brings artistic enhancements with detailed, striking robots designed by the titular artist, allowing you to even better express the deck’s themes of technology, robots, and unleashing your inner artificer.\r\n<br>With this bundle, you’re not just playing Counter Intelligence—you’re building a better ’bot.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>1x Counter Intelligence Commander Deck\r\n<br>1x Featuring: Deathburger Galaxy Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n<br><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: This Secret Lair Chaos Vault bundle contains a bonus Commander Deck from Edge of Eternities. This version of the bundle is exclusive to U.S. recipients.</span>"}]},{"productId":646787,"name":"Secret Lair x Chaos Vault Drop: Commander Reinforcements World Shaper Bundle (Galaxy Foil)","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Chaos Vault Drop Commander Reinforcements World Shaper Bundle Galaxy Foil","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/646787_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/646787/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-chaos-vault-drop-commander-reinforcements-world-shaper-bundle-galaxy-foil","modifiedOn":"2025-12-18T14:18:11.707","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This convenient bundle combines both the engine and the artistic expression into one package for the discerning galactic surveyor.\r\n<br>The Commander Reinforcements World Shaper Bundle pairs the World Shaper Commander Deck from Edge of Eternities and a Secret Lair drop designed to enhance that lands-matter strategy.\r\n<br>The Alien Auroras Secret Lair drop complements the World Shaper strategy with five thematically and mechanically relevant cards. Each card in the drop contributes to the deck’s gameplan, adding land recursion and land sacrifice outlets with benefits. These cards can be swapped into the World Shaper deck to customize, diversify, and chart your path to victory.\r\n<br>The drop also brings a new spin on what the Edge of Eternities can look like, as Alien Auroras features surreal, alien landscape artwork by Ian Permana, offering a visual identity that matches the deck’s themes of reclamation, renewal, and ecosystem cycles. The art creates a unified aesthetic that makes the accompanying deck feel even more customized to your strategic and stylistic tastes.\r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>1x World Shaper Commander Deck\r\n<br>1x Alien Auroras Galaxy Foil Edition\r\n<br>\r\n<br><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: This Secret Lair Chaos Vault bundle contains a bonus Commander Deck from Edge of Eternities. This version of the bundle is exclusive to U.S. recipients.</span>"}]},{"productId":646788,"name":"Secret Lair x Chaos Vault Drop: Commander Reinforcements World Shaper Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Chaos Vault Drop Commander Reinforcements World Shaper Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/646788_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/646788/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-chaos-vault-drop-commander-reinforcements-world-shaper-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-12-18T14:14:19.523","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText"