ir x Chaos Vault Drop Alien Auroras","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/646803_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/646803/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-chaos-vault-drop-alien-auroras","modifiedOn":"2025-12-18T14:25:58.393","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Step softly. Breathe deep. You are not on Dominaria anymore.\r\n<br>Alien Auroras transports you to a world unspoiled by human thought, where the foliage glows with inner fire. This drop is your field journal—each card a page that brings the bioluminescent wilds and spectral terrain of a planet untamed to your hands. Artist Ian Permana presents a world blooming with serene volatility.\r\n<br>Alien Auroras invites you to wander—no, to study—this environment at the Edge of Eternities. Whether that’s in the standard, non-foil edition, or the planetary captivation of galaxy foil.\r\n<br>In this drop, you do not rule the land. You honor it.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>1x Reprocess\r\n<br>1x Aggressive Mining\r\n<br>1x Sylvan Safekeeper\r\n<br>1x Crucible of Worlds\r\n<br>1x Zuran Orb"}]},{"productId":648635,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Festival in a Box Atlanta 2025 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Festival in a Box Atlanta 2025 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/648635_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/648635/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-atlanta-2025-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-12-04T15:39:17.453","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>MagicCon is heading to Atlanta—but if you can’t make the trip, Festival in a Box: Atlanta 2025 brings the experience to you.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Each box includes a Mystery Booster 2 display with 24 booster packs featuring cards with nearly 200 set symbols from across <em>Magic’s</em> history. Every 15-card pack includes a white-border card, a playtest card, and a Future Sight frame card—possibly one of 15 exclusive foils. Opening these packs feels like flipping through a scrapbook of <em>Magic’s</em> past, with a few pages from the future thrown in.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Also inside: the MagicCon: The Gathering Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop, available only through Festival in a Box: Atlanta 2025. This drop features stunning new art from Leonardo Santanna, Jodie Muir, and Igor Krstic, bringing familiar faces from across the Multiverse to the convention floor.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>The Future Sight frame makes its debut appearance on Lightning Bolt and The Ur-Dragon, and Scourge of Valkas returns with a retro-frame foil glow-up. And yes—that’s a Spaghetti Junction playtest card. It wouldn’t be Atlanta without a little gridlock.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>All cards are in English.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster 2 Display Box (Display Unit - 24 booster packs incl. in 1 box)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair Drop: MagicCon: The Gathering Foil Edition:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Pack Rat\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Shared Summons\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sylvan Offering\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sliver Legion\r\n<br>• 4x Promo Cards:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil The Ur-Dragon\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Scourge of Valkas\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Spaghetti Junction Playtest Card"}]},{"productId":649746,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: MagicCon: The Gathering - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop MagicCon The Gathering Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/649746_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/649746/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-magiccon-the-gathering-rainbow-foil-e