er Bundle nets you every Non-Foil Edition drop from the Marvel’s Spider-Man Superdrop—Thwip! Thwip!\r\n<br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Daily Bugle Breaking News\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Heroic Deeds\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Colors)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Inks)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Villainous Plots"}]},{"productId":655098,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Spider-Man: The Foil Web-Slinger Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Spider Man The Foil Web Slinger Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655098_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655098/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-spider-man-the-foil-web-slinger-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-12-22T16:48:00.91","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The Foil Web-Slinger Bundle nets you every Foil Edition drop from the Marvel’s Spider-Man Superdrop. Foiled again—only this time, in the best way possible.\r\n<br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Daily Bugle Breaking News Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Heroic Deeds Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Colors) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel's Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Inks) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Villainous Plots Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":655099,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Spider-Man: The Amazing Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Spider Man The Amazing Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655099_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655099/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-spider-man-the-amazing-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2025-12-22T16:47:54.583","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The The Amazing Everything Bundle nets you one of every drop in the Marvel’s Spider-Man Superdrop—both foil and non-foil—no web-shooters required.\r\n<br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Daily Bugle Breaking News\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Heroic Deeds\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Colors)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Inks)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Villainous Plots\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Daily Bugle Breaking News Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Heroic Deeds Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Colors) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Venom Unleashed (Inks) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel’s Spider-Man: Villainous Plots Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":655503,"name":"Secret Lair x Play-Doh: Squishful Thinking: Extra Life 2025 - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Play Doh Squishful Thinking Extra Life 2025 Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655503_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655503/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-play-doh-squishful-thinking-extra-life-2025-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2025-09-29T15:31:10.56","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair teamed up with Play-Doh for Extra Life 2025 because, like <em>Magic</em>, it's all about creativity and joy—Play-Doh is also the most requested toy for kids in hospitals. Together, we turned hand-sculpted Play-Doh into Magic cards to celebrate play, imagination, and the great work Extra Life makes possible.\r\n<br>Art by Ben Millar, Jason Loik, and Matthew Cohen\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Greensleeves, Maro-Sorcerer\r\n<br>• 1x Polyraptor\r\n<br>• 1x Academy Manufactor\r\n<br>• 1x Wurmcoil Engine"}]},{"productId":655504,"name":"Secret Lair x Play-Doh: Squishful Thinking: Extra Life 2025 - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Play Doh Squishful Thinking Extra Life 2025 Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655504_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655504/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-play-doh-squishful-thinking-extra-life-2025-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-05-29T19:38:23.517","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair teamed up with Play-Doh for Extra Life 2025 because, like <em>Magic</em>, it's all about creativity and joy—Play-Doh is also the most requested toy for kids in hospitals. Together, we turned hand-sculpted Play-Doh into Magic cards to celebrate play, imagination, and the great work Extra Life makes possible.\r\n<br>Art by Ben Millar, Jason Loik, and Matthew Cohen\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Greensleeves, Maro-Sorcerer\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Polyraptor\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Academy Manufactor\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wurmcoil Engine"}]},{"productId":655935,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Flower Power - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Flower Power Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655935_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655935/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-flower-power-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-09T14:02:45.26","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>At Secret Lair, we have two missions.\r\n<br>First: Work with amazing artists to make the most beautiful, unexpected Magic cards we can. This time we teamed up with the uniquely talented Ashley Dreyfus to bring a psychedelic cycle of basics to life. We love them so much and hope you do too.\r\n<br>Second: Mess with our friend Rory in Wizards’ finance department. As you can imagine, finance has a lot of key touchpoints with our releases—putting important numbers in important places with real business repercussions. Which is exactly why Rory will never see a $1 sale coming. He’ll probably assume it’s an error and start firing off emails... or worse, he might even schedule a meeting.\r\n<br>Steel sharpens steel.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Island\r\n<br>• 1x Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Forest"}]},{"productId":655936,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Flower Power - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Flower Power Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/655936_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/655936/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-flower-power-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-09T14:02:34.797","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>At Secret Lair, we have two missions.\r\n<br>First: Work with amazing artists to make the most beautiful, unexpected Magic cards we can. This time we teamed up with the uniquely talented Ashley Dreyfus to bring a psychedelic cycle of basics to life. We love them so much and hope you do too.\r\n<br>Second: Mess with our friend Rory in Wizards’ finance department. As you can imagine, finance has a lot of key touchpoints with our releases—putting important numbers in important places with real business repercussions. Which is exactly why Rory will never see a $1 sale coming. He’ll probably assume it’s an error and start firing off emails... or worse, he might even schedule a meeting.\r\n<br>Steel sharpens steel.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":656333,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Kieran Yanner - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Kieran Yanner Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656333_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656333/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-kieran-yanner-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:12:06.24","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Kieran Yanner’s work is cinematic, powerful, and instantly recognizable—every piece feels like a moment pulled from a larger story, from characters that command your attention to worlds that feel truly alive. This drop takes all that power and distills it into four iconic pieces of art.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Armageddon\r\n<br>• 1x Northern Paladin\r\n<br>• 1x Demonic Tutor\r\n<br>• 1x Lord of the Pit"}]},{"productId":656335,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Artist Series: Kieran Yanner - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Artist Series Kieran Yanner Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656335_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656335/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-artist-series-kieran-yanner-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:13:05.187","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Kieran Yanner’s work is cinematic, powerful, and instantly recognizable—every piece feels like a moment pulled from a larger story, from characters that command your attention to worlds that feel truly alive. This drop takes all that power and distills it into four iconic pieces of art.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Armageddon\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Northern Paladin\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Demonic Tutor\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Lord of the Pit"}]},{"productId":656337,"name":"Secret Lair x Jaws: Terror of Amity Island - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Jaws Terror of Amity Island Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656337_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656337/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-jaws-terror-of-amity-island-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:13:26.317","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\nYou know the story. A summer town. A dark fin cutting through the waves. Da-dum da-dum da-dum. The shark that changed movies forever.\r\n<br>Secret Lair x Jaws: Terror of Amity Island brings the indomitable power of Jaws to Magic. From the beach to the deep, every piece of Stephen Andrade’s art carries that same creeping dread—and once you’ve seen it, you'll never go in the water again.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Jaws, Relentless Predator\r\n<br>• 1x Descent into Avernus as \"Panic on Amity Island\"\r\n<br>• 1x Reckless Endeavor\r\n<br>• 1x Sneak Attack\r\n<br>• 1x Abrade as \"You're Gonna Need a Bigger Boat\"\r\n<br>• 1x Blood token"}]},{"productId":656338,"name":"Secret Lair x Jaws: Terror of Amity Island - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Jaws Terror of Amity Island Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656338_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656338/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-jaws-terror-of-amity-island-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:14:46.587","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\nYou know the story. A summer town. A dark fin cutting through the waves. Da-dum da-dum da-dum. The shark that changed movies forever.\r\n<br>Secret Lair x Jaws: Terror of Amity Island brings the indomitable power of Jaws to Magic. From the beach to the deep, every piece of Stephen Andrade’s art carries that same creeping dread—and once you’ve seen it, you'll never go in the water again.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Jaws, Relentless Predator\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Descent into Avernus as \"Panic on Amity Island\"\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Reckless Endeavor\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Sneak Attack\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Abrade as \"You're Gonna Need a Bigger Boat\"\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Blood token"}]},{"productId":656339,"name":"Secret Lair x The Office: Dwight's Destiny - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x The Office Dwights Destiny Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656339_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656339/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-the-office-dwights-destiny-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:14:59.1","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Destiny is not given. It is seized—by those with superior intellect, indomitable will, and an unmatched knowledge of bears. I am Dwight K. Schrute: defender of the realm, assistant King, and hero of my own saga.\r\n<br>These cards depict me as my true self: a man of legendary power with geometric facial proportions that are nearly perfect in every way. The prophecy is fulfilled.\r\n<br>Art by Justyna Dura, Alexander Mokhov, Lie Setiawan, Greg Staples, Magali Villeneuve, and Kieran Yanner.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Heliod, Sun-Crowned as \"Dwight Schrute, Hay King\"\r\n<br>• 1x Steelshaper's Gift as \"Dwight's Weapon Stash\"\r\n<br>• 1x Swords to Plowshares\r\n<br>• 1x Baral, Chief of Compliance as \"Dwight, Assistant (to the) King\"\r\n<br>• 1x Garruk Relentless // Garruk, the Veil-Cursed as \"Recyclops, Eco-friendly // Recyclops, Nature's Vengeance\"\r\n<br>• 1x Reaper King as \"Dwight o' Lantern\""}]},{"productId":656341,"name":"Secret Lair x The Office: Dwight's Destiny - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x The Office Dwights Destiny Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656341_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":