kaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Jim Woodring’s surreal pen-and-ink art twists the familiar into something strange and unforgettable. His work brings a dreamlike edge to Magic unlike anything we’ve done before.\r\n<br>The cards in Dreaming Darkly reward you for casting creature after creature, turning your board into a gallery of the surreal.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Glen Elendra Archmage\r\n<br>• 1x Guardian Project\r\n<br>• 1x Roon of the Hidden Realm\r\n<br>• 1x Soulherder"}]},{"productId":656345,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Dreaming Darkly - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Dreaming Darkly Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656345_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656345/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-dreaming-darkly-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:15:53.523","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Jim Woodring’s surreal pen-and-ink art twists the familiar into something strange and unforgettable. His work brings a dreamlike edge to Magic unlike anything we’ve done before.\r\n<br>The cards in Dreaming Darkly reward you for casting creature after creature, turning your board into a gallery of the surreal.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Glen Elendra Archmage\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Guardian Project\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Roon of the Hidden Realm\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Soulherder"}]},{"productId":656346,"name":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden: Album Art - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden Album Art Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656346_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656346/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-iron-maiden-album-art-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:16:10.73","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Iron Maiden’s album art is as legendary as the music itself. From Eddie’s first appearance to his most apocalyptic incarnations, these covers defined heavy metal’s look just as much as its sound.\r\n<br>Now, for the first time, that art storms straight onto Magic cards. It’s visceral, it’s brutal, and it’s every bit as unmistakable as the music behind it.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Lethal Scheme\r\n<br>• 1x Grave Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Animate Dead\r\n<br>• 1x Temporal Trespass\r\n<br>• 1x Unearth\r\n<br>• 1x Lignify"}]},{"productId":656347,"name":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden: Album Art - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden Album Art Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656347_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656347/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-iron-maiden-album-art-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:16:28.733","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Iron Maiden’s album art is as legendary as the music itself. From Eddie’s first appearance to his most apocalyptic incarnations, these covers defined heavy metal’s look just as much as its sound.\r\n<br>Now, for the first time, that art storms straight onto Magic cards. It’s visceral, it’s brutal, and it’s every bit as unmistakable as the music behind it.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Lethal Scheme\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Grave Titan\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Animate Dead\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Temporal Trespass\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Unearth\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Lignify"}]},{"productId":656349,"name":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden: Eddie Unchained - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden Eddie Unchained Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656349_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656349/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-iron-maiden-eddie-unchained-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:17:22.833","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Straight out of HELL, Iron Maiden’s eternal icon Eddie has haunted metal for decades. Now unleashed onto Magic to blight the familiar, twist the eternal, and prove that Eddie is forever. Legends warped in his image. Spells marked by his wrath. No plane contains him. No grave can hold him. And yes, this drop has the card Iron Maiden in it. With cards illustrated by long-time Maiden artist Dan Mumford, this isn’t a crossover, it’s an invasion.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Bruvac the Grandiloquent as \"Eddie the Judge\"\r\n<br>• 1x Windfall\r\n<br>• 1x Captain N'ghathrod as \"Eddie, Ghost of the Navigator\"\r\n<br>• 1x Nekusar, the Mindrazer as \"Eddie, Lord of Light\"\r\n<br>• 1x Iron Maiden\r\n<br>• 1x Mindcrank"}]},{"productId":656350,"name":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden: Eddie Unchained - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Iron Maiden Eddie Unchained Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656350_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656350/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-iron-maiden-eddie-unchained-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:20:13.333","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Straight out of HELL, Iron Maiden’s eternal icon Eddie has haunted metal for decades. Now unleashed onto Magic to blight the familiar, twist the eternal, and prove that Eddie is forever. Legends warped in his image. Spells marked by his wrath. No plane contains him. No grave can hold him. And yes, this drop has the card Iron Maiden in it. With cards illustrated by long-time Maiden artist Dan Mumford, this isn’t a crossover, it’s an invasion.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Bruvac the Grandiloquent as \"Eddie the Judge\"\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Windfall\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Captain N'ghathrod as \"Eddie, Ghost of the Navigator\"\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Nekusar, the Mindrazer as \"Eddie, Lord of Light\"\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Iron Maiden\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Mindcrank"}]},{"productId":656351,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Trick or Treat - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Trick or Treat Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656351_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656351/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-trick-or-treat-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:22:46.54","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s Halloween in the burbs, and Magic’s legends are out roaming the streets—only this time they’re made of cardboard, duct tape, and imagination.\r\n<br>Brought to life by artists Sam Heimer and Ryan Roadkill, Trick or Treat takes us to a time before the advent of the helicopter parent. Halloween nights—flashlights, pillowcase candy hauls, and the thrill of unsupervised mayhem.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Vito, Thorn of the Dusk Rose\r\n<br>• 1x Satoru Umezawa\r\n<br>• 1x Voja, Jaws of the Conclave\r\n<br>• 1x Wilhelt, the Rotcleaver\r\n<br>• 1x Liberator, Urza's Battlethopter"}]},{"productId":656353,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Trick or Treat - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Trick or Treat Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656353_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656353/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-trick-or-treat-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-01-30T16:22:51.813","imageCount":2,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>It’s Halloween in the burbs, and Magic’s legends are out roaming the streets—only this time they’re made of cardboard, duct tape, and imagination.\r\n<br>Brought to life by artists Sam Heimer and Ryan Roadkill, Trick or Treat takes us to a time before the advent of the helicopter parent. Halloween nights—flashlights, pillowcase candy hauls, and the thrill of unsupervised mayhem.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Vito, Thorn of the Dusk Rose\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Satoru Umezawa\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Voja, Jaws of the Conclave\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Wilhelt, the Rotcleaver\r\n<br>• 1x Rainbow Foil Liberator, Urza's Battlethopter"}]},{"productId":656355,"name":"Secret Lair x Furby: Doo-ay Noo-lah - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Furby Doo ay Noo lah Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/656355_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/656355/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-furby-doo-ay-noo-lah-non-foil-edition"