evotion Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/677400_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/677400/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-shadowhearts-devotion-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-06T15:42:05.947","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br> Shadowheart’s path is one of silence and sacrifice—a devotion paid in secrets, steel, and the soft pull of something she can’t name. In the service of Shar, mercy is a luxury, and doubt is a wound that never heals. Yet in every choice, every shadow cast, she proves that conviction can be as deadly as any blade.\r\n<br>Through the hands of Tyler Jacobson, Anna Podedworna, Nereida, Mila Pesic, and Simon Dominic, her faith takes form—rendered with the same beauty, danger, and defiance that define her.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Shadowheart, Dark Justiciar\r\n<br>• 1x Beseech the Queen\r\n<br>• 1x Black Market\r\n<br>• 1x Victimize\r\n<br>• 1x Ancient Bronze Dragon"}]},{"productId":677401,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Shadowheart's Devotion - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Shadowhearts Devotion Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/677401_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/677401/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-shadowhearts-devotion-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-06T15:42:14.91","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Shadowheart’s path is one of silence and sacrifice—a devotion paid in secrets, steel, and the soft pull of something she can’t name. In the service of Shar, mercy is a luxury, and doubt is a wound that never heals. Yet in every choice, every shadow cast, she proves that conviction can be as deadly as any blade.\r\n<br>Through the hands of Tyler Jacobson, Anna Podedworna, Nereida, Mila Pesic, and Simon Dominic, her faith takes form—rendered with the same beauty, danger, and defiance that define her.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Shadowheart, Dark Justiciar\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Beseech the Queen\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Black Market\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Victimize\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ancient Bronze Dragon"}]},{"productId":677402,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dungeons & Dragons: Gale's Ambition - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dungeons and Dragons Gales Ambition Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/677402_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/677402/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dungeons-and-dragons-gales-ambition-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-06T15:27:29.073","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Magic is simple. All it takes is genius, discipline, and a touch of devastating charm.\r\n<br>Gale of Waterdeep has all three—and the audacity to believe that no spell is beyond his grasp. Whether unraveling the Weave or reshaping the stars themselves, he treats every act of magic like a declaration: bold, brilliant, and just a little dangerous. Some chase power. Gale simply perfects it.\r\n<br>Cynthia Sheppard, LEE Woo-chul, Lie Setiawan, Martina Facková, and Aron Elekes