tles The Last Ronin Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680226_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680226/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-the-last-ronin-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:58:01.133","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>In a future carved by loss and shadow, a lone Turtle walks the ruins of a world that failed his family—driven by memory, sharpened by grief, and unwilling to let the last spark of their legacy fade.\r\n<br>Through steel, spirit, and the resolve born from everything he’s endured, his path becomes a reckoning. Ghosts of the past guide him, enemies of the present challenge him, and the mission he carries refuses to bend. What remains is a story etched in determination and sacrifice—one final stand lit by the fire of everything worth fighting for.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Settle the Wreckage\r\n<br>• 1x Mental Misstep\r\n<br>• 1x Ink-Eyes, Servant of Oni as \"Splinter, Vengeful Sensei\"\r\n<br>• 1x Anger\r\n<br>• 1x Chord of Calling"}]},{"productId":680227,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Last Ronin - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles The Last Ronin Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680227_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680227/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-the-last-ronin-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:57:55.917","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData