David Ramos, Eastman’s heavy lines and duotone shading throw familiar Magic creatures into new scenes—forms pushed larger, expressions harder, and moments locked at maximum intensity.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Loxodon Gatekeeper\r\n<br>• 1x Sakashima's Student\r\n<br>• 1x Throat Slitter\r\n<br>• 1x Guttersnipe"}]},{"productId":680229,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Colors) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Kevin Eastman Colors Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680229_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680229/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-kevin-eastman-colors-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:57:46.073","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Kevin Eastman’s unmistakable style has defined generations of comic art—bold silhouettes, charged motion, and worlds that feel one second from bursting off the page. As co-creator of Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles and a lifelong force in independent comics, his work blends gritty energy with a storytelling clarity that’s instantly recognizable.\r\n<br>With colors by Jay David Ramos, Eastman’s heavy lines and duotone shading throw familiar Magic creatures into new scenes—forms pushed larger, expressions harder, and moments locked at maximum intensity.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Loxodon Gatekeeper\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sakashima's Student\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Throat Slitter\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Guttersnipe"}]},{"productId":680230,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Inks) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Kevin Eastman Inks Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680230_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680230/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-kevin-eastman-inks-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:57:42.473","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Kevin Eastman’s work helped shape the visual language of comics, driven by confident linework, decisive composition, and an instantly recognizable hand. From the earliest black-and-white issues that launched Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to decades of comics that followed, his ink-first approach remains central to his visual identity.\r\n<br>Presented entirely in black and white, this collection focuses on the foundation of his craft—the raw linework and contrast that define his work and continue to influence artists across the industry.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Loxodon Gatekeeper\r\n<br>• 1x Sakashima's Student\r\n<br>• 1x Throat Slitter\r\n<br>• 1x Guttersnipe"}]},{"productId":680231,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Inks) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Kevin Eastman Inks Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680231_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680231/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-kevin-eastman-inks-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:57:33.2","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Kevin Eastman’s work helped shape the visual language of comics, driven by confident linework, decisive composition, and an instantly recognizable hand. From the earliest black-and-white issues that launched Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to decades of comics that followed, his ink-first approach remains central to his visual identity.\r\n<br>Presented entirely in black and white, this collection focuses on the foundation of his craft—the raw linework and contrast that define his work and continue to influence artists across the industry.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Loxodon Gatekeeper\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sakashima's Student\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Throat Slitter\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Guttersnipe"}]},{"productId":680232,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Featuring: Stan Sakai - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Featuring Stan Sakai Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680232_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680232/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-featuring-stan-sakai-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:57:24.023","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>A wandering ronin rabbit. Bandits, taxes, old friends, worse enemies. Rice is scarce, trouble is not. Usagi Yojimbo has always been about doing the right thing, even when it’s inconvenient, unpaid, and absolutely going to involve a sword.\r\n<br>Drawn by Stan Sakai himself, Usagi’s world arrives through the same brush and ink that carried him across feudal Japan for decades (and welcomed a few time-lost turtles along the way). Helping always costs more than it pays, and Usagi keeps doing it anyway.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Baylen, the Haymaker as \"Miyamoto Usagi\"\r\n<br>• 1x Felidar Retreat as \"Katsuichi's Peace\"\r\n<br>• 1x Master of Ceremonies\r\n<br>• 1x Second Harvest\r\n<br>• 1x Sunforger as \"The Grass-Cutting Sword\""}]},{"productId":680233