solve, this bundle gathers every foil edition from the Totally TubuLair Superdrop into a shining testament to Turtle Power.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: VHS Villains Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Mighty Mutanimals Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Last Ronin Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Colors) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Inks) Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Stan Sakai Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":680238,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Totally TubuLair Superdrop: Heroes in a Half Shell Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Totally TubuLair Superdrop Heroes in a Half Shell Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680238_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680238/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-totally-tubulair-superdrop-heroes-in-a-half-shell-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-06-04T12:56:33.743","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Rooted in training, teamwork, and street-level vigilance, this bundle brings together every non-foil edition from the Totally TubuLair Superdrop as a complete heroes-in-a-half-shell lineup.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: VHS Villains\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Mighty Mutanimals\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Last Ronin\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Colors)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Kevin Eastman (Inks)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair: Featuring: Stan Sakai"}]},{"productId":680611,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Brain Dead: New Earth Mentality - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Brain Dead New Earth Mentality Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680611_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680611/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-brain-dead-new-earth-mentality-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-05-21T18:17:13.403","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Brain Dead is back again to reimagine cards across Magic’s history—and they didn’t stop there. The artwork escapes the frame and lands on T-shirts exclusively through Brain Dead, meaning the drop doesn’t just live on as cards. It lives in your closet, too, opening the door to the extremely specific flex of matching your favorite T-shirt’s new favorite T-shirt to the cards themselves.\r\n<br>Across five ally-colored cycling lands and five iconic creatures, Brain Dead brings their distinct visual language in collaboration with contemporary artists pushing the edges of fantasy illustration, resulting in a bold mix of experimentation and unmistakable style.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Mirror Entity\r\n<br>• 1x Jace’s Archivist\r\n<br>• 1x Stinkweed Imp\r\n<br>• 1x Mogg Assassin\r\n<br>• 1x Sakura-Tribe Elder\r\n<br>• 1x Irrigated Farmland\r\n<br>• 1x Fetid Pools\r\n<br>• 1x Canyon Slough\r\n<br>• 1x Sheltered Thicket\r\n<br>• 1x Scattered Groves"}]},{"productId":680617,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Brain Dead: New Earth Mentality - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Brain Dead New Earth Mentality Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/680617_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/680617/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-brain-dead-new-earth-mentality-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-05-21T18:16:54.247","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Brain Dead is back again to reimagine cards across Magic’s history—and they didn’t stop there. The artwork escapes the frame and lands on T-shirts exclusively through Brain Dead, meaning the drop doesn’t just live on as cards. It lives in your closet, too, opening the door to the extremely specific flex of matching your favorite T-shirt’s new favorite T-shirt to the cards themselves.\r\n<br>Across five ally-colored cycling lands and five iconic creatures, Brain Dead brings their distinct visual language in collaboration with contemporary artists pushing the edges of fantasy illustration, resulting in a bold mix of experimentation and unmistakable style.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mirror Entity\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Jace’s Archivist\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Stinkweed Imp\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mogg Assassin\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sakura-Tribe Elder\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Irrigated Farmland\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Fetid Pools\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Canyon Slough\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sheltered Thicket\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Scattered Groves"}]},{"productId":684086,"name":"Secret Lair Deck: Dandan Deck","cleanName":"Secret Lair Deck Dandan Deck","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/684086_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/684086/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-deck-dandan-deck","modifiedOn":"2026-03-16T15:38:35.583","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"After years beneath the surface, Dandân rises again! The iconic blue fish that sparked a community-favorite format finally returns—reprinted for the first time since 2006 with brand-new art from kelogsloops.\r\n<br>If you’ve never played Dandân before, don’t panic—we packed a handy how-to-play guide and two life wheels right in the box. This fully playable two-player deck comes ready for head-to-head games where you and your opponent share a single 80-card library, trading blows as you try to land five hits with a fish while messing with each other’s islands. It’s a clever mix of strategy, memory, and mayhem that’s perfect for both longtime fans and first-timers ready to dive in.\r\n<br>The rest of the deck’s look is just as bold as the gameplay. Magical Hack and Mystic Sanctuary feature new art for the first time, illustrated by Samuele Bandini and Amélie Flechais, with additional new pieces from Wylie Beckert and Ed He. All cards with new art are printed in foil, while every other card in the deck keeps things classic in retro frames for a perfect blend of fresh art and timeless style.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 10x Foil Dandân\r\n<br>• 4x Foil Accumulated Knowledge\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Magical Hack\r\n<br>• 8x Foil Memory Lapse\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Mystic Sanctuary\r\n<br>• 20x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 2x Brainstorm\r\n<br>• 2x Capture of Jingzhou\r\n<br>• 2x Chart a Course\r\n<br>• 2x Control Magic\r\n<br>• 2x Crystal Spray\r\n<br>• 2x Day’s Undoing\r\n<br>• 2x Mental Note\r\n<br>• 2x Metamorphose\r\n<br>• 2x Predict\r\n<br>• 2x Telling Time\r\n<br>• 2x Unsubstantiate\r\n<br>• 2x Halimar Depths\r\n<br>• 2x Haunted Fengraf\r\n<br>• 2x Lonely Sandbar\r\n<br>• 2x Remote Isle\r\n<br>• 2x The Surgical Bay\r\n<br>• 2x Svyelunite Temple"}]},{"productId":686493,"name":"Secret Lair Roadshow Edition: So Salty - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Roadshow Edition So Salty Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/686493_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/686493/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-roadshow-edition-so-salty-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-03-31T12:32:48.687","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Contents:\r\n<br>• Winter Orb\r\n<br>• Worst Fears\r\n<br>• Narset, Parter of Veils\r\n<br>• Scrawling Crawler\r\n<br>• Expropriate"}]},{"productId":686665,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You're Welcome) - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool I Fixed It Youre Welcome Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/686665_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/686665/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-i-fixed-it-youre-welcome-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-07-07T14:59:38.843","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Oh good! You made it. That saves me a whole opening-credits voiceover with licensed music I absolutely cannot afford. Come on in—don’t be shy. Yes, this is the secret room. Of course there’s a secret room. It’s called Secret Lair. What did you think was in here, a normal room? I’ve been hanging out back here for a bit. Second visit now, which technically makes this a residency. I’ve survived worse editorial decisions. I’m down to my last emergency chimichanga, still a fan favorite, and I’ve never let bad judgment slow me down.\r\n<br>Anyway… They told me to “sit quietly and don't touch anything,” so naturally I touched everything. Cards. Numbers. Art. The fragile, whisper-thin concept of balance. If a card was almost good, I took that personally. Snip. Scribble. Cross that out. Oh wow, that’s better now. Look at that—instant speed. Shoes? Zero mana cost! I didn’t break anything. I improved it. Aggressively. With confidence. You’re welcome.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Deadly Dispute\r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Thrill of Possibility\r\n<br>• 1x Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":686666,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You're Welcome) - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool I Fixed It Youre Welcome Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/686666_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/686666/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-i-fixed-it-youre-welcome-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-07-07T14:58:48.477","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Oh good! You made it. That saves me a whole opening-credits voiceover with licensed music I absolutely cannot afford. Come on in—don’t be shy. Yes, this is the secret room. Of course there’s a secret room. It’s called Secret Lair. What did you think was in here, a normal room? I’ve been hanging out back here for a bit. Second visit now, which technically makes this a residency. I’ve survived worse editorial decisions. I’m down to my last emergency chimichanga, still a fan favorite, and I’ve never let bad judgment slow me down.\r\n<br>Anyway… They told me to “sit quietly and don't touch anything,” so naturally I touched everything. Cards. Numbers. Art. The fragile, whisper-thin concept of balance. If a card was almost good, I took that personally. Snip. Scribble. Cross that out. Oh wow, that’s better now. Look at that—instant speed. Shoes? Zero mana cost! I didn’t break anything. I improved it. Aggressively. With confidence. You’re welcome.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Deadly Dispute\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Thrill of Possibility\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":686669,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You're Welcome) - Pool Party Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool I Fixed It Youre Welcome Pool Party Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/686669_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/686669/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-i-fixed-it-youre-welcome-pool-party-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-07-07T14:58:35.483","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Description\r\n<br>OFFICIAL INVITATION, PLEASE READ OUT LOUD FOR BEST RESULTS (OR DON’T. I’M NOT YOUR DAD.)\r\n<br>Occasion: Pool Party (capital P, capital P, no swimming)\r\n<br>Host: Me. Obviously.\r\n<br>Reason: I’m still alive, still employed, still wearing red, and history says that deserves decorations. Plus, I haven’t thrown a self-celebration in a while and that felt irresponsible. Attendance implies acceptance. Gifts are encouraged but unnecessary. Compliments will be noticed. Internalized. Never forgotten.\r\n<br>Dress code: Red preferred. Black accents acceptable. Green strictly forbidden.\r\n<br>What to Expect: Things may appear brighter, busier, and significantly more committed than before. Party hats. Cupcakes. Rainbows. Unicorns. So much shine that Secret Lair went ahead and let me debut my own foil treatment! This is the Pool Party Edition: extra everything, zero restraint, and full confidence in choices that absolutely did not ask permission. RSVP however you want. I already counted you in.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Pool Party Foil Deadly Dispute\r\n<br>• 1x Pool Party Foil Lightning Bolt\r\n<br>• 1x Pool Party Foil Thrill of Possibility\r\n<br>• 1x Pool Party Foil Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>• 1x Pool Party Foil Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":686671,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: FINAL_final_REALLYfinal_v7_USETHISONE(2)_Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvels Deadpool FINAL_final_REALLYfinal_v7_USETHISONE2_Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/686671_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/686671/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvels-deadpool-final_final_reallyfinal_v7_usethisone2_everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-07-07T14:58:15.793","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ready for the director’s cut, the midnight showing, and the unhinged party spin-off all at once? Good. This bundle includes the non-foil, foil, and Pool Party editions together, because if we’re breaking the fourth wall, we might as well kick it in.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You’re Welcome)\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You’re Welcome) Traditional Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Marvel's Deadpool: I Fixed It (You’re Welcome) Pool Party Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":689835,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2026 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Festival in a Box Las Vegas 2026 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/689835_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/689835/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-las-vegas-2026-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-05-04T16:15:27.3","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>MagicCon is heading back to Las Vegas, and Festival in a Box is ready to put on a show. Keep the celebration going with a box that carries the lights, the drama, and the magic beyond the main event.\r\n<br>Inside, the Mystery Booster 2 Display steps into the spotlight with 24 booster packs pulling from nearly 200 set symbols. Every pack is full of surprises, including a white border card, a playtest card, and a Future Sight frame card that might even show up as one of 15 exclusive foils. You never quite know what’s coming next, and that’s half the fun.\r\n<br>You’ll also receive Viva Las Rakdos, a Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop available only through Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2026. Dressed in black and red, spotlights and sequins take over with dramatic entrances, last looks in the mirror, and a finale built for the main stage.\r\n<br>And yes, there are a few special appearances. Counterspell and Consecrated Sphinx arrive in retro frame foil, plus In Residence, a playtest card that turns the spotlight on a surprise guest for one unforgettable performance.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster 2 Display\r\n<br>• 1x Viva Las Rakdos Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop containing:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Talisman of Indulgence\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dark Petition\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Beseech the Mirror\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Light Up the Stage\r\n<br>• 3x Promo Cards:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Counterspell\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Consecrated Sphinx\r\n<br>• 1x In Residence Playtest Card"}]},{"productId":689836,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Viva Las Rakdos - Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Viva Las Rakdos Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/689836_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/689836/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-viva-las-rakdos-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-05-04T16:15:14.687","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Secret Lair Drop originally part of the Secret Lair Festival in a Box: Las Vegas 2026 bundle.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Talisman of Indulgence\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dark Petition\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lightning Greaves\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Beseech the Mirror\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Light Up the Stage"}]},{"productId":691175,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x My Little Pony Friendship is Magic Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691175_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691175/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-my-little-pony-friendship-is-magic-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:27:23.683","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br><br>Equestria has weathered curses, playful spirits, changeling invasions, time travel mishaps, ancient magical artifacts, and more than one adventure sparked by the ever-enthusiastic Cutie Mark Crusaders. The common denominator? Friendship. And occasionally a stern lecture from Twilight Sparkle.\r\n<br>It turns out that rainboom-level loyalty, boundless generosity, sunny optimism, and the ability to throw a party during a magical emergency go a long way to keep harmony. The royal sisters may move the sun and moon, but it’s six ponies in Ponyville who keep saving the world before dinner.\r\n<br>Art by Rudy Siswanto, Andrea Radeck, Jennifer L. Meyer, Narendra Bintara Adi, and Anna Steinbauer.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Generous Gift\r\n<br>• 1x Reconnaissance Mission\r\n<br>• 1x Radiate\r\n<br>• 1x Defense of the Heart\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":691182,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x My Little Pony Friendship is Magic Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691182_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691182/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-my-little-pony-friendship-is-magic-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:27:16.82","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Equestria has weathered curses, playful spirits, changeling invasions, time travel mishaps, ancient magical artifacts, and more than one adventure sparked by the ever-enthusiastic Cutie Mark Crusaders. The common denominator? Friendship. And occasionally a stern lecture from Twilight Sparkle.\r\n<br>It turns out that rainboom-level loyalty, boundless generosity, sunny optimism, and the ability to throw a party during a magical emergency go a long way to keep harmony. The royal sisters may move the sun and moon, but it’s six ponies in Ponyville who keep saving the world before dinner.\r\n<br>Art by Rudy Siswanto, Andrea Radeck, Jennifer L. Meyer, Narendra Bintara Adi, and Anna Steinbauer.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Generous Gift\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Reconnaissance Mission\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Radiate\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Defense of the Heart\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sol Ring"}]},{"productId":691183,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x My Little Pony: The Lands of Equestria - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x My Little Pony The Lands of Equestria Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691183_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691183/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-my-little-pony-the-lands-of-equestria-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:27:04.79","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Equestria is a land of rolling hills, shining towers, enchanted forests, and an absolutely unreasonable amount of plot.\r\n<br>Artists LEE Woo-Chul, Michal Ivan, Livia Prima, and David Frasheski take us on a scenic tour through it all, capturing Equestria at its most idyllic (with just a hint of adventure). This is, after all, the land where Ponyville has endured parasprites, Cutie Pox outbreaks, cider shortages, and multiple save-the-world emergencies—all while still maintaining impeccable bakery standards. It’s also where the Everfree Forest cheerfully plays by its own rules, where Froggy Bottom Bog once played host to Discord at his most theatrically unbothered, and where Rambling Rock Ridge rises in the distance like a reminder that even the landscape here has a flair for drama.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Island\r\n<br>• 2x Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Forest"}]},{"productId":691184,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x My Little Pony: The Lands of Equestria - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x My Little Pony The Lands of Equestria Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691184_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691184/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-my-little-pony-the-lands-of-equestria-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:58.257","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Equestria is a land of rolling hills, shining towers, enchanted forests, and an absolutely unreasonable amount of plot.\r\n<br>Artists LEE Woo-Chul, Michal Ivan, Livia Prima, and David Frasheski take us on a scenic tour through it all, capturing Equestria at its most idyllic (with just a hint of adventure). This is, after all, the land where Ponyville has endured parasprites, Cutie Pox outbreaks, cider shortages, and multiple save-the-world emergencies—all while still maintaining impeccable bakery standards. It’s also where the Everfree Forest cheerfully plays by its own rules, where Froggy Bottom Bog once played host to Discord at his most theatrically unbothered, and where Rambling Rock Ridge rises in the distance like a reminder that even the landscape here has a flair for drama.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Plains\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Island\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Swamp\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Mountain\r\n<br>• 2x Foil Forest"}]},{"productId":691185,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Omens of Chaos - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Omens of Chaos Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691185_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691185/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-omens-of-chaos-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:53.117","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br> Strixhaven Univeristy is known as Arcavios's premier institution of magical learning. What it really offers is ambition under pressure, rivalries with consequences, and the occasional magical incident that will absolutely not be covered in orientation. Inspired by the New York Times bestseller Strixhaven: Omens of Chaos (Magic: The Gathering) by Seanan McGuire, the spotlight falls on the first-years—the ones discovering that talent is one thing and surviving your first semester is another.\r\n<br>Featuring art by Nathaniel Himawan, Bryan Sola, Arif Wijaya, and Andrew Mar.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Abrupt Decay\r\n<br>• 1x Batwing Brune\r\n<br>• 1x Chance for Glory\r\n<br>• 1x Counterflux\r\n<br>• 1x Growth Spiral"}]},{"productId":691186,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Omens of Chaos - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Omens of Chaos Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691186_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691186/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-omens-of-chaos-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:45.907","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Strixhaven Univeristy is known as Arcavios's premier institution of magical learning. What it really offers is ambition under pressure, rivalries with consequences, and the occasional magical incident that will absolutely not be covered in orientation. Inspired by the New York Times bestseller Strixhaven: Omens of Chaos (Magic: The Gathering) by Seanan McGuire, the spotlight falls on the first-years—the ones discovering that talent is one thing and surviving your first semester is another.\r\n<br>Featuring art by Nathaniel Himawan, Bryan Sola, Arif Wijaya, and Andrew Mar.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Abrupt Decay\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Batwing Brune\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Chance for Glory\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Counterflux\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Growth Spiral"}]},{"productId":691187,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dwarf Fortress: Create New World - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dwarf Fortress Create New World Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691187_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691187/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dwarf-fortress-create-new-world-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:37.167","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Some lessons are learned the hard way. Others are learned when a single capital “D” appears on your screen and everything you built is immediately on fire.\r\n<br>Dwarf Fortress began as a grid of letters, where survival meant knowing that “˜” was water, “^” was terrain, and “D” was the end of your architectural optimism. Carp taught you humility. Entire civilizations ended because you forgot to build a door. Fortresses collapse, brewers overproduce, and cats make catastrophic life choices. This is not failure. This is curriculum. Attendance is mandatory, survival is optional, and remember: losing is fun.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Rendezvous\r\n<br>• 1x Rune-Scarred Demon\r\n<br>• 1x Terror of the Peaks\r\n<br>• 1x Communal Brewing\r\n<br>• 1x Rogue's Passage"}]},{"productId":691188,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Dwarf Fortress: Create New World - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Dwarf Fortress Create New World Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691188_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691188/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-dwarf-fortress-create-new-world-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:26.56","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Some lessons are learned the hard way. Others are learned when a single capital “D” appears on your screen and everything you built is immediately on fire.\r\n<br>Dwarf Fortress began as a grid of letters, where survival meant knowing that “˜” was water, “^” was terrain, and “D” was the end of your architectural optimism. Carp taught you humility. Entire civilizations ended because you forgot to build a door. Fortresses collapse, brewers overproduce, and cats make catastrophic life choices. This is not failure. This is curriculum. Attendance is mandatory, survival is optional, and remember: losing is fun.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Secret Rendezvous\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rune-Scarred Demon\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Terror of the Peaks\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Communal Brewing\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rogue's Passage"}]},{"productId":691190,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Eyes Have It - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Eyes Have It Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691190_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691190/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-eyes-have-it-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:26:17.333","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The semester starts with a syllabus, a seating chart, and the creeping sense that you’re already being graded.\r\n<br>Artists Diego Andrade, Pedro Correa, BLUMOO, Molly Mendoza, and Martin Ontiveros turn the stack into a study hall of cosmic surveillance—wide eyes, layered realities, and the distinct feeling that you’re being very carefully monitored. At the center of it all sits a certain enchantment that rewards preparation, patience, and knowing exactly what’s coming next. The rest of the curriculum? A crash course in subtle rearranging, strategic peeking, and making sure the answer key is always sitting right where you left it.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Counterbalance\r\n<br>• 1x Gitaxian Probe\r\n<br>• 1x Opt\r\n<br>• 1x Otherworldly Gaze\r\n<br>• 1x Baleful Strix"}]},{"productId":691192,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: The Eyes Have It - Rainbow Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop The Eyes Have It Rainbow Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691192_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691192/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-the-eyes-have-it-rainbow-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:25:49.51","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The semester starts with a syllabus, a seating chart, and the creeping sense that you’re already being graded.\r\n<br>Artists Diego Andrade, Pedro Correa, BLUMOO, Molly Mendoza, and Martin Ontiveros turn the stack into a study hall of cosmic surveillance—wide eyes, layered realities, and the distinct feeling that you’re being very carefully monitored. At the center of it all sits a certain enchantment that rewards preparation, patience, and knowing exactly what’s coming next. The rest of the curriculum? A crash course in subtle rearranging, strategic peeking, and making sure the answer key is always sitting right where you left it.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Counterbalance\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Gitaxian Probe\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Opt\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Otherworldly Gaze\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Baleful Strix"}]},{"productId":691193,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Maho Gakuin Seishun Hakusho - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Maho Gakuin Seishun Hakusho Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691193_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691193/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-maho-gakuin-seishun-hakusho-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:31:01.467","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ryuta Fuse, Inio Asano, kawasumi, Shiro, and toi8 prove that a proper magic academy story require three things: immaculate uniforms, deeply serious academic rivalries, and students who absolutely have a midterm tomorrow but are instead unlocking something ancient and extremely inadvisable. It’s all very disciplined, very prestigious, and one dramatic hallway encounter away from a full story arc.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Rule of Law\r\n<br>• 1x Thought Scour\r\n<br>• 1x Time Stretch\r\n<br>• 1x Stinging Study\r\n<br>• 1x Notion Thief\r\n\r\n<br><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:red\">When purchasing this unique product,</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color:red\"> please keep in mind that this Secret Lair Drop Series Sealed Product will ship out to you <em>after</em> the seller receives the product directly from Wizards of the Coast.</span</em><br><br><em><span style=\"color:red\"> The estimated time frame for sellers to receive stock is not fixed, so it could be anywhere between 1 - 10 weeks for delivery.</span></em></strong>"}]},{"productId":691194,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Maho Gakuin Seishun Hakusho - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Maho Gakuin Seishun Hakusho Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691194_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691194/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-maho-gakuin-seishun-hakusho-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:30:46.013","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Ryuta Fuse, Inio Asano, kawasumi, Shiro, and toi8 prove that a proper magic academy story require three things: immaculate uniforms, deeply serious academic rivalries, and students who absolutely have a midterm tomorrow but are instead unlocking something ancient and extremely inadvisable. It’s all very disciplined, very prestigious, and one dramatic hallway encounter away from a full story arc.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rule of Law\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Thought Scour\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Time Stretch\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Stinging Study\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Notion Thief"}]},{"productId":691195,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Notebook Genius - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Notebook Genius Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691195_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691195/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-notebook-genius-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:30:22.95","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There are two kinds of students: the ones who color-code their notes, and the ones who turn the margins into a side project. Mica Angela Hendricks captures the academic tradition of writing the date, adding three believable bullet points, and then spending the rest of a lesson absolutely not taking notes while Professor Razineth is explaining something extremely important. Attendance was taken. So were creative liberties.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Lier, Disciple of the Drowned\r\n<br>• 1x Bloodghast\r\n<br>• 1x Storm-Kiln Artist\r\n<br>• 1x Anhelo, the Painter"}]},{"productId":691196,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Notebook Genius - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Notebook Genius Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691196_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691196/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-notebook-genius-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:29:21.793","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>There are two kinds of students: the ones who color-code their notes, and the ones who turn the margins into a side project. Mica Angela Hendricks captures the academic tradition of writing the date, adding three believable bullet points, and then spending the rest of a lesson absolutely not taking notes while Professor Razineth is explaining something extremely important. Attendance was taken. So were creative liberties.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Lier, Disciple of the Drowned\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Bloodghast\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Storm-Kiln Artist\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Anhelo, the Painter"}]},{"productId":691197,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Return to Mystical Archive - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Return to Mystical Archive Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691197_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691197/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-return-to-mystical-archive-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:29:19.523","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Lorehold calls it history. Prismari calls it performance. Silverquill calls it presentation. Witherbloom calls it practical. Quandrix calls it inevitable. The Mystical Archive just calls it required reading—and it grades hard.\r\n<br>Second year at Strixhaven means fewer orientation tours and more time in the Biblioplex, where archived spells don’t stay untouched for long. These iconic instants and sorceries across Magic’s history, once printed exclusively in Japanese, now return in English with art from from Kazuma Ichikawa, SHIE NANAHARA, HISASHI MOMOSE, KAORU HAGIYA, and Ryohei Shimazaki, because some spells deserve to be archived more than once.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Duty Beyond Death\r\n<br>• 1x Spell Pierce\r\n<br>• 1x Zombify\r\n<br>• 1x Abrade\r\n<br>• 1x Shared Roots"}]},{"productId":691198,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Return to Mystical Archive - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Return to Mystical Archive Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/691198_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691198/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-return-to-mystical-archive-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-07T13:29:53.553","im