e,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>All the cats, in both foil and non-foil, gathered into one gloriously overcommitted pile of majesty, menace, magic, mystery, mayhem, and the kind of confidence that knocks a glass over while making direct eye contact.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: As Intended\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: As Intended Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Motivationally Challenged\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Motivationally Challenged Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Our Only Thought is to Entertain You\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Our Only Thought is to Entertain You Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Felix the Cat: Magic Bag of Tricks\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Felix the Cat: Magic Bag of Tricks Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Toby's Journey by Gary Baseman\r\n<br>• 1x Toby's Journey by Gary Baseman Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Witch's Familiar\r\n<br>• 1x Witch's Familiar Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Cats of Chaos\r\n<br>• 1x Cats of Chaos Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Purr Majesty\r\n<br>• 1x Purr Majesty Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":700803,"name":"Secret Lair Cats Are the Best Superdrop: Laser Focus Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Cats Are the Best Superdrop Laser Focus Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/700803_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/700803/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-cats-are-the-best-superdrop-laser-focus-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-09-14T14:56:11.333","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>From majesty to menace, the Cats Are the Best Superdrop in foil forms one full assembly of feline nonsense with all the grace and self-control of a cat in laser-pointer pursuit, which is to say none whatsoever.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: As Intended Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Motivationally Challenged Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Our Only Thought is to Entertain You Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Felix the Cat: Magic Bag of Tricks Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Toby's Journey by Gary Baseman Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Witch's Familiar Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Cats of Chaos Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Purr Majesty Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":700804,"name":"Secret Lair Cats Are the Best Superdrop: Nine Lives Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Cats Are the Best Superdrop Nine Lives Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/700804_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/700804/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-cats-are-the-best-superdrop-nine-lives-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-09-14T14:56:02.55","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>For anyone ready to welcome the whole Cats Are the Best Superdrop in non-foil, call it a clowder, call it a takeover, call it what it is: too many cats to argue with and not nearly enough chair to go around.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: As Intended \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Motivationally Challenged \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Garfield: Our Only Thought is to Entertain You\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Felix the Cat: Magic Bag of Tricks\r\n<br>• 1x Toby's Journey by Gary Baseman\r\n<br>• 1x Witch's Familiar \r\n<br>• 1x Cats of Chaos \r\n<br>• 1x Purr Majesty"}]},{"productId":702291,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Fallout: Promo - Silver Shroud Costume - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Fallout Promo Silver Shroud Costume Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702291_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702291/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-fallout-promo-silver-shroud-costume-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-06-22T13:15:09.92","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"This sealed product contains 1 Traditional Foil Silver Shroud Costume promo card."}]},{"productId":703900,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Festival in a Box Amsterdam 2026 Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Festival in a Box Amsterdam 2026 Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/703900_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/703900/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-festival-in-a-box-amsterdam-2026-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-10-07T16:01:03.44","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>MagicCon is headed to Amsterdam, and Festival in a Box is taking the scenic route. Whether you’re strolling along the canals or opening packs from the couch, this box is packed with surprises, museum-worthy special guests, and a little wild beauty in full bloom.\r\n<br>Inside, the Mystery Booster 2 Display features 24 booster packs with cards from nearly 200 set symbols across Magic’s history. Each 15-card pack includes a white-border card, a playtest card, and a Future Sight frame card that could even appear as one of 15 exclusive foils. Every pack feels like a detour through the Multiverse, with familiar favorites, unexpected finds, and a few beautiful sights along the way.\r\n<br>You’ll also receive Wild in Bloom, a Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop available only through Festival in a Box: Amsterdam 2026. Celebrate lands, growth, and the magic that takes root when nature is left to flourish with warm orange hues and lush art. These cards turn every land drop into something worth stopping to admire.\r\n<br>And there’s more to discover. Llanowar Elves arrives in Future Sight frame foil, Utopia Sprawl stretches across a textless full-art scene, and Atraxa, Praetors’ Voice makes a grand entrance in retro movie poster style. Plus, Bicycle Elemental rolls in as a hand-drawn sticker-look playtest card, because it wouldn’t be Amsterdam without a bike or two.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Mystery Booster 2 Display\r\n<br>• 1x Wild in Bloom Foil Edition Secret Lair Drop:\r\n<br>• 1x Nissa, Resurgent Animist\r\n<br>•1x Ramunap Excavator\r\n<br>• 1x Six\r\n<br>• 1x Tireless Provisioner\r\n<br>•1x Titania, Protector of Argoth\r\n<br>•4x Promo Cards:\r\n<br>•1x Foil Llanowar Elves\r\n<br>•1x Foil Utopia Sprawl\r\n<br>•1x Foil Atraxa, Praetors’ Voice\r\n<br>•1x Bicycle Elemental Playtest Card"}]},{"productId":703903,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Wild in Bloom - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Wild in Bloom Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/703903_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/703903/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-wild-in-bloom-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-07T16:02:25.683","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Nissa, Resurgent Animist\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ramunap Excavator\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Six\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tireless Provisioner\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Titania, Protector of Argoth"}]},{"productId":704154,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Marvel: Spinner Rack Specials - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Marvel Spinner Rack Specials Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/704154_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/704154/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvel-spinner-rack-specials-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-07-24T04:10:37.637","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2026-07-24T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The spinner rack is an icon of comic shops everywhere: bright covers, bold characters, and the pure joy of finding the exact issue you didn’t know you were looking for.\r\n<br>Annie Wu captures that feeling with all-new borderless art for five cards from Magic: The Gathering® | Marvel Super Heroes. Printed with the spirit of retro newsprint comics, this drop brings together street-level schemes, graveyard shadows, reality-bending magic, heroic teamwork, and a headquarters with a very specific favorite number.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hammerhead, Maggia Boss\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Undead Hand Ninja\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hex Magic\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tippy-Toe, Terrific Partner\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Baxter Building"}]},{"productId":704918,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women: Their Magic is Limitless - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women Their Magic is Limitless Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/704918_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/704918/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-global-fund-for-women-their-magic-is-limitless-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-03T19:57:56.2","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Across the Multiverse, women lead, teach, protect, create, and carry one another forward. Their limitless strength can be found in mentorship, family, collaboration, care, legacy, and power shared across generations. From Lathril training her daughter to Liliana commanding the next generation of necromancers, from Saheeli and Breya joining brilliance to Vivien rising in fury to protect an ally, each card celebrates a different expression of women standing together.\r\n<br>Art by Magali Villeneuve, Fury Galluzzi, Ivy Dolamore, Caroline Gariba, Lena Richards, Livia Prima, & Julie Dillon.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Dark Ritual\r\n<br>• 1x Cultivate\r\n<br>• 1x Finale of Devastation\r\n<br>• 1x Lathril, Blade of the Elves\r\n<br>• 1x Coat of Arms\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Path of Ancestry"}]},{"productId":704919,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women: Their Magic is Limitless - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women Their Magic is Limitless Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/704919_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/704919/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-global-fund-for-women-their-magic-is-limitless-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-03T19:57:48.12","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Di