1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706573/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-marvel-spinner-rack-specials-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:30:04.953","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>The spinner rack is an icon of comic shops everywhere: bright covers, bold characters, and the pure joy of finding the exact issue you didn’t know you were looking for.\r\n<br>Annie Wu captures that feeling with all-new borderless art for five cards from Magic: The Gathering® | Marvel Super Heroes. Printed with the spirit of retro newsprint comics, this drop brings together street-level schemes, graveyard shadows, reality-bending magic, heroic teamwork, and a headquarters with a very specific favorite number.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hammerhead, Maggia Boss\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Undead Hand Ninja\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Hex Magic\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Tippy-Toe, Terrific Partner\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Baxter Building"}]},{"productId":707157,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women Together Across The Multiverse Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Global Fund for Women Together Across The Multiverse Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707157_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707157/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-global-fund-for-women-together-across-the-multiverse-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-08-03T19:56:29.373","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Some magic grows stronger in good company. This bundle brings together the non-foil and foil editions of Their Magic is Limitless, carrying its celebration of mentorship, legacy, creativity, and women standing together across the Multiverse in full.\r\n<br>Art by Magali Villeneuve, Fury Galluzzi, Ivy Dolamore, Caroline Gariba, Lena Richards, Livia Prima, & Julie Dillon.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Their Magic is Limitless\r\n<br>• 1x Their Magic is Limitless Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":707160,"name":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Grandpa Would Be Proud Everything Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Grandpa Would Be Proud Everything Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707160_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707160/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-superdrop-of-the-moonlight-jellies-grandpa-would-be-proud-everything-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:38:30.67","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>A full inventory, a full chest, and somehow still one more thing to pick up. This bundle brings the whole Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies together in both foil and non-foil, from morning routines to small-town obligations to the kind of underground decisions best made with a weapon equipped.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":707161,"name":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Prismatic Shard Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Prismatic Shard Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707161_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707161/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-superdrop-of-the-moonlight-jellies-prismatic-shard-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:58.813","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Stardew Valley has always known how to make light feel like part of the world: jellyfish drifting past the docks, crystals deep in the mines, fireflies in the Secret Woods, and festival lanterns after dark. This bundle brings together every foil drop from the Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies with that same gentle glow.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town Foil Edition\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep Foil Edition"}]},{"productId":707162,"name":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Traveling Cart Non-Foil Bundle","cleanName":"Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Superdrop of the Moonlight Jellies Traveling Cart Non Foil Bundle","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707162_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707162/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-superdrop-of-the-moonlight-jellies-traveling-cart-non-foil-bundle","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:51.557","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley \r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town\r\n<br>• 1x Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep"}]},{"productId":707163,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Welcome to Stardew Valley Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707163_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707163/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-welcome-to-stardew-valley-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:46","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Welcome to Stardew Valley, where every day asks for something different. Plant the parsnips. Check the mail. Bring someone a gift you’re pretty sure they’ll like. Wander into town with dirt on your boots and come home with a recipe, a new friend, or a problem that somehow involves a wizard. Before long, the farm is more than a place to make a living. It’s a rhythm, a refuge, and occasionally the source of extremely suspicious noises after dark.\r\n<br>Illustrated by ConcernedApe in a style that feels pulled straight from the valley itself, these cards turn farming, foraging, friendship, and small-town mystery into Magic. The new-to-Magic design, Stardew Valley, follows that same daily rhythm: a little help becomes food, a thoughtful offering draws you deeper into the day, and something of your own may find its way across the table. Around here, a good harvest matters—but knowing what to give, when to give it, and who might appreciate it is part of the work too.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Stardew Valley\r\n<br>• 1x Wedding Ring as \"Mermaid's Pendant\"\r\n<br>• 1x Dawn's Truce as \"Pierre's Truce\"\r\n<br>• 1x Swords to Plowshares\r\n<br>• 1x Rites of Flourishing\r\n<br>• 1x Kynaios and Tiro of Meletis as \"The Welcoming Committee\"\r\n<br>• 1x Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Food Token"}]},{"productId":707164,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Welcome to Stardew Valley - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Welcome to Stardew Valley Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707164_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707164/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-welcome-to-stardew-valley-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:39.873","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Welcome to Stardew Valley, where every day asks for something different. Plant the parsnips. Check the mail. Bring someone a gift you’re pretty sure they’ll like. Wander into town with dirt on your boots and come home with a recipe, a new friend, or a problem that somehow involves a wizard. Before long, the farm is more than a place to make a living. It’s a rhythm, a refuge, and occasionally the source of extremely suspicious noises after dark.\r\n<br>Illustrated by ConcernedApe in a style that feels pulled straight from the valley itself, these cards turn farming, foraging, friendship, and small-town mystery into Magic. The new-to-Magic design, Stardew Valley, follows that same daily rhythm: a little help becomes food, a thoughtful offering draws you deeper into the day, and something of your own may find its way across the table. Around here, a good harvest matters—but knowing what to give, when to give it, and who might appreciate it is part of the work too.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Stardew Valley\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Wedding Ring as \"Mermaid's Pendant\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Dawn's Truce as \"Pierre's Truce\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Swords to Plowshares\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Rites of Flourishing\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Kynaios and Tiro of Meletis as \"The Welcoming Committee\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sol Ring\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Food Token"}]},{"productId":707165,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Life in Pelican Town Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707165_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707165/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-life-in-pelican-town-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:34.05","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Life in Pelican Town is peaceful in the way only a small town can be: beautiful, welcoming, and absolutely impossible to mind your own business in.\r\n<br>There’s always somewhere to go and something that needs doing. Help rebuild the Community Center. Stop by Pierre’s for seeds, unless it’s Wednesday, in which case you should have planned better. Swing by Clint’s Blacksmith with a geode and the quiet hope that this one is finally worth it. Take the long way through town and somehow turn one errand into a favor, a festival reminder, a stop at The Stardrop Saloon, and a trip to the Wizard’s tower that somehow becomes part of the routine. Pelican Town is small, but it has a way of filling the whole day. John Di Giovanni, Luc Courtois, and Slavek Fedorczuk make every familiar stop worth the detour.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Crop Rotation\r\n<br>• 1x Fountainport as \"Community Center\"\r\n<br>• 1x Homeward Path as \"Pelican Town\"\r\n<br>• 1x Command Tower as \"Tower of Rasmodius\"\r\n<br>• 1x Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth as \"Valley Farmstead\""}]},{"productId":707167,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: Life in Pelican Town - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley Life in Pelican Town Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707167_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707167/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-life-in-pelican-town-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:28.293","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Life in Pelican Town is peaceful in the way only a small town can be: beautiful, welcoming, and absolutely impossible to mind your own business in.\r\n<br>There’s always somewhere to go and something that needs doing. Help rebuild the Community Center. Stop by Pierre’s for seeds, unless it’s Wednesday, in which case you should have planned better. Swing by Clint’s Blacksmith with a geode and the quiet hope that this one is finally worth it. Take the long way through town and somehow turn one errand into a favor, a festival reminder, a stop at The Stardrop Saloon, and a trip to the Wizard’s tower that somehow becomes part of the routine. Pelican Town is small, but it has a way of filling the whole day. John Di Giovanni, Luc Courtois, and Slavek Fedorczuk make every familiar stop worth the detour.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Crop Rotation\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Fountainport as \"Community Center\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Homeward Path as \"Pelican Town\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Command Tower as \"Tower of Rasmodius\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth as \"Valley Farmstead\""}]},{"productId":707168,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley A Flicker in the Deep Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707168_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707168/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-a-flicker-in-the-deep-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:22.15","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Not everything in the valley grows in sunlight.\r\n<br>Away from the soft edges of Pelican Town, the world gets darker, stranger, and a lot less concerned with being welcoming. Stone gives way to shadow, shadow gives way to movement, and every glint in the dark asks the same question: is it treasure, trouble, or both? The answer is usually both.\r\n<br>Daniel Romanovsky, Brandon Le, Nathaniel Himawan, Pauline Voss, Elaine Chérie, Gemi, and Sylvain Sarrailh follow that glow through the valley’s deepest corners, where a good swing, a lucky find, and just enough nerve can turn one more dangerous floor into exactly the kind of questionable decision worth remembering.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Atsushi, the Blazing Sky as \"Royal Serpent\"\r\n<br>• 1x Mitotic Slime as \"Big Slime\"\r\n<br>• 1x Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Sword of Forge and Frontier as \"Galaxy Sword\"\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure Vault\r\n<br>• 1x Ooze Token\r\n<br>• 1x Treasure Token"}]},{"productId":707169,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x Stardew Valley: A Flicker in the Deep - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x Stardew Valley A Flicker in the Deep Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707169_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707169/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-stardew-valley-a-flicker-in-the-deep-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-10-19T19:37:15.923","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Not everything in the valley grows in sunlight.\r\n<br>Away from the soft edges of Pelican Town, the world gets darker, stranger, and a lot less concerned with being welcoming. Stone gives way to shadow, shadow gives way to movement, and every glint in the dark asks the same question: is it treasure, trouble, or both? The answer is usually both.\r\n<br>Daniel Romanovsky, Brandon Le, Nathaniel Himawan, Pauline Voss, Elaine Chérie, Gemi, and Sylvain Sarrailh follow that glow through the valley’s deepest corners, where a good swing, a lucky find, and just enough nerve can turn one more dangerous floor into exactly the kind of questionable decision worth remembering.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Atsushi, the Blazing Sky as \"Royal Serpent\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Mitotic Slime as \"Big Slime\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Arcane Signet\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Sword of Forge and Frontier as \"Galaxy Sword\"\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Treasure Vault\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Ooze Token\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Treasure Token"}]},{"productId":707501,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x The Hobbit: Second Breakfast and Beyond - Non-Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x The Hobbit Second Breakfast and Beyond Non Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707501_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707501/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-the-hobbit-second-breakfast-and-beyond-non-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-21T04:10:19.63","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2026-08-21T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>An adventure may be unavoidable, but skipping breakfast is simply out of the question.\r\n<br>Hobbits understand that a day is only as strong as the meals holding it together: breakfast, Second Breakfast, Elevenses, luncheon, afternoon tea, dinner, and supper. In the hands of Raymond Bonilla, Ben Wootten, and Randy Gallegos, every proper meal gets its due. Other folk may call that excessive. Other folk are wrong.\r\n<br>From well-stocked pantries to road-worn provisions, every bite is a small act of courage against the dreadful possibility of being hungry somewhere inconvenient. Whether you are leaving Bag End in a hurry, keeping pace with thirteen Dwarves, or trying to enjoy one peaceful meal before the next adventure arrives, it is always wise to pack a little extra.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 7x Food Tokens\r\n\r\n<br><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:red\">When purchasing this unique product,</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color:red\"> please keep in mind that this Secret Lair Drop Series Sealed Product will ship out to you <em>after</em> the seller receives the product directly from Wizards of the Coast.</span</em><br><br><em><span style=\"color:red\"> The estimated time frame for sellers to receive stock is not fixed, so it could be anywhere between 1 - 10 weeks for delivery.</span></em></strong>"}]},{"productId":707502,"name":"Secret Lair Drop: Secret Lair x The Hobbit: Second Breakfast and Beyond - Traditional Foil Edition","cleanName":"Secret Lair Drop Secret Lair x The Hobbit Second Breakfast and Beyond Traditional Foil Edition","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707502_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707502/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-drop-secret-lair-x-the-hobbit-second-breakfast-and-beyond-traditional-foil-edition","modifiedOn":"2026-08-21T04:10:19.63","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2026-08-21T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>An adventure may be unavoidable, but skipping breakfast is simply out of the question.\r\n<br>Hobbits understand that a day is only as strong as the meals holding it together: breakfast, Second Breakfast, Elevenses, luncheon, afternoon tea, dinner, and supper. In the hands of Raymond Bonilla, Ben Wootten, and Randy Gallegos, every proper meal gets its due. Other folk may call that excessive. Other folk are wrong.\r\n<br>From well-stocked pantries to road-worn provisions, every bite is a small act of courage against the dreadful possibility of being hungry somewhere inconvenient. Whether you are leaving Bag End in a hurry, keeping pace with thirteen Dwarves, or trying to enjoy one peaceful meal before the next adventure arrives, it is always wise to pack a little extra.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 7x Foil Food Tokens\r\n\r\n<br><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:red\">When purchasing this unique product,</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color:red\"> please keep in mind that this Secret Lair Drop Series Sealed Product will ship out to you <em>after</em> the seller receives the product directly from Wizards of the Coast.</span</em><br><br><em><span style=\"color:red\"> The estimated time frame for sellers to receive stock is not fixed, so it could be anywhere between 1 - 10 weeks for delivery.</span></em></strong>"}]},{"productId":709981,"name":"Secret Lair Commander Deck: Hatsune Miku","cleanName":"Secret Lair Commander Deck Hatsune Miku","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/709981_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2576,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/709981/magic-secret-lair-drop-series-secret-lair-commander-deck-hatsune-miku","modifiedOn":"2026-11-13T13:38:24.043","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"<strong>Product Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Product packaging may vary.</em>\r\n<br>Hatsune Miku has a way of becoming whatever the moment calls for: singer, symbol, racing mascot, snow festival icon, and living proof that one look is never enough. Secret Lair Commander Deck: Hatsune Miku brings that many-sided history to a green-white Commander deck built around creatures, tokens, and lifegain.\r\n<br>Every creature adds another voice. Every token adds another harmony. Soon the battlefield is carrying Angels, Horses, Citizens, Elves, and a life total rising in step with the whole production.\r\n<br>With new art by KEI, Miku’s first software package illustrator, alongside YUCHI YUKI, NOMISAKI, TOMOYO ASATANI, ESSUAL, KAORU HAGIYA, YUU FUJIKI, YOSUKE ADACHI, HASSAN, NAOKI SAITO, NAKAMURA8, NEMUSUKE, YUICHI MURAKAMI, YOSHIRO AMBE, plus borderless basic lands featuring Miku, this deck has plenty of looks, plenty of life, and very little interest in staying small.\r\n<br>Contents:\r\n<br>• 1x Ready-to-play 100-card Commander deck\r\n<br>• 12x Foil borderless cards featuring new artwork\r\n<br>• 7x Foil borderless basic Plains featuring new artwork\r\n<br>• 7x Foil borderless basic Forests featuring new artwork\r\n<br>• 74x Non-foil reprints\r\n<br>• 10x Non-foil double-sided tokens\r\n<br>• 1x Trostani, Selesnya's Voice as \"Miku, Song of the People\" display commander (not legal i